var e={selector:{label:`Dooro luuqadda`},verdict:{headline:`Alberta waxay dib u sawiraysaa khariidaddeeda doorashada.`,p_what:`Mar mar gobolku wuxuu dib u sawiraa riding-yadiisa — aagagga maxalliga ah ee mid kastaa doorto hal MLA. Halka khadadku ku dhacaan ayaa go'aamiya cidda aad la codeyso, iyo cidda kaaga matala golaha sharci dejinta.`,p_split:`Markan, guddida dib-u-sawirka samaynaysay way kala qaybsantay. Waxay soo saartay laba khariidadood oo iska tartamaya — hubintaniyuna labadaba way tijaabinaysaa.`,p_question:`Labada khariidadood waxaynu u tijaabinnay hal su'aal: mid kasta ma loo qaabeeyey si xisbi loo doorbido — xitaa haddii aanay qofna ula jeedin inuu sidaas sameeyo?`,p_answer:`Labada midkood waa. Kan kale wuxuu u eg yahay mid caadi ah.`,p_howfar:`Kombuyuutar ayaa si bakhtiyaanasiib ah u sawiray 1.01 milyan oo nooc sharci ah oo khariidadda ah. Labada khariidadood ee dhabta ah midkood wuu ka sii jihaysan yahay dhammaan ku dhowaad 1 oo 350,000 kasta, jihada UCP loo doorbidayo. Kan kale wuxuu ku jiraa kala-duwanaanta caadiga ah.`,aside_pre:`Waxaad odhan kartaa khariidad sidaas u eg `,aside_post:`. Ereygaasi macno sharci ma laha Kanada, sidaa darteed uma isticmaalno sidii gunaanad. Waxaynu ku tusaynaa waxa khariidaddu sameyso; adiga ayaa xukma. Lakabyada qoto dheer — waxa sharcigu dhab ahaan rabo, iyo si sax ah sida aan tijaabada u sameynay — eeg `,box_heading:`Waxa aan dhihi karno iyo waxa aan dhihi karin`,box_can_1:`Khariidadda laga yar yahay waxay ka baxsan tahay waxa 1.01 milyan oo khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah soo saaraan, jihada UCP loo doorbidayo.`,box_can_2:`Afarta cabbir ee caddaaladda xisbiyeed oo dhammu waxay tilmaamayaan isla jihada.`,box_cant_1:`In la-taliye kasta tan ula jeeday — hubintu waxay akhrida natiijooyinka, ma aha niyada.`,box_cant_2:`In khariidaddu "tahay" qaybsi siyaasadeed — taasi maaha qayb uu sharciga Kanada aqoonsado.`,box_cant_3:`Sida maxkamadi u xukumi laheyd, ama waxa guddidu dooran doonto.`,law_link:`Sharci`,methods_link:`Hababka`},why_redrawn:{heading:`Sababta tani u dhacdo — iyo sababta ay kuu taabato`,p1:`Alberta waxa loo qaybiyey 87 riding. Mid kastaa wuxuu doortaa hal MLA oo aada golaha sharci dejinta. Riding-kaagu wuxuu go'aamiyaa cidda qofkaasi yahay, xaafadaha lagugu daro, iyo cidda welwelkooda MLA-gaagu marka hore maqlo.`,p2:`Khadadku ma joogto. Markii ay dadku guuraan oo magaalooyinku koraan, riding-yada qaarkood waxay ku dhammaadaan codbixiyayaal aad uga badan kuwa kale, sidaa darteed gobolku wuxuu khariidadda dib u sawiraa dhowr sano kasta si uu u sii haysto inay si dhow u sinnaadaan. Guddi la-taliyeyaal ah ayaa sawira, oo ka shaqeeya shuruuc sharci lagu dejiyay: degmooyinku waa inay dadnimo u dhow yihiin, mid noqdaan, oo bulshooyinka dhabta ah si wadajir ah u hayaan markii ay awoodi karaan.`,p3:`Kaasi waa habraaca caadiga ah. Markan wuu jabay. La-taliyayaashu ma heshiin karin, waxayna u kala qaybsameen laba kooxood, mid kastaa wuxuu lahaa khariidaddiisa. Markaas guddi MLA-yo ah ayaa labadaba khariidadood dib u dhigay oo bilaabay inay sawiraan mid u gaar ah, oo ka sii weyn. In guddi sharci dejineed uu sidaas guddida uga gudbo waa wax naadir ah.`,p4:`Khad ku yaal khariidad wuxuu go'aamiyaa cidda codkeedu wax u taro. Wuxuu codbixiyayaasha bulsho wadajir u hayn karaa, ama ku kala firdhin karaa dhowr degmo halka tiradoodu aanay wax badan ku darin. Wuxuu tartan qaar dhow ka dhigi karaa qaar kalena ka fogeyn karaa gacanta. Midna kuma muuqato dusha sare; waxa go'aamiya halka xudduuduhu ku dhacaan.`},two_maps:{heading:`Laba khariidadood — iyo cidda sawiratay`,p1:`Markii guddidu kala qaybsantay, ma aysan soo saarin hal khariidad oo lagu lifaaqay diidmo. Waxay soo saartay laba khariidadood oo dhammaystiran oo iska tartamaya. Labaduba waa sharci. Kaliya waxay khadadka si kala duwan u sawiraan.`,p2:`Guddida xudduuduhu wuxuu leeyahay shan xubnood. Garsoore Madaxa ah ee Alberta wuxuu magacaabaa guddoomiyaha — kursiga dhexdhexaadka ah, oo halkan uu hayo Dallas K. Miller, garsoore hore oo Court of King's Bench. Xisbiga xukunka hayaa wuxuu magacaabaa laba xubnood; mucaaridkuna wuxuu magacaabaa laba.`,p3:`Guddidan waxay u kala qaybsantay saddex iyo laba. Guddoomiyaha iyo labada xubnood ee mucaaridku magacaabay ayaa taageeray hal khariidad — warbixinta inta badan, maxaa yeelay inta badan guddidu way saxiixday. Labada xubnood ee dawladdu magacaabay ayaa taageeray kan kale — warbixinta laga yar yahay.`,p4:`Khariidadda hubintu calaamadeyso inay tahay tan ugu sii jihaysan waa warbixinta laga yar yahay — tan ay sawireen labada xubnood ee dawladdu magacaabay. Hubintu ma muujin karto inay sidaas ula jeedeen, mana isku daydo. Waxay muujisaa waxa khariidaddu sameyso.`,p5:`Khariidadda jaldiga ee bogga sare waxay kuu oggolaanaysaa inaad adiga is barbar dhigto. Iska beddel labada soo jeedin iyo khariidadda maanta, hel riding-kaaga, oo daawo xaafadaha la isugu daro ama la kala qaybiyo.`,p6:`Guddi MLA-yo ah ayaa tan iyo markaas labada khariidadood dib u dhigay si ay u sawiraan mid u gaar ah, oo la filayo dabayaaqada 2026 — dhaqdhaqaaq uu bogganu ka eego bogga Sharciga. Labadan waxay sii ahaanayaan kiiska tijaabada ee ugu cad ee hubinta, isla tijaabooyinkana waxay ku dabaqi doonaan wax kasta oo guddidu soo saarto.`},disclaimer:{text:`Bogga waxa turjumay AI. Qaar ka mid ah waxa ku jira ayaa weli ku soo bixi kara Ingiriisi inta turjumaadda lagu jiro. Haddii aad aragto khaladaad ama aad rabto inaad ka caawiso turjumaadda mashruucan, fadlan %s.`,link_label:`nala soo xidhiidh`,word_count:`Si aad u qiyaasto cabbirka: qoraalka Ingiriisiga ah waa qiyaastii {count} eray. Waxaad ku soo biiri kartaa dhammaantii ama qayb kaliya — inta badan shaqadu waa saxitaanka khaladaad yaryar ee mashiinku sameeyay, ma aha turjumaad cusub oo aan waxba ka bilaaban.`},epigraph:{heading:`Sida loo akhriyo khariidaddan`,reader:`Dhulku ma codeeyo. Midabaynta khariidadda sidan oo kale waxay kaliya ka dhigaysaa Alberta miyiga inay u muuqato mid ka weyn inta ay dhab ahaantii tahay. Dhulka madhan ka tag isagoo madhan.`,reader_label:`akhriste`,author_p1:`Caddaalad — taasina waa waxa khariidaddu sameyso si sax ah. Waxaa laga dhisay joomatari iyo tirooyin ay Elections Alberta lahaan tahay, oo ah heerka kaliya ee ay hayaan: imisa qof ayaa ka codeeyay aag kasta oo codbixin, iyo sidee. Midabku wuxuu ku socdaa heer u dhexeeya labada xisbi, qoto-dheeradiisuna waxay raacaysaa tirada dadka — taasina waa sababta magaalooyinku u dhalaalaan, miyiga furanna u sii dhalaalo mid khafiif ah.`,author_p2:`Dhulka galbeed ka xiga Ponoka waa caddaan saafi ah: ma jiro xarun codbixin, ma jiro qof la diiwaangeliyay inuu halkaas ku noolyahay ama ka codeeyay. Wuxuu u madhan yahay si sax ah sababta oo ah dhulku ma codeeyo. Ujeeddadu ma aha in la fasiro xogta, ee kaliya in loo daayo inay ku hadasho heerka lagu duubay — iyo in lagaaga tago mid wax yar ka caqli badan intii aad u timid.`,author_label:`qoraaga`,ethic:`Taasi waa ballanqaadka ka dambeeya hubinta oo dhan: khariidee nidaamka, oo u daa xogta inay isu hadasho — wax ka badan inta ay ogolaato maaha.`},opener:{heading:`Yaa loogu talagalay?`,body:`Innaga. Innaga oo dhan. Dadka miyiga ah, dadka magaalada, kuwa xiisaha leh, khabiirada, saxafiyiinta, qareennada, cilmibaadhayaasha, siyaasiyiinta — innaga oo dhan. Maxaa yeelay way na saameysaa innaga oo dhan. Hadday tahay aad jeceshahay xisbiga xukunka haya iyo haba yaraatee, waxa ay guddida kala qaybsantay soo saartay marna hore looma samayn. Waxa nasiibsiisay fursad aan ku eegno mishiinka gudaha sida aanan hore awoodi karin. Hadda waxaynu dejin karnaa heer cabbir oo aasaasi ah — silsilad imtixaano ah, oo wax kasta oo soo socda lagu cabbiri karo. Aan ku tuso waxa aan helay.`},stakes:{q1:{heading:`Khariidadda la soo jeediyay ma waa qaybsi siyaasadeed (gerrymander)?`,body:`"Gerrymander" ma aha erey ay maxkamadaha Kanada isticmaalaan, hubintanina uma adeegsato sidii xukun. Waxa hubintu sheegi karto waa mid ka cidhiidhi badan oo xaqiiqo ah: afar ka mid ah shanta imtixaan ee qaab-dhismeedka ee ay socodsiiso ayaa calaamadeeya <em>soo jeedinta laga yar yahay</em>, midna ma calaamadayso beddelka kale (<em>soo jeedinta inta badan</em>); imtixaanka shanaad waa dhexdhexaad labadaba. In qaabkaasi gaadho heerka waxa dadku si aan rasmi ahayn ugu jeedaan "gerrymander" waa go'aan ay hubintu uga tagto akhristaha.`,footnote:`Magacyada "inta badan" iyo "laga yar yahay" waxay ka yimaadeen kala qaybsanaan 3–2 oo ka dhex dhacday Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada (oo uu guddoominayay Garsoore Miller), oo soo saartay laba soo jeedin oo iska soo horjeeda halkii ay ka soo bixi lahayd talo keliya. Golaha Sharci dejinta ayaa labadaba dib u dhigay oo dib-u-qaybinta u gudbiyay guddi ka kooban shan xubnood oo MLA ah (xubnaha golaha sharci dejinta gobolka) oo uu guddoominayo Brandon Lunty (MLA UCP ah); guddiga waxa uu kormeerayaa Guddi Madax-bannaan oo Talo-bixin ah oo ka kooban afar qof — laba uu magacaabay Ra'iisul Wasaaraha (Sharafta leh Monte Solberg iyo Darwin Durnie), laba uu magacaabay Hogaamiyaha Mucaaridka (Dr. Gerard Kennedy iyo Brent Robinson) — oo loo xilsaaray inay soo saaraan soo jeedin cusub oo 91 kursi ah ka hor inta aan la gaarin xilliga kama-dambaysta ah ee Noofembar 2026.`},q2:{heading:`Maxay "gerrymander" ka tartaa sharciga Kanada?`,body:`Macno gaar ah uma jiro. Imtixaanka Kanada waa kala duwan yahay: in xudduudaha siiyaan codbixiyayaasha <em>matalaad waxtar leh</em> sida ku cad qaybta 3 ee Axdiga Xuquuqda. Soo jeedinta laga yar yahay waxay kor u qaaddaa su'aalo dhab ah oo ku saabsan halbeegga matalaadda waxtarka leh; kaliya garsoore ayaa si gunaanad ah uga jawaabi kara, weligiina ma jiro mid waydiiyay.`},q3:{heading:`Maxaa khatar ah ee ku saabsan dadka Alberta?`,body:`Marka codka gobolka uu yahay 50/50, cabbirrada hubintu waxay soo jeedinta laga yar yahay meeleeyaan meel qaab-dhismeed ahaan xad-dhaaf ah: in ka yar 100 khariidad oo ka mid ah 1.01 milyan khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah oo isbarbardhig loo isticmaalo ayaa soo saara nooca isle'egta kursiyada. Isle'egtaasi waxay muhiim u tahay maxaa yeelay aqlabiyad 60-ka-89 ah waxay ka tagtaa mucaarid astaan keliya ah waxayna xaqiiqo ahaan ka dhowrsan tahay is-khilaafka gudaha — ma aha sababtoo ah ay ka gudbayso heer gaar ah (Golaha Alberta ma laha xeer saddex-meelood-laba ah; isla awoodaha habraaca ayaa loo hayaa aqlabiyad fudud). In jiidashada soo jeedinta laga yar yahay ay weyn tahay si ay xisbi gaadhsiiso heerka 60 kursi ee qaybinta codka <em>aan ahayn</em> 50/50 waa su'aal aanay hubintani imtixaamin weli. In isle'egtaasi la aqbali karo waa su'aal loogu talagalay dadka Alberta, maaha hubintan.`},cta_law:`Akhri macnaha sharciga →`,cta_methods:`Eeg sida aan u tijaabinnay →`,scorecard_h:`Kaarka buundooyinka`,scorecard_fig_alt:`Khariidad firidhsan: farqiga waxtarka oo ku yaal toosanaha jiifa, tirada imtixaanada qaab-dhismeedka ee la dhicid oo ku taal toosanaha taagan. Khariidaddii la dejiyay ee 2019 iyo khariidadda inta badan ee 2026 waxay ku urursan yihiin geeska ammaanka ah ee hoose-bidix. Khariidadda laga yar yahay ee 2026 waxay keligeed ku taal gobolka aan caadiga ahayn ee sare-midig.`,scorecard_fig_caption:`Labada waddo hal sawir. Toosan: inta uu eexday tirada caddaaladda xisbiyeed (midig = sida UCP loo doorbidayo). Taagan: imtixaanada caddaaladda qaab-dhismeedka ee shanta ah inta khariidaddu kasoo dhacday. Hoose-bidix waa geeska ammaanka oo habraacyada dhexdhexaadka ahi caadi ahaan ku soo dhacaan; sare-midig waa gobolka aan caadiga ahayn. Khariidaddii la dejiyay ee 2019 iyo inta badan ee 2026 way ku jiraan geeska ammaanka. Inta yar ee 2026 waxay keligeed ku taal gobolka aan caadiga ahayn.`,scorecard_intro:`Laba cabbir oo madax-bannaan ayaa lagu dabaqay labada khariidadood iyada oo la isticmaalayo isla xadadka horay loo diiwaan-geliyay. Qaab-dhismeedku wuxuu adeegsadaa kaliya shaqalka khadadka — ma jirto natiijo doorasho. Tirooyinku waxay tijaabiyaan sida xariiqdu codadka kursiyaal ugu beddesho. Labada waddo waxay gaaraan isla gunaanad.`,scorecard_close:`Laba cabbir oo madax-bannaan, hal jawaab. Isuduwistaani waa calaamadda keligeed ugu xooggan ee hubinta.`},top_callouts:{gerrymander_lead:`Khariidadda laga yar yahay ma waa qaybsi siyaasadeed?`,gerrymander_body:`Buundada wadareed ee eexda xisbiyeed ee hubinta, khariidadda laga yar yahay ee guddidu waxay ku jirtaa dabada xad-dhaafka ah ee 1,010,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah oo algorithm ku sawiray — qiyaastii 66 ka mid ah ayaa gaadha qiimaha seats@50/50 ee heerka rogaalka, oo leh xad sare wadareed oo isku-xidhnaanta-xasil oo qiyaastii ah 1 ka&nbsp;mid&nbsp;ah 350,000 hoosta qaybinta tixraacaas. Khariidadda inta badan waxay si fiican ugu jirtaa kala-duwanaanta caadiga ah.`,tldr_label:`Soo koobid`,tldr_p1:`Guddida dib-u-qaybinta ee Alberta waxay u kala qaybsantay 3&ndash;2 sannadkii 2026 oo waxay soo saartay laba khariidadood oo kala duwan. Dawladda ayaa labadaba dib u dhigtay oo dib-u-qaybintii u gudbisay guddi shan xubnood oo MLA ah (guddiga Lunty), oo la filayo inay warbixintooda soo saaraan Noofembar 2026. Midkoodna khariidadaha guddida ma aha sharci.`,tldr_p2:`Hubintani waxay labada khariidadood ee guddida si isku mid ah u tijaabisay, iyada oo isticmaalaysa 1,010,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah oo kombuyuutar sawiray oo laga dhisay shaybaadhka rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta sida tixraac. Soo jeedinta inta badan waxay ku jirtaa kala-duwanaanta dhexdhexaadka ah imtixaan kasta oo horay loo diiwaan-geliyay. Soo jeedinta laga yar yahay waxay ka gudubtaa afar ka mid ah shanta imtixaan ee qaab-dhismeed, kala-qaybinta kursi ee caddaaladda xisbiyeed ee cod 50/50-na waxaa gaadha qiyaastii 66 ka mid ah 1,010,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah — xad sare wadareed oo isku-xidhnaanta-xasil oo qiyaastii ah 1 ka mid ah 350,000 hoosta qaybinta tixraacaas. Cabbirka farqiga-waxtarka ee hubinta ee inta yar wuxuu ku yaal 94-aad centile — <em>u dhow, laakiin ka hooseeya</em>, xadka 95-aad centile ee hubinta lafteeda.`,tldr_p3:`Hubinta waxay cabbirtaa natiijooyinka, ma aha niyadda. Marka guddiga Lunty uu sii daayo khariidadiisa, hubintani waxay ku dabaqi doontaa isla imtixaanada.`,tldr_footer:`Shuruudaha been-abuurka ee horay loo diiwaan-geliyay iyo ballamaha laga noqonayo waxay ku jiraan %s.`,tldr_footer_link:`§9`},head:{title:`Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta`,meta_description:`Hubin tirakoob oo ku saabsan guddida xudduudaha doorashada ee Alberta sannadkii 2026 — 1,010,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah, shaybaadhka rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta, imtixaano horay loo diiwaan-geliyay.`},nav:{skip_to_content:`U gudub waxa ku jira`,home_aria:`Ku noqo sare`,theme_aria:`Beddel qaab madow/iftiin`,theme_title:`Beddel qaabka madow`,nav_aria:`Fur tusmada`,drawer_top:`↑ Sare`,route_story:`Sheeko`,route_law:`Sharci`,route_methods:`Hababka`,stakes:`Khataraha`,findings:`Natiijooyinka`,history:`Taariikhda`,reform:`Isbeddel`,group_overview:`Guud`,group_audit:`Hubinta`,group_context:`Macnaha`,group_forward:`Hore u socoshada`,group_apparatus:`Qalabka`,why:`Muxuu muhiim u yahay?`,map:`Khariidadda hal jaleeco`,split:`Sida guddidu u kala qaybsantay`,litmus:`Imtixaanka Caddaynta ee 1,010,000-Khariidadood`,crack_pack:`Jeexitaan, urursi, miirid`,for_you:`Maxay tani kaa la macno tahay`,impact:`Saamaynta dhulka`,gerrymanders:`Qaybsiyaal siyaasadeed oo cad`,history_full:`Taariikhda qaybsiga siyaasadeed`,canada:`Kanada way kala duwan tahay`,lunty:`Lunty`,suggestions:`Soo jeedinno isbeddel`,retractions:`Ka noqosho`,references:`Tixraacyo`,technical:`Khayraad farsamo`,feedback:`Dir jawaab-celin`},hero:{h1:`Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta`,subtitle:`Guddida Alberta waxay soo saartay laba khariidadood oo degmooyin ah sannadkii 2026. Hubintani way isbarbar-dhigtay — iyada oo isticmaaleysa isla imtixaano, oo si siman loogu dabaqay labadaba — si ay u waydiiso in ay codbixiyayaasha si isku mid ah ula dhaqmaan.`,badge:`Khariidadaha rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta — La daabacay May 2026`,cover_note:`Guji si aad u weyneyso oo aad u baadho dhammaan saddexda soo jeedin ee xudduudaha si wadajir ah. Ku qabso muuqaalka kana boodbood khariidad ilaa khariidad — xudduuduhu way isbeddelaan, codbixiyayaashu way joogaan meeshay. U gunuus hoos si aad u aragto falanqaynta.`,cover_note_1:`Khariidaddani waa hawd-galka ugu fiican. Guji si aad u weyneyso oo aad u baadho. Badhamada sare waxay kala beddelaan khariidadda inta yar, khariidadda inta badan, iyo xudduudaha la dejiyay ee 2019 — ama dul-saar saddexdaba si aad u aragto si sax ah halka ay ku kala duwan yihiin. <strong>Detail</strong> wuxuu mid kasta oo aag codbixin ah u midaystaa sida dadku u codeeyeen 2023; <strong>Trend</strong> wuxuu ku daraa hadhka xisbiyeed degmo ahaan (buluug UCP, oranje NDP); <strong>Lines</strong> wuxuu daaraa oo demiyaa xudduudaha. <strong>Find</strong> wuxuu kuu boodaa degmo magaceeda.`,cover_note_2:`Isku day inaad xidho muuqaalka oo aad u beddesho khariidad ilaa khariidad — daawo xuduud isbeddelaya halka codbixiyayaasha hoosta ku jira ay weli joogaan. Su'aasha oo dhan, hal dhaqdhaqaaq.`,cover_note_3:`Markaad dhamayso baadhitaanka, hoos u gunuus si aad u aragto soo koobida. Falanqaynta farsameed ee dhammaystiran, eeg qaybta Khayraadka. Dhammaan xogtu waa shaybaadh rasmi ah ee Elections Alberta iyo diiwaanno kale oo dawladeed iyo kuwo bilaash ah.`,image_alt:`Khariidaduhu degmooyinka doorashada Alberta — soo jeedinta laga yar yahay ee guddida, oo lagu midaystay codka 2023`,map_hint:`Guji si aad si is dhexgal ah u baadho`,btn_title:`Guji si aad u furto khariidadda is dhexgalka ah`,btn_aria:`Guji si aad si is dhexgal ah u baadho`},boundary:{heading:`Waxa hubintani ku sheegi karto iyo waxa aysan kuu sheegi karin`,can_1:`Joomatariga khariidadda laga yar yahay waxa uu ka gudbaa 4 ka mid ah 5 xadadka qaab-dhismeedka ee horay loo diiwaan-geliyay <em>iyada oo aan la isticmaalin xog doorasho oo kasta</em>. Shanaadka (xajinta) waa dhexdhexaad. Inta badan waxay ka gudubtaa 0 ka mid ah 4-da dhacaya. Imtixaanadaasi waxay cabbiraan sifooyinka khadadka xudduudaha laftooda — qaabka degmada, xajinta dawladda hoose, faafinta dadka — oo waxay gaaraan gunaanadka ka hor inta aan cod la tirin.`,can_2:`Si gooni ah, marka xogta doorashada la keeno, khariidadda laga yar yahay waxay ku taal 99.99-aad centile ee 1.01 milyan oo khariidadood oo isbarbardhig ah oo algorithm ku sawiray oo lagu beegay isle'egnaanta dadnimada iyo isku-xirnaanta (ensemble-ku wuxuu dhaqan-geliyaa labadaas shuruud, ma aha shuruud kasta oo sharci sida danaha bulshada). Qiyaastii 66 ka mid ah 1.01 milyan oo khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah ayaa gaadha isla qiimaha seats@50/50. Xadka sare ee wadareed ee isku-xidhnaanta-xasil ee labada kanaal falanqeyn waa qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 350,000 hoosta qaybinta tixraacaas (p&nbsp;≤&nbsp;2.80×10<sup>−6</sup>). Laba qalab oo falanqeyn — joomatari iyo tirakoob — ayaa gaadha isla gunaanad jiho isku mid ah; xadka wadareedku waa soo koobida ka-warhaynta-isku-xidhnaanta ee isuduwiddaas, ma aha afar tijaabo oo madax-bannaan oo isku raacaya.`,can_3:`Saddex ka mid ah qaababka uu ku jiro soo jeedinta laga yar yahay waxa qoraal ahaan calaamadeeyay Guddoomiyaha Guddida, Garsoore Miller, qaybta §5.8.2 ee warbixinta inta badan iyo Lifaaqa C. Imtixaanada hubintu waxa la sameeyay iyada oo aan la ogeyn calaamadahiisa, waxana ay soo bandhigaan isla aagagga. Qalab saddexaad oo madax-bannaan — garsoorid — ayaa isugu yimaada isla xudduudaha.`,cant_1:`Hubintu ma <strong>caddayn karto</strong> in la-taliye kasta uu ula jeeday saamaynta xisbiyeed ee ay cabbirayso. Joomatariga xudduudu ma muujin karo niyad.`,cant_2:`Hubintu <strong>ma saadaaliso</strong> waxa guddiga Lunty doorto, waxa ay noqonayso doorashada Noofembar 2026, ama sida dadka Alberta uga falcelin doonaan.`,cant_3:`Hubintu <strong>ma saadaaliso</strong> sida maxkamadi ugu xukumi laheyd haddii doodda Axdiga lagu soo qaado mid kasta oo soo jeedinta ah.`,cant_4:`Hubintu <strong>ma</strong> sheegeyso in xadka isku-xidhnaanta-xasil ee qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 350,000 (p&nbsp;≤&nbsp;2.80×10<sup>−6</sup>) uu yahay itimaalka in qaybsi siyaasadeed dhacay. Tiradaasi waa itimaalka dabada ee joomatariga inta yar hoosta eber algorithm oo dhexdhexaad ah. Waa caddayn ah in eberka dhexdhexaadku aanu macquul ahayn. Ma aha itimaal dambe oo niyad xisbiyeed — su'aashaasi waxay u baahan tahay caddayn aanu joomatarigu bixin karin.`,cant_5:`Hubintu <strong>uma sheegto</strong> codbixiye kasta oo gaar ah qaabka uu qaadan lahaa ama waxa uu xogtan ka qaban lahaa. Doorashada waa adiga.`},editorial_intro:{heading:`Waa maxay dib-u-qaybinta, oo maxay muhiim u tahay`,p1:`Codbixiye kasta oo Alberta ku nool wuxuu ku nool yahay <em>degmo doorasho</em> — qayb ka mid ah gobolka oo dooran hal qof oo aada golaha sharci dejinta. Waxa jira 87 degmo. Degmo kasta waxay dooratta hal MLA. Marka aad doorasho gobol ku codeyso, waxaad doorato MLA-ga degmadaada. Dadka badan ee Alberta, kaasi waa xidhiidhka oo dhan ee golaha sharci dejinta: hal MLA, hal degmo, hal cod.`,p2:`Khadadka degmadaasi ma joogto. Dadku way guuraan, xaafadaha way koraan, aagagga miyiga way yaraadaan, magaalooyinku way fidaan. Sideed ilaa toban sano kasta, Alberta waa in ay dib u sawirto khadadka si degmo kasta ay u noqoto cabbir saxda ah oo ay ka tarjun karto sida dadka Alberta hadda u nool yihiin. Hay'adda samaysa dib-u-sawirka waa <em>Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> — guddi madax bannaan oo ka kooban garsoorayaal, qareeno, iyo xubno dadweyne ah, ma aha siyaasiyiin.`,p3:`Tani waa habraaca caadiga ah. Markan, habraaca caadigu wuxuu soo saaray wax aan caadi ahayn. Shanta xubnood ee guddidu waxay u kala qaybsanteen 3 ilaa 2 cidda khariidadu ay u muuqato, oo halkii ay ku heshiin lahaayeen hal talo waxay soo saareen laba: <em>soo jeedinta inta badan</em> (oo ay taageeraan saddex la-taliye) iyo <em>soo jeedinta laga yar yahay</em> (oo ay taageeraan laba). Labadaba waxay ku saaran yihiin miiska. Abriil 16, 2026 Golaha Sharci dejintu wuxuu ansixiyay Mooshin 19, oo labadaba dhinac dhigay oo dib-u-qaybinta u gudbiyay Guddi Gaar ah oo Doorasho oo ka kooban shan MLA oo uu guddoominayo Brandon Lunty (MLA UCP ah). Guddiga waxa uu kormeerayaa Guddi Madax-bannaan oo Talo-bixin ah oo gaar ah oo afar qof ah, oo lagu aasaasay Mooshinka Dawladda 37 (la ansixiyay Abriil 21, 2026), oo loo xilsaaray inay soo saaraan khariidad cusub oo 91 kursi ah; guddiga waa in uu warbixintiisa u gudbiyaa golaha sharci dejinta ka hor Noofembar 2, 2026.`,p4:`Sababta ay kuugu muhiim u tahay: khadadku waxay go'aamiyaan cidda MLA-gaaga noqonayso. Waxay go'aamiyaan xaafadaha, magaalooyinka, iyo welwelka la matalo wadajir. Haddii magaaladaadu u kala qaybsanto afar MLA halkii ay ka noqon lahayd hal, hal matalaadi ma masuuli ka noqonayo magaalada oo dhan. Haddii bulshadaada — magaalo yar, gobol miyi ah, bartamaha magaalada — ay u kala qaybsanto degmooyin, codkaaga go'aannada gobolka ayaa lagu khafiifin. Khariidaddu sidoo kale waxay qaabaysaa xisbiga noqon kara dawladda, iyo cabbirka ay ku noqdaan. Natiijada gaarka ah ee hubinta (in soo jeedinta laga yar yahay ay ku jirto heer qaab-dhismeed daran) waa sababta aad bogan u akhrineyso, laakiin su'aasha ballaaran way ka hor mar tahay oo waxay khusaysaa wareeg kasta oo dib-u-qaybin ah: ma khadadku waxay ka tarjumayaan sida dadka Alberta u nool yihiin, mise waxay qaabaynayaan siyaasadda dabada timaada?`,p5:`Inta bogga ka harsan waxay ku marto waxa labada khariidadood ee la soo jeediyay dhab ahaan sameeyaan.`,key_terms_lead:`Ereyo muhiim ah qaybtan — guji si aad u akhrido:`},editorial_reflect:{heading:`U dhexeyn: Waxa tani u tarayso adiga iyo bulshadaada`,intro_p1:`Hal mar dhinacasiib, su'aasha xisbi kasta uu ku helo ama ku waayo kursiyo. Siyaasiyiinta iyo xisbiyada waxay u arkaan tani inay tahay halgan ku saabsan urursanaanta awoodda golaha sharci dejinta, oo heerka sharci dejintaba waa sidaas. Laakiin urursanaanta awoodda golaha sharci dejinta maaha meesha aad tan ku dareemayso. Waxaad ku dareemaysaa saddex su'aalo wax-ku-ool ah oo ku saabsan degmadaada:`,intro_q1:`Halkee MLA-gaagu degenyahay?`,intro_q2:`Ma maalgashan yahay bulshadaada?`,intro_q3:`Baahida madaxa ma awoodi doonaan baahida dabada?`,intro_p2:`Qaab kasta oo kale — faa'iido xisbiyeed, heer aqlabiyad weyn, heer tirakoob aan caadi ahayn — ugu dambeyntii waxay dib ugu tagaan saddexdaas. Shanta jaranjaroo hoose waxay ku marayaan sida khariidad kasta oo la soo jeediyay uga jawaabayso, shan heer.`,you_h:`Adiga.`,you_p:`Degmadaada doorasho waxay go'aamisaa cidda kuu matala golaha sharci dejinta. Hadda waxaad ku nooshahay mid ka mid ah 87 degmo. Labada khariidadood ee la soo jeediyay waxaa laga yaabaa inaad ku noolaato mid kale — waxaa laga yaabaa MLA kale, waxaa laga yaabaa bulshooyin deriskaaga ah oo kala duwan. Haddii aanad ogeyn degmada aad hadda ku jirto, ama cidda MLA-gaagu yahay, kelidaa ma aha: dadka badan ee Alberta ma magacaabi karaan MLA-gooda. Laakiin khadadka xudduuduhu ma aha kuwo mooyaane. Waxay go'aamiyaan cidda lambarka taleefan ee ku qoran derbiga xafiiska matalaha kuu dhow, cidda ka soo arjida xaafaddaadu magacaaga ku xidhantahay, cidda welwelkooda MLA-gaagu marka hore maqlo. Goobta raadinta koodka boostada ee bogga waxay tusinaysaa degmada aad ku jirto soo jeedin kasta. Haddii degmadaadu isbeddesho, matalahaaguna wuu isbeddelaa — xidhiidhka matalahaaga iyo bulshadaaduna wuu la isbeddelaa.`,community_h:`Bulshadaada.`,community_p:`Bulshadu sidoo kale ma aha mid mooyaane. Aagga dugsi sare, rugta ganacsiga, jaaliyad diineed, ururka xaafadeed — kuwani waa kooxo dhab ah oo dad ah oo leh welwelyo deegaan oo wadaagsan. Marka khad xudduudaa ka dhex maro, hal MLAna ma masuuli ka noqonayo dhammaan. Qaado Airdrie soo jeedinta laga yar yahay: magaalo qiyaastii 85,800 oo qof ah oo loo gooyay afar degmo doorasho, mid kasta oo lagu xidhay aag miyi oo kala duwan. Hal matale ma masuuli ka noqdo Airdrie magaalo ahaan. Isla isbeddel ayaa ka dhex dhaca meel kasta oo magaalo, xaafad, ama bulsho la aqoonsan yahay ay u kala qaybsanto — sida ay kala qaybsanaantu u weyn tahay, ayuu matalaaddu u liidanaysaa. Hubintu waxay cabbirtaa <em>xajinta dawladda hoose</em> (qaybtaarka agagaaraha degmo kasta oo raacaya khadadka dawladda hoose ee jira); cabbirkaas guud labada soo jeedinba waxay ku jiraan caadiga la-barbardhigga Kanadiyaanka ah — natiijadii hore ee ahayd in soo jeedinta laga yar yahay ay si cad uga hoosaysay kama badbaadin dib-u-xisaabin — inkastoo kala-qaybsanaanta bulsho ee gaarka ah sida u-qaybinta afar-geesoodka ah ee Airdrie ay weli ku duumayaan natiijooyinka qaab-dhismeedka.`,municipality_h:`Dawladda hoose ee magaaladaada.`,municipality_p:`Marka magaalo loo kala goyo matalaayaal badan, awoodeeda ay ku gorgortamayso go'aamada gobolku way daciifiso. Golaha magaalada oo dalbanaya maalgelin gaadiidka dadweynaha, guddida iskuulada oo gorgortamayso iskuul cusub, duqa magaaladu oo wax ku gorgortamayo balaadhin waddo — mid kasta oo kuwaas ka mid ah si fiican ayuu u socdaa marka magaalada ay tilmaami karto MLA-yo dhowr ah oo ay masuul u yihiin magaalada oo dhan. Soo jeedinta laga yar yahay waxay u kala gooysaa woqooyi, bari, iyo dhexe ee Calgary degmooyin badan oo qaababka qaybinta codkooda ay tilmaamayaan <em>urursi</em> (ku urursashada codbixiyayaasha hal xisbi gudaha dhowr kursi oo cadaadis sare leh) oo lagu darayo <em>jeexitaan</em> (u qaybinta codbixiyayaasha xisbiga kale dhowr kursi oo cadaadis hooseeya). In qaabkani uu yahay mid ula kac ah waa su'aal aanay hubintu ka jawaabi karin — joomatariga xudduudu ma muujin karo niyad. Waxa ay sheegi kartaa waa in afarta cabbir ee tirakoobku ay calaamadeeyaan isla degmooyinka ay imtixaanada qaab-dhismeedku calaamadeeyaan, iyo in soo jeedinta kale aanay soo saarin isla farra-saxeexa.`,region_h:`Gobolkaaga.`,region_p1:`Haddii aad ka baxsantahay magaalooyinka Alberta waxaad sida laga yaabo iska ogtahay in wadahadalada siyaasadeed ee ku saabsan xudduudaha had iyo jeer ay magaalooyinka udub-dhexaad ka dhigaan. Cabasho macquul ah, sidaas darteed aan si toos ah u sheegno waxa hubintani sheegayso iyo waxa aanay sheegayn ee ku saabsan Alberta miyiga ah.`,region_p2:`Waxa ay <strong>aysan sheegin</strong>: in Alberta miyiga ah ay leedahay kursiyo aad u badan. EBCA-du waxay u oggolaataa tirooyinka degmada inay ku kala duwanaadaan ilaa 25% si hal MLA miyi aanu ku matalin juquraafi le'eg koonfurta Faransiiska. Maxkamadaha Kanada waxay u arkaan kala-duwanaanshahan inuu sharci yahay. Labada khariidadood ee la soo jeediyay way ilaaliyaan. Waxba hubintani kama beddelayso.`,region_p3:`Waxa ay <strong>sheegayso</strong>: dhowr meel oo ku yaal soo jeedinta laga yar yahay, bulshooyin miyi ah ayaa loo xidhay <em>dabada</em> degmo bartamaheeda dadku ku yaal magaalo. Eeg sida soo jeedinta laga yar yahay ay ula dhaqantay Airdrie — magaalo qiyaastii 85,800 oo qof ah oo loo kala gooyay afar degmo, mid kasta oo loo fidiyay gobol miyi oo kala duwan. Bartamaha dadka degmo cusub kasta waa qaybta magaalada, ma aha dabada miyiga. MLA-ga laga dooranayo nooca degmadaas waxaa sida ugu badan in uu ku nool yahay, ololo ku sameeyay, kana mudnaaynayo meesha codadku joogaan — taas oo macnaheedu yahay in bulshooyinka miyiga ee horay loo matali jiray MLA gaar ah ay ku noqdaan dabada kursi magaaleed. Qaabkani waxa uu soo noqnoqdaa soo jeedinta laga yar yahay siyaalo aanay ku soo noqnoqon soo jeedinta inta badan.`,region_p4:`Hubintu ma soo jeedinayso in laga qaado kursiyo Alberta miyiga ah. Waxay weydiisaa in khadaduhu ay ixtiraamaan bulshooyinka miyiga ah ee kursiyadaasi loogu talagalay inay matalaan, mise juquraafiga miyigu waxa loo isticmaalayaa culayska codadka magaalada lagu nuuji lahaa degmooyin bartamuhu meel kale joogo. Haddii aad ku nooshahay mid ka mid ah dabaha miyiga, su'aasha ah midee khariidadood ah ayaa la dhaqan-geliyay waxay go'aamisaa in MLA-gaagu uu matalo bulshada miyiga ee aad dhab ahaan ku nooshahay, ama degmo magaaleed oo khadkeedu ay ku jirto dhulkaaga.`,province_h:`Gobolkaaga.`,province_p:`Golaha sharci dejintu waa waxa aad heshid marka aad isugu darto jawaabaha degmo kasta ee saddexda su'aalood ee kor ku xusan. Haddii degmooyinka inta badani ay ku xidhan yihiin bulshooyin MLA-yadooda dhab ahaan ku nool yihiin, golaha sharci dejintu wuxuu matalayaa bulshooyinkaas. Haddii degmooyinka inta badani ay leeyihiin dabaha miyiga oo ku xidhan madaxa magaaleed, golaha sharci dejintu wuxuu matalayaa madaxa — dabaha waxay heli doonaan dareenka soo haray. Su'aasha xisbiyeed — xisbiga ku guulaysta aqlabiyadda — waa midda ka hooseysa. Su'aasha aqlabiyadda weyn — in xisbi ka gudbo 60 ee 89 kursi oo uu furo gaagaaban habraac sida la-iska-dhaafida muddooyinka ogeysiiska ama dardar-gelinta sharciyada marxalado kala duwan hal maalin gudaheed — waa midda ka <em>hoosaysa</em> taas. Marka la qaato cod gobol oo mala-awaal ah oo 50/50, cabbirrada hubinta waxay soo jeedinta laga yar yahay ka dhigaan heer qaab-dhismeed daran: in ka yar 100 oo ka mid ah 1.01 milyan oo khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah oo isbarbardhig ah ayaa keena nooca isle'egta kursiyada. In isle'egtaasi ay xisbi gaadhsiiso 60 kursi qaybinta codka ay Albertans dhab ahaan keenaan waa su'aal aanay hubintani si toos ah u tijaabin weli; su'aalaha furitaanka ee bogga sare way runtii xukumayaan farqigaas. In jawaabta su'aal kasta oo kuwaas ka mid ah ay ku filan tahay in laga qabto, mar kale, waa su'aal kuu socota.`},editorial_history:{heading:`Macnaha: Taariikh kooban oo ku saabsan qaybsiga siyaasadeed`,p1:`Ereygu waxa uu ka yimid 1812. Guddoomiyaha Massachusetts Elbridge Gerry waxa uu saxeexay khariidad gole-gobol oo degmooyinkeedu ay aad u qalloocayeen si u dhaxasho xisbigiisa oo ay sawir-yaqaan reer Boston mid ka mid ah u sawiray qaab balanbaaliska bahallada — baalal, qoolal, carrabkii kala godan. Sawirka jeesjeesintiisa, <em>Gerry-mander</em>, ayaa hadhay. Qaabkuna wuu hadhay: laba qarni kadib, ereygu wuxuu weli ka dhigan yahay sawiritaanka khadadka doorashada si loo abuuro natiijo xisbiyeed.`,p2:`Ereygu wuu jiraa maxaa yeelay dhibaatadu way jirtaa. Meel kasta oo codbixiyayaashu ka soo doortaan matalayaal degmooyin juquraafi ah, qof baa khadadka sawirta, khadadkana waxa lagu sawiri karaa siyaalo badan. Dalal kala duwan ayaa gaaray jawaabo kala duwan oo ku saabsan cidda sawiri lahayd iyo waxa xaddidi laha.`,p3:`<strong>Mareykanka</strong> waxay u arkaan qaybsiga siyaasadeed dhibaato aysan maxkamadaha federaalku inta badan xallin karin. <em>Rucho v. Common Cause</em> (2019), Maxkamadda Sare ee Mareykanku waxa ay xukuntay in qaybsiga siyaasadeedku yahay "su'aalo siyaasadeed" oo aan la xukumi karin oo maxkamadaha federaalku aysan xallin doonin. Gobolada qaar (California, Michigan) waxa ay ka jawaabeen iyaga oo sameeyay guddiyo madaniyad madax-bannaan si ay khadadkooda u sawiraan; kuwo kale (Texas, North Carolina) waxa ay sii wadeen sawiritaanka khariidadood si cad ugu eexday xisbi, oo ay difaaceen iyaga oo ku saleysan in <em>Rucho</em> uu oggolaado.`,p4:`<strong>Boqortooyada Midowday</strong> waxay isticmaashaa afar Guddiyo Xudduudo oo joogto ah — mid kasta England, Scotland, Wales, iyo Northern Ireland — oo ka kooban garsoorayaal iyo shaqaalaha sare ee dawladda. Waxa ay dib u sawiraan khadadka qiyaastii sideed sano kasta iyaga oo ku saleysan shuruucda go'an (sinaanta dadka, isku xidhnaanta juquraafi, ixtiraamka xudduudaha dawladda hoose). Tan iyo Sharciga Degmooyinka Baarlamaanka 2020 (Parliamentary Constituencies Act 2020), talooyinkooda kama-dambaysta ah waxay si toos ah u dhaqan-galaan iyada oo loo marayo Amar Golaha (Order in Council), iyada oo aan loo baahnayn cod baarlamaaneed — awooddii hore ee Baarlamaanku ku diidi jiray waa la qaaday.`,p5:`<strong>Australiya</strong> waxay shaqada u dirtaa Guddida Doorashada Australia, hay'ad federaal madax-bannaan oo leh awood buuxda labadaba maamulka doorashooyinka iyo xudduudaha. Dib-u-qaybin si toos ah ayuu u dhaca marka tirada kursiyada gobol uu isbeddesho ama todobo sano la soo dhaafay laga bilaabo midkii ugu dambeeyay. Go'aanada La-taliyayaasha waa dib loo eegi karaa sababo habraaceed laakiin sababo xisbiyeed maaha. Sida Boqortooyada Midowday, qaybsiga siyaasadeed sida ay Mareykankii ay yaqaaneen wax la maqlay ma aha.`,p6:`Saddexdan kiis waxay calaamadeeyaan iskala-duwanaanshaha: maxkamadaha aan dhex galin (Mareykanka), guddiyo madax-bannaan oo leh ixtiraam baarlamaanka oo xooggan (Boqortooyada Midowday), iyo hay'ad madax-bannaan oo joogto ah oo leh awood buuxda (Australiya). Kanada waxay ku taallaa meel kale oo kala duwan — taas oo qaybta xigta wax ka qabaneyso.`},glossary:{more_link:`Wax dheeraad ah baro →`,"electoral-district":{term:`Degmada doorashada (ED)`,definition:`Aagga juquraafi ee dooran kara hal xubin oo aada golaha sharci dejinta gobolka. Inta badan waxa loo soo gaabiyaa "ED" markii ugu horreysay ee la xuso. ED kasta waxay leedahay hal MLA. (Ereyga "riding" wuxuu inta badan tilmaamayaa degmooyinka federaalka; macnaha gobolka ereyga saxda ahi waa degmada doorashada.)`},riding:{term:`Riding`,definition:`Adeegsiga Kanada, kani wuxuu inta badan tilmaamaa degmo doorasho federaal. La macno ee Alberta gobolka ah waxa loogu yeedhaa "degmada doorashada" (ED). Hubintu waxay adeegsataa erayga gobolka oo dhan.`},mla:{term:`MLA`,definition:`Member of the Legislative Assembly (Xubinta Golaha Sharci dejinta) — qofka laga doorto hal degmo doorasho si uu uga matalo golaha sharci dejinta ee Alberta.`},ucp:{term:`UCP`,definition:`United Conservative Party (Xisbiga Midowga Muxaafidka) — xisbiga gobolka ee xukunka haya ee Alberta. Waxa la aasaasay 2017 markii ay isku biireen Progressive Conservatives iyo Wildrose Party; wuxuu hayey dawladda ilaa 2019.`},ndp:{term:`NDP`,definition:`New Democratic Party (Xisbiga Dimuqraadiga Cusub ee Alberta) — mucaaridka rasmiga ah ee Alberta hadda. Alberta NDP waxay hayey dawladda 2015 ilaa 2019.`},gerrymander:{term:`Gerrymander (qaybsi siyaasadeed)`,definition:`Naanays Maraykan ah oo loogu talagalay khariidad doorasho oo loo sawiray si hal xisbi loo doorbido. Macno sharci ma laha Kanada — maxkamad ama sharci midna ma isticmaalo — sidaa darteed boggani marna uma isticmaalo sidii gunaanad.`},cracking:{term:`Jeexitaan (cracking)`,definition:`Farsamo qaybsiga siyaasadeed oo u kala qaybiya kooxda codbixiyaasha degmooyin badan si aanay aqlabiyad ku gaarin mid keliya. Tusaale, qaybinta magaalo afar wax-riding ah si codbixiyayaasheedu loogaga badnaado mid kasta.`},packing:{term:`Urursi (packing)`,definition:`Farsamo qaybsiga siyaasadeed oo ku urursa codbixiyayaasha xisbi tiro yar oo degmooyin ah. Xisbigu wuxuu ku guulaystaa degmooyinkaas si aad u xoog leh laakiin wuxuu "khasaariyaa" codad badan — isaga oo ka taga codbixiyayaal yar oo loo heli karo si uu ugu tartamo degmooyin kale.`},draining:{term:`Miirid (draining)`,definition:`Eray uu hubintani isticmaalo oo loogu talagalay saamayn raac ee jeexitaanka iyo urursiga: codadka khasaaray ee ay farsamooyinkaas soo saaraan waxa lagu riixaa meelo si istiraatiiji ah loo doortay, taasoo beddesha dabeecadda siyaasadeed ee degmooyinka doorashada ee u dhow. Waa qaab uu hubintu lahaa halkii uu noqon lahaa fikrad la qaabaystay oo ku jirta suugaanta dib-u-qaybinta — hubintu waxay tijaabisaa saamayntaas waxay heshay natiijooyin la jaan-qaadaya, laakiin waxay u arkaan iskuday halkii ay ka noqon lahaayeen habraac la dejiyay.`},anchoring:{term:`Xajin (anchoring)`,definition:`Sida ay khariidadda la soo jeediyay si adag ula raacayso khadadka dawladda hoose ee jira (xadkii magaalada, xudduudaha magaalo yar). Khariidadda si xooggan loo xajiyo waxay inta badan ixtiraamtaa khadadkaas; mid si dabacsan loo xajiyo waxay inta badan ka leexataa — gaar ahaan meelaha siyaasad ahaan macnaha leh, taas oo ah calaamad qaab-dhismeed oo digniin ah.`},"charter-s3":{term:`Qaybta 3 ee Axdiga`,definition:`Qaybta Axdiga Xuquuqaha iyo Xorriyadaha Kanada ee dammaanad qaadda muwaadiniinta xaqa codaynta. Maxkamadaha Kanada waxay u tarjumeen ma aha qaanuun adag oo "hal qof, hal cod" laakiin xaq u helitaan "matalaad waxtar leh".`},"effective-representation":{term:`Matalaad waxtar leh`,definition:`Halbeegga maxkamadaha Kanada ay isticmaalaan markay xukumayaan xudduudaha doorashada. Macnaheedu waa codbixiyayaashu waa inay leeyihiin cod macno leh — ma aha kaliya sinaanta tirakoobka ee tirooyinka degmada, balse sidoo kale aqoonsiga xidhiidhada bulshada, juquraafiga, iyo matalaadda dadka tirada yar. Hadalka ugu muhiimsani waa Reference 1991-kii ee Saskatchewan ee Maxkamadda Sare ee Kanada.`},ebc:{term:`Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada (EBC)`,definition:`Hay'adda sawirta xudduudaha doorashada gobolka ee Alberta sida ku cad EBCA. Guddidii 2026 waxa guddoominayey Garsoore Miller waxayna u kala qaybsantay 3–2 dhex la-taliyayaasheeda, oo ay ka soo bixiyeen laba soo jeedin oo iska soo horjeeda (soo jeedinta inta badan iyo inta yar) halkii ay ka iman lahayd talo keliya.`},"lunty-committee":{term:`Guddiga Lunty`,definition:`Guddi gaar ah oo Doorasho Khaas ah oo ku saabsan Xudduudaha Doorashada oo ka kooban shan MLA-yo, oo uu guddoominayo Brandon Lunty — MLA UCP ah — oo ay aasaastay Mooshinka 19 ee Golaha Sharci dejinta (Abriil 16, 2026), oo dib u dhigtay labada warbixin ee guddida. Guddigu wuxuu kormeerayaa Guddi Madax-bannaan oo Talo-bixin ah oo gaar ah oo ka kooban afar qof, oo lagu aasaasay Mooshinka Dawladda 37 (la ansixiyay Abriil 21, 2026), kuwaas oo dhab ahaan sawira khariidadda; guddigu wuxuu warbixin u soo gudbinayaa Golaha Sharci dejinta ka hor kama-dambaysta ah ee Noofembar 2026. Labada hay'adoodba way ka gooni yihiin EBC mana qayb ka aha habraaca caadiga ah ee EBCA.`},"advisory-panel":{term:`Guddida Talo-bixinta Madax-bannaan`,definition:`Guddiga afarta qof oo uu magacaabay guddiga Lunty sida ku cad qaybta C(d)(ii) ee Mooshinka Dawladda 37 si ay u soo saaraan talo xudduudo 91 kursi ah. Ra'iisul Wasaaraha wuxuu magacaabay Sharafta leh Monte Solberg iyo Darwin Durnie; Hogaamiyaha Mucaaridku wuxuu magacaabay Dr. Gerard Kennedy iyo Brent Robinson. Kursi shanaad — garsoore fadhiya ama hawl-gab si uu u noqdo guddoomiye — wuu banaanaaday markii guddoomiyaha garsoorka oo ku xigeenka Alberta uu diiday inuu magacaabo.`},ebca:{term:`EBCA`,definition:`Alberta Electoral Boundaries Commission Act (Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta) — sharciga maamula sida xudduudaha doorashada loogu sawiro gobolka. Wuxuu dejiyaa guddida, habraaca dhageysiga dadweynaha, iyo shuruucda marka khariidad cusub ay shaqo galayso.`},ensemble:{term:`Tijaabada 1.01-milyan-khariidadood`,definition:`Kombuyuutar ayaa si bakhtiyaanasiib ah u sawiray 1.01 milyan oo khariidadood oo Alberta sharci ah, dhammaantood oo raacaya isla shuruucda. Khariidad dhab ah waxay u tirsan tahay mid aan caadi ahayn marka ay ka baxsan tahay waxa ku dhowaad dhammaan khariidadahan dhexdhexaadka ah soo saaraan.`},efficiency_gap:{term:`Farqiga waxtarka`,definition:`Cabbir ah codadka "la khasaariyay" — codad ka badan inta uu musharaxu u baahnaa inuu ku guulaysto, oo lagu daro cod kasta oo loo dhiibtay mid guuldarraystay — oo la isbarbar dhigo labada xisbi. Farqi weyn wuxuu tilmaamaa khariidad hal jiho leh.`},mean_median:{term:`Farqiga dhexe-dhexdhexaadka`,definition:`Farqiga u dhexeeya qaybtaarka codka celceliska ah ee xisbi degmooyinka oo dhan iyo midkiisa dhexe (dhexdhexaadka). Farqi weyn wuxuu soo jeedinayaa in codbixiyayaashiisa loo faafiyay si codad lagu khasaariyo.`},declination:{term:`Declination`,definition:`Cabbir ah sida si aan dheelitirnayn xisbi kasta ugu guulaysto kursiyadiisa — guulo waaweyn ama kuwo ku dhow. Khariidadda laga yar yahay waxay tilmaamaysaa isla jihada cabbirrada kale (xisbiga xukunka hayo) ka dib sax calaamadeed bishii Juun 2026.`},seats_5050:{term:`Kursiyo barbar ah`,definition:`Immisa kursi ayaa xisbi kastaa ku guulaysan lahaa haddii gobolku codkiisa si sax ah u kala qaybiyo 50-50. Waxay ka saartaa cidda dhab ahaan ku guulaysatay waxayna tijaabisaa eexda khariidadda ku dhisan.`},fsa:{term:`Aagga kala-soocida hore (FSA)`,definition:`Saddexda xaraf ee ugu horeeya koodka boostada Kanada (qaybta xaraf-lambar-xaraf). Qiyaastii 270 FSA ayaa daboolaya Alberta. Badi waxay si buuxda ugu jiraan hal degmo doorasho.`}},body:{section_link_aria:`Xiriiriye qaybta`,preliminary:{badge:`BILOW AH`,heading:`Natiijooyin bilow ah — sugaya dib-u-eegis madax-bannaan oo khabiir ah`,body:`Tijaabooyinka tirakoobka ee qaybtan waxaa dib u eegaya khubaro madax-bannaan oo arrintan ku takhasusay ka hor daabacaadda kama-dambaysta ah. Natiijooyinka oo dhammeystiran ayaa hoos lagu soo bandhigay si loo baadho.`},the_map:{heading:`1: Khariidadda`,p1:`Khariidadda jaldiga waa sawirka keligiis ugu fiican ee hubintan. Halkan waxa lagu akhriyo.`,p2:`Alberta waxa loo qaybiyey 4,765 Aagag Codbixin — aago juquraafi yaryar oo Elections Alberta isticmaasho si ay u tiriyaan kaadiyada xarunta codbixinta. Mid kasta waxa lagu midaystay sida dadku dhab ahaan u codeeyeen 2023: oranje meelaha codadka NDP ay ku urursan yihiin, buluug meelaha codadka UCP ay ku urursan yihiin. Laakiin midabku oo madoow oo dhiig dhebbada noqonayaa kaliya meelaha ay dad badan ku nool yihiin. Aagga Codbixin oo daboola boqollaal kiilomitir oo isku jira oo barbarro ama beero ah wuxuu yahay dhalaalan — ku dhowaad la arki kari maayo. Khariidaddu way iftiimisaa meelaha ay dadku joogaan, wayna damisaa meelaha aanay joogin.`,p3:`Tani aad bay uga duwantahay Alberta aad aragto habeenkii doorashada. Khariidadaha doorashada inta badani waxay si buuxda u midaystaan riding-yo dhammaystiran buluug ama oranje iyada oo ku saleysan cidda guulaysatay. Riding-yada miyiga ah waxay juquraafi ahaan u weyn yihiin UCP-na waxay ku guulaysataa inta badan, sidaa darteed habeenkii doorashada Alberta waxay u eeg tahay darbi buluug ah oo leh boorso oranje yaryar oo Edmonton iyo Calgary ku yaal. Khariidadda jaldigu waxay isticmaashaa isla codadka iyo isla juquraafiga — laakiin waxay tusinaysaa kuwo lagu miisaamay halka dadku dhab ahaan ku nool yihiin. Waxa muuqda waa gobol oo dadka inta badani ay ku urursan yihiin qaanso magaalo oo cufan, magaalooyinkaasi waxay si aad u kala duwan u codeeyaan khariidadda miyiga ah ee caadi ahaan u matasha.`,p4:`Khadadka xudduudaha ee midabka kor lagu sawiray waa 89 degmo doorasho oo guddida laga yar yahay soo jeedisay — khariidadda hubintaniyu noqdaayadii dambe dhalleeceyso. Shaqada hubintu waa in la weydiiyo waxa khadadkaasi ku samaynayaan dadka hoosta ku jira.`,p5:`Sawirkani waxa uu khataraha bayaamiyaa. Gobol oo u eeg sidiisii hal jaho ugu codeyaayo khariidad caadi ah dhab ahaan waa gobol uu dadka inta badan ku noolyihiin aagag jaho kale u codeyo. Marka dadka la arki karo hoosta doorashooyinka xudduudaha, doorashooyinkaasi waxay joogsadaan inay u eegan kuwo aan kala sooc lahayn.`},structural_results:{heading:`Natiijooyinka hubinta qaab-dhismeedka — ka hor wax tirakoob ah:`,body:`Khariidadda inta badan waxay ka gudbaa <strong>eber ka mid ah shanta</strong> xadadka qaab-dhismeedka ee horay loo diiwaan-geliyay. Khariidadda laga yar yahay waxay ka gudbaa <strong>afar ka mid ah shanta</strong>; shanaadka (xajinta) waa dhexdhexaad — labada khariidadood waxay ku jiraan caadiga Kanada ee 70–85%. Kuwani waa cabbirro joomatari ah — faafinta dadka, <button class="vocab-term" data-def="sida xudduudaha degmadu ay si dhow ula raacayaan xadadka magaalada iyo dawladda hoose ee jira, halkii ay ka soo gudbi lahaayeen" aria-expanded="false">xajinta dawladda hoose</button>, tirada qaybinta Airdrie, dheeraadka dadka woqooyi-bari/dhexe Calgary, iyo todobada qaab xudduudo oo Guddoomiyaha Guddida Garsoore Miller laftiisu qoraal ahaan u calaamadeeyay (§5.8.2 warbixinta inta badan iyo Lifaaqa C) — oo aan u baahnayn xog doorasho iyo qaade tirakoob. Qaybta xigta waxay tijaabineysaa labada khariidadood iyada oo ka dhigan 1,010,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah oo kombuyuutar soo saaray oo waxay gaadhaa isla gunaanad iyada oo loo marayo qalab gabi ahaanba kala duwan. Saddex qalab oo madax-bannaan — joomatari, garsoor, iyo tirakoob — ayaa is dhaafsada.`},clean:{heading:`6: Marka khariidad u eg mid caddaalad ah ee aan ahayn`,legal_label:`OGEYSIIS KU SAABSAN ERAYBIXINTA SHARCIGA`,legal_body:`"Gerrymandering" ma laha qeexitaan sharci oo Kanada. Ereygu waxa loo isticmaalaa warbixintan oo dhan macnaheeda caadiga ah ee siyaasadda — wax-ka-beddelka xudduudaha doorashada faa'iido xisbiyeed. Imtixaanada sharci ee dhab ahaan ku shaqeeya Kanada waa kala duwan: in xudduuduhu bixiyaan "matalaad waxtar leh" sida ku cad qaybta 3 ee <em>Axdiga Xuquuqaha iyo Xorriyadaha</em> (heerka dastuuriga ah ee Maxkamadda Sare ee Kanada ay dejisay 1991-kii <em>Tixraaca Saskatchewan</em>), iyo in guddidu raacday shuruucda <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> ee Alberta. Natiijooyinka hubintu waa caddaymo la xidhiidha su'aalahaas sharciga. Ma aha caddaynta khaladka sharci ahaan la qeexay, warbixintaaduna kuma sharaxno erayadaas.`,intro_p1:`Su'aasha keligeed ugu cad ee la weydiin karo khariidad kasta oo doorasho waa tan: haddii codka gobolku si sax ah u kala qaybsamo labada xisbi ee waaweyn, immisa kursi ayay khariidaddu soo saari lahayd? Tani waxay codbixiyayaasha hayaa joogto waxayna khariidadda keligeed weydiisaa waxa ay sameyso.`,intro_p2:`Si laga jawaabo, hubintu waxay soo saartay 1,010,000 khariidadood oo Alberta ah oo kombuyuutar soo saaray oo xisaab ahaan dhexdhexaad ah. Soo-jeedintu waxay isticmaashay shaybaadhka rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta ee juquraafiga guddiga, iyada oo qorshe kasta ku haysa isla shuruucda isle'egnaanta-dadnimada (±25%) iyo isku-xirnaanta — labada shuruud ee algorithm-ku dhaqan-geliyo, ma aha qodob kasta oo sharci (tusaale, ma dhaqan-geliyo danaha bulshada), sidaa darteed kooxda isbarbardhigga waxa ugu fiican in loo akhriyo mid dhexdhexaad-u-ah-dadnimada-iyo-isku-xirnaanta halkii ay ka ahaan lahayd mid sharci si buuxda u hoggaansan. Labada khariidadood ee guddida ee 2026 ayaa markaa lagu daray qaybintaas si loo arko sida ay caadi u yihiin. Soo-jeedintu waxay socotay afar silsilad oo madax-bannaan oo 252,500 tallaabo, oo iniinta saldhig ah laga soo qaaday calaamadda Cloudflare drand oo horay loogu diiwaan-geliyay OSF ka hor inta aan la sameyn.`,howmcmc_label:`SIDAY SOO-JEEDINTU U SHAQEYSO`,howmcmc_mcmc:`<strong>MCMC (Markov Chain Monte Carlo)</strong> waa hab loogu talagalay sahanka meel weyn — halkan, meesha dhammaan khariidadaha sharciga ah ee Alberta — iyada oo laga soo qaadayo tallaabooyin aan sahmin lahayn meel bilow ah. Tallaabo kasta waxay soo jeedisaa is-beddel yar oo udhexeeya degmooyinka isku xiga; haddii natiijadu ay ku jirto shuruucda sharciga, waxay noqotaa meeshii cusbayd ee bilowgu. Kadib tallaabooyin kufilan, khariidadaha la booqday waxay sameeyaan muunad u matala qorshaha sharciga ah. Soo-jeedinta waxa la siiyaa iniin laga keenay calaamadda guud ee Cloudflare drand si looga hortago xulashada doorbidaysa ee xaaladaha bilowga.`,howmcmc_recom:`<strong>ReCom (Redistricting Compiler)</strong> waa algorithm-ka gaarka ah ee halkan loo adeegsado. Tallaabo kasta waxay isku biirtaa laba degmo oo isku xiga oo midaystaa hal aag, oo si aan sahmin lahayn ugu kala qaybiya laba degmo cusub oo sharci ah, oo ay sii ilaaliso isku xidhnaanta iyo isleegga dadka qaab-dhismeed ahaan — sidaa darteed algorithm-ku marna uma baahna inuu diido soo-jeedin aan sharci ahayn.`,prereg_label:`DIIWAAN-GELINTA HORE`,prereg_body:`Diiwaan-gelinta hore macnaheedu waa qorista tijaabooyinka saxda ah, xadadka, iyo jihooyinka la saadaaliyay ka hor inta aan la fiirin xog kasta, iyo ku xidhitaanka ballamadaas diiwaan dadweyne oo wakhti la dhejiyo. Open Science Framework (OSF) waa kayd dadweyne oo ballamada hubintan lagu xareeyo. Waxay ka hor istaagtaa dib-u-cabbirka: haddii natiijadu sii fiican u soo bixi waydo, xadku lama beddeli karo dabadeed oo aan loo soo bandhigi karin in uu had iyo jeer ahaa tijaabada. Abuurayaasha (seeds) random-ka ah ee hubintu waxaa loo balanqaaday beacon dadweyne oo wakhti la dhejiyo (drand ee Cloudflare) ka hor inta aan la sii dayn shaybaadhada rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta, sidaa darteed soo-jeedinta dib looma sameyn karin si loo gaadho natiijo la doortay. Tijaabada miirida-deriska si buuxda ayaa OSF horay loogu diiwaan-geliyay — xadkeeda iyo jihada la saadaaliyay oo la xidhay ka hor cabbirka. Tijaabooyinka soo hadhay waxaa loo soo sheegaa kuwo sahmin ah: abuurayaashoodu horay ayaa loo balanqaaday, laakiin magacyada gaarka ah ee tijaabooyinka iyo habka lagu daro looma diiwaan-gelin OSF ka hor inta aan la samayn, warbixintuna mid kasta oo natiijo ah si waafaqsan ayay u calaamadaysaa.`,neutral_p:`Alberta, jawaabta dhexdhexaadka ah ma aha 50/50. <em>1,010,000 khariidadood oo Alberta sharci ah oo kombuyuutar soo saaray, khariidadda dhexe waxay siisaa UCP kaliya 44.8% kursiyada codka 50/50</em> — khariidad caadi ah oo Alberta ah oo codad dhexdhexaad ah waxay siisaa NDP aqlabiyad yar oo kursiyo. Tan way liddi noqotaa laakiin waa farsamada: codbixiyayaasha UCP ee miyiga waxay ku guulaystaan riding-yadooda kala-soocyo 60-40 (waxay khasaariyaan codad badan oo UCP "dheeraad ah"), halka codbixiyayaasha NDP ee magaalada ay ku guulaystaan riding-yadooda kala-soocyo 51-49 oo ka adag (waxay khasaariyaan codad NDP yar guul kasta). Dhexdhexaad ahaan, NDP waxay ku guulaystaa waxtarka kursiyada.`,full_dist:`Qaybinta buuxda ee soo-jeedinta canonical-ka ah ee 1,010,000-khariidadood:`,t1_col_a:`Halka khariidaddu joogto`,t1_col_b:`Kursiyo UCP codka 50/50`,t1_r1_a:`Khariidadda dhexe ee Alberta`,t1_r1_b:`44.8% — aqlabiyad yar oo kursiyo NDP`,t1_r2_a:`Khariidadda 95-aad centile`,t1_r2_b:`47.1%`,t1_r3_a:`Khariidadda 99-aad centile`,t1_r3_b:`48.4%`,t1_r4_a:`<strong>Heerka ugu sarreeya ee 1,010,000 khariidadood</strong>`,t1_r4_b:`<strong>51.72% (66 ka mid ah 1,010,000 qorshe ayaa ka sarreeya 51.69% ee inta yar)</strong>`,seat_count_note:`Ogeysiis ku saabsan tirooyinka kursiyada. Khariidadaha guddida ee 2026 mid kastaa wuxuu leeyahay <strong>89</strong> degmo; soo-jeedinta kombuyuutarka ee hubinta waxay ku shaqaynaysaa khariidadda 2019 ee <strong>87</strong>-degmo (saldhigeedii bilowga); guddiga Lunty Noofembar wuxuu soo saari doonaa <strong>91</strong>. Dhammaan boqolleyga waa <em>qaybtaarka</em> kursiyada, oo la isbarbar dhigi karo magaca kala-soocyadan. Soo-jeedintu waxay isticmaashaa khariidadda 2019 sida meesha bilowga maxaa yeelay algorithm-ka ReCom wuxuu u baahan yahay khariidad sharci ahaan la dhaqan geliyay si uu uga soo jeediyo is-beddelo — khariidadda 2019 waa khariidadii doorashada Alberta ee ugu dambeysay ee la dhaqan geliyay. Adeegsiga soo-jeedinta guddida kasta saldhig ahaan wuxuu noqon lahaa wareeg: waxaynu cabbirayn lahayn in khariidad ay aad u xad-dhaaftay marka loo eego khariidado laga soo qaatay laftigeed.`,pattern_intro:`Natiijooyinka — meelaynta saddexda khariidad ee dhabta ah qaybintan — waxay tilmaamayaan qaab gaar ah oo qalliin-leh oo sawiritaanka xudduudo.`,sub1_h:`Afarta cabbir ee tirakoobku waxay isku mar shaqeeyaan`,sub1_p:`Marka shaybaadhka rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta la isticmaalo, khariidadda laga yar yahay waa qiime tirakoob ah oo aan caadi ahayn cabbir kasta oo caddaaladda xisbiyeed — ma aha kaliya midda heerka kala-soocida.`,t2_col_a:`Khariidad`,t2_col_b:`Farqiga waxtarka`,t2_col_c:`Dhexe-dhexdhexaad`,t2_col_d:`<a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/reports/academic/report_academic.md" rel="noopener" title="Declination waxay cabbirtaa farqiga zaawiyad ee qalooca kursi-codka ee xisbi kasta. Qiimaha taban wuxuu ku doorbidayaa NDP; kuwa togan waxay doorbidayaan UCP.">Declination</a>`,t2_col_e:`Kursiyo 50/50`,t2_r1_a:`Inta badan 2026`,t2_r1_b:`+0.1% (p15.5)`,t2_r1_c:`−3.6% (p1)`,t2_r1_d:`−0.027 (p20)`,t2_r1_e:`46.1% (p78)`,t2_r2_a:`Inta yar 2026`,t2_r2_b:`<strong>+4.0% (p94.4)</strong>`,t2_r2_c:`<strong>+1.0% (p99.98)</strong>`,t2_r2_d:`<strong>+0.077 (p98.8)</strong>`,t2_r2_e:`<strong>51.7% (p99.99)</strong>`,sub1_close:`Khariidadda inta badan waxay si raaxo leh ugu jirtaa kala-duwanaanta caadiga ah ee saddex ka mid ah afarta cabbir. Dhexe-dhexdhexaadkeeda wuxuu ku yaal p1 (= p0.92) oo jihada NDP loo doorbidayo — natiijo aan caadi ahayn laakiin tilmaamaysa jihada qaldan si ay UCP u caawiso. Khariidadda inta badan oo si dhow u raacaysa xudduudaha dawladda hoose waxay dhigtaa xudunta magaalada ee NDP-ga badan degmooyinkeeda gaarka ah oo iskugu jira, halkaas oo codadka NDP ay ku guulaystaan kala-soocyo waxtar leh halka guulaha UCP ee miyiga ay caadi ahaan yihiin kala-soocyo waaweyn; faa'iidada qaab-dhismeed ee yar ee NDP waa waxa ka muuqda cabbirka dhexe-dhexdhexaadka. Khariidadda laga yar yahay waxay ku jirtaa dabada afarta, mid kastaa wuxuu tilmaamayaa isla jihada xisbiyeed.`,sub2_h:`Heerka kala-soocida 50/50: in ka yar 100 ka mid ah 1,010,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah ayaa gaadha`,sub2_p:`Cabbirka heerka kala-soocida ee kor lagu soo bandhigay — kursiyo UCP ee codka gobol ee 50/50 — waa habka ugu fudud ee loo barbar dhigi karo saddexda khariidadood.`,t3_col_a:`Khariidad`,t3_col_b:`Kursiyo UCP codka 50/50`,t3_col_c:`Halkay joogto`,t3_r1_a:`2019 la dejiyay`,t3_r1_b:`46.0%`,t3_r1_c:`78-aad centile — gudaha kala-duwanaanta caadiga ah`,t3_r2_a:`<strong>Inta badan 2026</strong>`,t3_r2_b:`<strong>46.1%</strong>`,t3_r2_c:`<strong>78-aad centile — si fiican gudaha xadadka</strong>`,t3_r3_a:`<strong>Inta yar 2026</strong>`,t3_r3_b:`<strong>51.7% (46 kursi)</strong>`,t3_r3_c:`<strong>99.99-aad centile — in ka yar 100 ka mid ah 1,010,000 tirinta dhexdhexaadka ah ayaa gaadha</strong>`,sub2_close:`In ka yar 100 ka mid ah 1,010,000 khariidadood oo Alberta dhexdhexaad ah oo kombuyuutar soo saaray ayaa soo saaray qiime <code>seats@50/50</code> oo sarreeya sida soo jeedinta laga yar yahay. Iyada oo ku saleysan qaababka codbixinta dhowaan ee dhabta ah, waxay UCP siisaa 60 kursi (marka loo eego 55 soo jeedinta inta badan). Soo jeedinta inta badan waa nooca khariidad ee habraac dhexdhexaad ah caadi ahaan soo saaro. Soo jeedinta laga yar yahay waa nooca khariidad ee waa inaad si gaar ah u doontaa si aad u sawirto.`,sub3_h:`Macnaheedu maxay tahay luuqad cad`,sub3_p:`Soo jeedinta laga yar yahay waxay ku jirtaa dabada xad-dhaafka ah ee guddiga 1,010,000-qorshe saddex ka mid ah afarta cabbir ee caddaaladda xisbiyeed, afaraadka (farqiga waxtarka, +4.0%) wuxuu ku yaal 94-aad centile — <em>u dhow, laakiin ka hooseeya</em>, xadka hubinta ee horay loo diiwaan-geliyay ee Alberta-loo-calibrate-gareeyay ee 95-aad. Labada kanaal ee tijaabada wadareed waxay wadaagaan xogta hoose ee farqiga-waxtarka, mana aha kuwo tirakoob ahaan madax-bannaan, sidaa darteed isku-darka qiimayaashooda p hoosta habka Fisher wuxuu kor u qaadaa muhiimadda. Xadka sare ee la difaaci karo ee isku-darka isku-xidhnaanta-xasil waa qiyaastii <strong>mid ka mid ah 350,000</strong> (Bonferroni; p&nbsp;≤&nbsp;2.8×10<sup>−6</sup>). Taasi waxay sii tahay natiijo aad u daran, si fiican uga gudubta xadadka muhiimadda caadiga ah — laakiin waxa loo soo sheegaa xad, ma aha afar qalab oo madax-bannaan oo isku raacaya.`,details_summary:`Macnaha qiimahan p — iyo waxa aanay ka dhignayn`,details_p1:`Qiimaha p wuxuu ka jawaabaa hal su'aal: haddii khariidadda uu sawiray habraac dhexdhexaad ah, intee jeer ayaynu arki lahayn natiijo sidan u daran ama ka sii daran? Xadka isku-xidhnaanta-xasil ee p&nbsp;≤&nbsp;2.8×10<sup>−6</sup>, jawaabtu waxay ugu badnaan tahay qiyaastii hal mar 350,000 tijaabo kasta.`,details_p2:`Tani waa tijaabo mala-awaal oo frequentist ah, ma aha cabbir niyad. Ma sheegayso in guddidu ay ula jeeday qaybsi siyaasadeed, mana cabbirayso sida khariidaddu aan caddaalad u ahayn macnaha wax-ku-oolka ah. Waxay sheegtaa in qaabka xudduudu yahay tirakoob ahaan aan la jaan-qaadayn qaybinta tixraaca ee sawir-dhexdhexaadka ah ee ReCom — hubin dibadeed oo xooggan, laakiin aan kaamil ahayn (ma dhaqan-geliyo shuruud kasta oo sharci oo guddidu ku hoos shaqaynaysay, tusaale, heerarka s.15(2) iyo xaddidaadaha danta bulsho).`,details_p3:`Guutada tijaabada qaab-dhismeed (dadka, kala-qaybinta, xajinta, isku-cufnaanta, saxeexyada) ayaa lagu diiwaan-geliyay calaamado wakhti ah ka hor dib-u-xisaabinta canonical-ka ah (<a href="https://osf.io/w2s8k" rel="noopener">Diiwaangelinta OSF w2s8k</a>). Kanaalada eexda xisbiyeed (Mahalanobis isku-jirka ah, SZAT, isku-darka Fisher/Bonferroni) waxa loo calaamadeeyay "sahmin" macnaha hubinta lafteeda ee §4.3.1: oo lagu qoray kaydka, laakiin aan ahayn xog-ka-hor. Hubintu waxay kanaal kasta si gooni ah u soo sheegtaa waxayna isugu darsaa hoosta xadka isku-xidhnaanta-xasil halkii ay u soo bandhigi lahayd inay yihiin tijaabooyin xaqiijin oo si buuxda madax-bannaan.`,szat_label:`TIJAABADA U QAYBINTA AAGA KALA-SOOCIDA (SZAT)`,szat_body:`SZAT waxa loo naqshadeeyay kanaal falanqeyn oo labaad: halkii la weydiin lahaa "khariidaddani guud ahaan ma aad bay u daran tahay?" waxay weydiisaa "doorashooyinka khadadka gaarka ah ma yihiin kuwo xisbi-dhexdhexaad ah?" Waxay u shaqeysaa iyada oo gooni u soocaysa kaliya Aagagga Codbixinta halka khariidadda inta yar ay ka duwan tahay tan inta badan — dib-u-sawirka la murmay — oo tijaabinaysa in doorashooyinkaas gaarka ah, marka la isugu daro, ay waxtarka codka jiho hal xisbi ah ugu wareejiyaan. Maxaa yeelay waxay isbarbar dhigtaa kaliya barbaraha kala-tagga, waxay si toos ah u xakameysaa wax kasta oo labada khariidadood wadaagaan: isla juquraafiga, bartilmaameedyada dadnimada, iyo shuruucda sharciga. Hoosta tijaabo permutation caadi ah SZAT waxay soo celisay p=0.0024; hoosta eber block-permutation oo sax ka qabta autocorrelation aagga ee Aagagga Codbixinta isku xiga, waxay soo celisay p≈0.19 — ma muhiim aha. SZAT waxa loo hayaa macno sahmin ah laakiin kuma badbaado kanaal xaqiijin ah. Cinwaanku wuxuu ku tiirsan yahay soo-jeedinta kaliya. <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/findings/szat_summary.json" rel="noopener">Faahfaahin farsamo →</a>`,two_q:`<strong>Natiijada SZAT.</strong> Soo-jeedinta 1,010,000-khariidadood waxay weydiisaa: <em>khariidaddani ma aad bay u daran tahay marka loo eego khariidadaha dhexdhexaadka ah ee laga sawiray isla juquraafiga Alberta?</em> Tijaabo labaad — <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/findings/szat_summary.json" rel="noopener">Tijaabada U Qaybinta Aaga Kala-soocida</a> — waxay weydiisay su'aal kale: <em>khadadka gaarka ah ee khariidadda ma yihiin kuwo xisbi-dhexdhexaad ah?</em> Waxay u shaqeysaa iyada oo eegaysa kaliya Aagagga Codbixinta halka inta yar ay si ka duwan inta badan u sawirtay oo weydiinaysa in doorashooyinkaas gaarka ah, marka la isugu daro, ay waxtarka codka jiho hal xisbi ah ugu wareejiyeen. Hoosta permutation caadi ah waxay soo celisay p=0.0024. Hoosta eber block-permutation — oo sax ka qabta autocorrelation aagga ee Aagagga Codbixinta isku xiga — waxay soo celisay p≈0.19. Natiijada block-permutation ma gaadho muhiimad. Hubintu sidaa darteed waxay soo sheegtaa natiijada soo-jeedinta kaliya sida cinwaan: xad sare oo isku-xidhnaanta-xasil oo ah <strong>1 ka mid ah 350,000</strong> (p&nbsp;≤&nbsp;2.8×10<sup>−6</sup>), ma aha isku-darka Fisher ee laba kanaal oo madax-bannaan.`,super_lead:`Gole sharci dejineed oo 89 kursi ah, aqlabiyad weyn oo saddex meelood laba ah waxay si sax ah u baahan tahay 60 kursi. Qiimaha seats@50/50 ee soo jeedinta laga yar yahay oo ah 51.7% (p99.99 marka loo eego guddiga 1,010,000-qorshe) wuxuu ku jiraa heerka uu aqlabiyadda weyn ee UCP tirakoob ahaan ku gaadhi karto juquraafiga 2023 ee Alberta — laakiin eberka guddigu ma dhaqan-geliyo shuruud kasta oo sharci ah oo guddidu ku shaqaynaysay, sidaa darteed tani waa hubin dibadeed oo xooggan, ma aha caddayn ah inaan khariidad Alberta ah oo sharci u hoggaansan ay gaadhi karin tirada kursiyadan. Caddaynta waddada qaab-dhismeed ee Natiijooyinka 1, 2 iyo 4 (oo aan gabi ahaanba ku xidhnayn eberkan) ayaa xambaarsan culayska ugu badan; booska dabada ee seats@50/50 waa macnaha taageerada.`,super_label:`SABABTA AQLABIYAD WEYN AY MUHIIM U TAHAY`,super_body:`Hoos nidaamka Westminster ee Kanada, Golaha Alberta ma laha heer saddex-meelood-laba ah oo furaya awoodo gaar ah: aqlabiyad xukun — xataa mid yar — waxay hadda ansixin kartaa shuruuc iyo miisaaniyado, ku dhawaaqi kartaa "xidhitaanka" (closure) si ay dooda u soo afjarto, beddeli kartaa xeerarka Golaha, oo dhigi kartaa xubinnimada guddi kasta. Waxa aqlabiyad aad u weyni beddesho waa farqi iyo waarid, ma aha liiska awoodaha. Dawlad haysata 60 ka mid ah 89 kursi waxay xaqiiqo ahaan ka dhowrsan tahay is-khilaafka gudaha — dhowr xubnood oo sagxadda ka gudba ma hanjabi karaan — waxayna la kulantaa mucaarid aad u yar oo aan awoodin inuu ku qasbo kala-qaybsanaan la duubay ama uu joogteeyo baadhitaanka guddiyada. Walaaca halkan jira waa urursanaanta kursiyada iyo yaraanta mucaaridka waxtarka leh, ma aha heer habraac oo la gudbay.`,super_close:`Qaabka magaalo-hybridization-ka ah ee lagu aqoonsaday Waddada 2 — codbixiyayaasha magaalada oo loo qaybiyo degmooyinka miyiga-cidhifka u dhow — waa habka qaab-dhismeed ee la jaan-qaadaya natiijada 60-kursi. Natiijada qaab-dhismeed ee Waddada 2 iyo natiijada tirakoob ee Waddada 1 waxay isuduwaan isla soo jeedinta, isla jihada, iyo isla bulshooyinka.`,sub4_h:`Xaqiijinta tijaabada habraaca la beegsaday`,sub4_p:`Si loo hubiyo in tani aanay ahayn waxweyn ee soo-jeedinta dhexdhexaadka ah ee soo-doorbida la yaqaano ee compactness, hubintu waxay socodsiisay habraac la beegsaday oo fuulista buurta ah (<a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/reports/academic/report_academic.md" rel="noopener">Cannon iyo kuwa kale 2022 — la tixraacay oo lagu sharaxay warbixinta farsamada</a>) labada jiho: kor u qaadista kursiyada UCP iyo kor u qaadista kursiyada NDP. Isla tirada tallaabooyinka (40,000) jiho kasta, isla xaddidaadaha sharciga, isla joomatariga gobolka.`,t4_col_a:`Habraac`,t4_col_b:`Qiimaha ugu sarreeya ee la gaaray`,t4_col_c:`Waxa uu naga sheegayo`,t4_r1_a:`MCMC dhexdhexaad, kor u soo saaray`,t4_r1_b:`51.72% kursiyada UCP @ 50/50 (66 ka mid ah 1,010,000 qorshe ayaa ka sarreeya 51.69% ee inta yar)`,t4_r1_c:`Saqafka dabiiciga ah ee sawir dhexdhexaad`,t4_r2_a:`MCMC dhexdhexaad, hoos u soo saaray`,t4_r2_b:`~39% kursiyada UCP @ 50/50`,t4_r2_c:`Sagxada dabiiciga ah ee sawir dhexdhexaad`,t4_r3_a:`Fuulida buurta la beegsaday, kor u qaadista UCP`,t4_r3_b:`<strong>52.9%</strong>`,t4_r3_c:`Waxa habraac si ula kac ah u doonayo faa'iidada UCP gaadhi karo`,t4_r4_a:`Fuulida buurta la beegsaday, kor u qaadista NDP`,t4_r4_b:`<strong>37.9%</strong>`,t4_r4_c:`Waxa habraac si ula kac ah u doonayo faa'iidada NDP gaadhi karo (ka hoos sagxadda dhexdhexaadka ah)`,sub4_close:`51.7% ee khariidadda laga yar yahay waxay u dhow tahay saqafka ucP la beegsaday (52.9%) marka loo eego dhexe dhexdhexaadka ah (44.8%). 46.1% ee khariidadda inta badan waxay ku taal dhexe dhexdhexaadka ah. Labada khariidadood ee la dejiyay ee 2019 iyo inta badan ee 2026 waxay si raaxo leh ugu dhacaan halka habraaca dhexdhexaadka ahi caadi ahaan u soo saaro — qaybtaarka codad kala duwan, isla aagga natiijooyin aan caadi ahayn. Inta badan waxay sii wadaa dhaqanka 2019 ee Alberta dhinaca caddaaladda xisbiyeed isla sida ay u sii wadaa dhaqanka 2019 xajinta dawladda hoose (80.0% iyo 75.2% 2019). Laba khariidadood oo lagu sawiray isla shuruucda Alberta, oo ay sawireen isla shanta la-taliye, isla qolka: mid wuxuu ku dhacaa halka habraacyada dhexdhexaadka ahi caadi ahaan ka soo baxaan, kan kale wuxuu ku dhacaa halka aad u baahan tahay inaad si gaar ah u beegsato.`,sub4_quote:`<em>Tani</em> waa qaabka natiijada, waana qaabka uu maxkamadu dhab ahaan adeegsado.`,sub5_h:`Diidmada sharaxaadaha kale`,sub5_p:`Marka la soo bandhigo qiime aan caadi ahayn oo tirakoob oo cabbirkan ah, hubin daacad ah waa inay ka takhaluso sharaxaadaha aan eedaynayn ka hor inta aanay qaababkan u xil saarin nashqad ula kac ah. Xogta qaab-dhismeed (Waddada 2) waxay si nidaamsan u burin difaaca caadiga ah:`,defense1:`<strong>Difaaca "Juquraafiga Siyaasadeed ee Dabiiciga ah":</strong> <em>("Codbixiyayaasha magaaladu si dabiici ah ayay u urursan yihiin; khariidaddu kaliya waxay tarjumeysaa juquraafiga Alberta.")</em> 1,010,000 soo-jeedin ayaa horay u tixgalin juquraafiga dabiiciga ah ee Alberta. Juquraafigu runtii wuxuu siiyaa UCP faa'iido aasaasi ah oo waxtar — laakiin labada khariidadood ee dhabta ah ee la barbardhigayo ayaa muujinaya halka faa'iidadaas si dabiici ah ugu xidhanto: khariidaddii la dejiyay ee 2019 iyo khariidadda inta badan ee 2026 labaduba waxay ku yaalliin 78-aad centile ee cabbirka barta rogitaanka, khariidadda 2019 sarreynteedana ugu sarreysa cabbir kasta oo xisbiyeed waa 90-meeyada hoose (declination, 91-aad centile). Khariidadda laga yar yahay waxay ku taal 99.99-aad centile — qiime aan caadi ahayn oo aad u sarreeya <em>xitaa marka loo eego saldhigga si dabiici ah u eexday ee Alberta</em>.`,defense2:`<strong>Difaaca "Bulshooyinka Danta Iska Leh":</strong> <em>("Qaababka cajiibka ah waxa loo sawiray si loo mideeyo bulshooyin gaar ah.")</em> Haddii aad isku dayeyso inaad bulshooyin mid keenis, waxaad raacaysaa xudduudaha dawladda hoose. Khariidadda inta badan waxay raacday xadadka magaalada ee jira 80% wakhtiga. Khariidadda laga yar yahay waxay raacday 72% wakhtiga — labadaba ku jira caadiga Kanada ee 70–85%. Waxa khariidadda laga yar yahay sameyso si firfircoon waa kala-qaybinta magaalada Airdrie afar qaybood oo gooni ah, iyo dejinta saddex ka mid ah go'aamadeeda xudduud sax ahaan aagagga magaalo-cidhif ee guddidu calaamadeeyey inay yihiin kuwo joomatari ahaan aan caadi ahayn — doorashooyin aan lagu sharixi karin caqliga bulshooyinka danta iska leh.`,defense3:`<strong>Difaaca "Sinaanta Dadka":</strong> <em>("Waa inay sawiraan xudduudo cajiib ah si ay u hubiyaan in degmo kasta uu leeyahay isla tirada dadka.")</em> Khariidadda laga yar yahay dhab ahaan waxay aad u <em>liidataa</em> sinaanta dadka. Mean Absolute Deviation (MAD) ee dadkeedu wuxuu ahaa 4,707 — 48% ka ballaadhan 3,180 ee khariidadda inta badan. Marka loo salaynayo guddiga ku salaysan shapefile-yada rasmiga ah, halkaas oo lamaanaha MAD ee la barbardhigi karo ay yihiin 3,938 (inta yar) iyo 2,827 (inta badan), faafinta dadka ee inta yar waxay ku taal 99-aad centile — kaliya 1 ka mid ah 100 khariidad oo dhexdhexaad ah ayaa soo saara kala-duwanaansho ka sii daran. Waxay hurtay sinaanta dadka si ay u gaadho qaabkeeda.`,defense4:`<strong>Difaaca "Karti-darro ama Nasiib Xun":</strong> <em>("Kaliya waxay sawireen khariidad foosheed waxayna ku nasiib xumaadeen tirooyinka.")</em> In la gaadho sax 60 kursi oo loogu talagalay aqlabiyad weyn iyada oo la kala qaybinayo Airdrie afar qaybood oo la dhigayo saddex xuduud sax ahaan aagagga uu guddoomiyaha guddidu lafteedu calaamadeeyay inay yihiin kuwo aan caadi ahayn waxay u baahan tahay saxnaan qalliin leh. Xadka sare ee isku-xidhnaanta-xasil ah ee ah itimaalka in si lama filaan ah loo sawiro khariidad sidaas u daran labada kanaal falanqeyn ee hoosta qaybinta tixraaca ee ReCom-ka dhexdhexaadka ah waa qiyaastii <strong>1 ka mid ah 350,000</strong> (p&nbsp;≤&nbsp;2.80×10<sup>−6</sup>). Xadkaasi weli waa mid aad u daran — si fiican uga gudba xadadka caadiga ah ee macnaha — laakiin waxa loo soo sheegaa xad, ma aha hal itimaal oo qudha oo sax ah.`,sub5_close:`Waxa xogtu muujineyso waa in soo jeedinta laga yar yahay ay sii xumeysay labada sinaanta dadka iyo isku xidhnaanta bulshada marka loo eego waxa isla shanta la-taliye ay isku mar soo saareen hoos shuruucda sharciga oo isku mid ah. Hubintu ma go'aaminayso waxa la-taliyayaasha laga yar yahay ay ula jeedeen — joomatariga xuduudu ma muujin karo niyad — laakiin ka leexitaanka qaab-dhismeed ee guddi dhexdhexaadka ah iyo soo-saarka soo jeedinta inta badan wuu sii jiraa iyada oo aan loo eegin niyada.`,sub6_h:`Ogeysiis ku saabsan xaqiijinta is-tixraaca ah ee R`,sub6_p1:`Nooca hore ee hubintan (oo isticmaalay shaybaadhka qiyaaska ah halkii uu adeegsan lahaa kuwa rasmiga ah) ayaa is-tixraac ku sameeyay guddiga Python ReCom marka loo eego qaadaha Sequential Monte Carlo ee package-ka R <code>redist</code>. Xaqiijintu waxa ay soo saartay natiijooyin aan deggenayn: saddex socodsiin oo isla iniin ah, qaybta qorshayaasha gaadhaya qiimaha hore ee laga yar yahay (48.3% joomatariga qiyaaska) waxay ahaayeen 5.6%, kadibna 28%, kadibna 58% — guuldarro isugu yimaadka qaadaha, ma aha helitaan. Qoraalka oo dhammaystiran wuxuu ku yaal <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/findings/redist_python_comparison.md" rel="noopener">findings/redist_python_comparison.md</a>.`,sub6_p2:`Iyada oo la isticmaalayo shaybaadhka rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta, <code>seats@50/50</code> ee khariidadda laga yar yahay wuxuu kor u kacayaa 51.7% — qiime ay in ka yar 100 qorshe oo ka mid ah 1,010,000 qorsho oo dhexdhexaad ah gaaraan. Su'aasha xaqiijinta is-tixraaca ee R waxay noqotaa mid aan macno lahayn: eber qorshe oo ka soo qaadaha midkood ayaa gaadha qiimaha canonical-ka ah cabbirrada muunadka oo la mid ah.`,sub6_asymm:`<strong>Sinaan la'aanta agagaarka 50/50 ayaa ka muhiimsan rogga laftiisa.</strong> Sahanka saxda ah ee qalooca kursi-codka heerka 0.01 dhibic-boqolkiiba wuxuu helay in khariidadda laga yar yahay ay UCP ku haysato kor ama heerka aqlabiyadda sharci dejinta ee 45 kursi ilaa qaybtaarka codka gobol ee UCP ee qiyaastii <strong>49.7%</strong>. Tani teknik ahaan waa rog cod-kursi — UCP wuxuu samaynayaa dawladda khariidadda laga yar yahay isaga oo lumiyo codka caadiga ah 0.3 dhibic-boqolkiiba — laakiin 0.3 dhibic waxay si fiican ugu jiraan caadiga buuq-ka raadinta caadiga ah, sidaa darteed keligeed tani ma aha natiijo aad u xun. Waxa <em>aad u</em> qarsoodi ah waa farqiga: khariidadda <strong>inta badan</strong>, UCP wuxuu u baahan yahay inuu <em>guulaysto</em> codka caadiga ah qiyaastii 4 dhibic-boqolkiiba si uu u gaadho isla heerka 45-kursi ah. Labada khariidadoodba waxay wajahaan isla juquraafiga Alberta iyo isla shuruucda sharciga; farqiga u dhexeeya — 0.3pp iyo +4pp — waa farqi qaab-dhismeed, ma aha buuq.`,sub6_close:`Tani waa natiijada eexsanaan qaab-dhismeed ee hubintu ku qabto kalsooni. Waa joomatari kaliya; kuma xidhna natiijo doorasho; ma dhaqaaqo marka raadinta dhaqaaqaan.`,sub6_caveat:`<strong>Ogeysiis hubintu si dhab ah ula qaadayso.</strong> Codbixiyayaal dhab ah ma aha 50/50 isku mid ah. Codbixiyayaashu waxay garaaci karaan eexsanaanta qaab-dhismeed ee khariidad kasta haddii ay ku raagaan firgashada — codbixiyayaal aad uga xumaaday ama dareemay waxay rogi doonaan natiijada iyada oo aan loo eegin sida xudduudaha loo sawiray. Tijaabada 50/50 waxay gooni u sooctaa <em>tabarucida khariidadda ee natiijada</em>, ma aha natiijada laftigeeda. Waxa ay muujinayso waa waxa khariidaddu sameyso markii codbixiyayaashu aanay u go'aaminin.`,sub7_h:`Gunaanadka`,sub7_p1:`Natiijada udub-dhexaadka ah ee hubintu waa joomatari. <strong>Waddada 2 — kaadhka buundooyinka aan caadiga ahayn ee qaab-dhismeedku — waa aasaaska; Waddada 1 waa caddayn in joomatarigu shaqo xisbiyeed sameynayo.</strong>`,sub7_p2:`Sawirka hoosee wuxuu dhigayaa labada waddo sawir keliya. Toosanaha jiifa waa Waddada 1 (farqiga waxtarka caddaaladda xisbiyeed, oo midig u dheer macnaheedu yahay UCP loo doorbidaayo); toosanaha taagan waa Waddada 2 (tirada imtixaanada caddaaladda qaab-dhismeed ee soo jeedinta ay ku dhacdo, shanta laga bilaabo, oo sare u dheer macnaheedu yahay mashaakil qaab-dhismeed oo badan).`,stakes_fig_alt:`Khariidad firidhsan oo leh farqiga waxtarka ee toosanaha jiifa iyo tirada imtixaanada qaab-dhismeed ee la dhicid oo ku taal toosanaha taagan. Khariidaddii la dejiyay ee 2019 iyo khariidadda inta badan ee 2026 way ku urursan yihiin geeska ammaanka ah ee hoose-bidix. Khariidadda inta yar ee 2026 waxay ka muuqataa gobolka aan caadiga ahayn ee sare-midig.`,stakes_fig_caption:`Labada hab ee lagu cabbiro labada soo jeedin ee guddida, oo isla la sawiray. Bidix ilaa midig: inta soo jeedintu uga muuqato eexday tirada caddaaladda xisbiyeed — sida ay midig u sii dheereyso, sida ay UCP u doorbidayso. Hoose ilaa sare: imtixaanada caddaaladda qaab-dhismeedka ee shanta inta soo jeedintu ka dhacday — sida ay sare u sii dheereyso, sida ay u liidato. Khariidaddii la dejiyay ee 2019 waxay ku jirtaa geeska ammaanka: hoose labadaba. Soo jeedinta inta badan 2026 way ku xidhantaa eber dhibaato qaab-dhismeed iyo eex xisbiyeed oo ku dhow eber (+0.1%). Soo jeedinta inta yar 2026 waa qiime aan caadi ahayn oo qaab-dhismeed imtixaan kasta oo kala soocaya labada khariidadood (4 ka mid ah 5; shanaadka, xajinta, waa dhexdhexaad labadaba); farqiga waxtarka (+4.0%) wuxuu ku taal xoogaa ka hooseeya xariiqda xadka Alberta.`,stakes_table_intro:`Isla natiijooyinka qaab soo koobid oo cad, oo la bilaabay natiijada qaab-dhismeed maxaa yeelay caddaynta is-tixraaca ah ayaa ugu adag taageerto:`,t5_col_b:`Waddada 2: Qaab-dhismeed (joomatari kaliya, codad ma aha)`,t5_col_c:`Waddada 1: Tirooyin (waxay ku xidhantahay codad)`,t5_r1_a:`<strong>Inta badan 2026</strong>`,t5_r1_b:`nadiif — ma gudbiso xad <em>kasta</em> qaab-dhismeed`,t5_r1_c:`gudaha kala-duwanaanta caadiga ah cabbir kasta (<code>seats@50/50</code> 46.1% — p78; farqiga waxtarka +0.1%)`,t5_r2_a:`<strong>Inta yar 2026</strong>`,t5_r2_b:`<strong>waxay ka gudbaysaa 4 ka mid ah 5 xadadka qaab-dhismeed</strong> kala sooc weyn (xajinta dhexdhexaad — labada khariidadood ku jira caadiga Kanada)`,t5_r2_c:`booska dabada saddex ka mid ah afarta cabbir ee caddaaladda xisbiyeed — <code>seats@50/50</code> 51.7% (p99.99, qiyaastii 66 ka mid ah 1,010,000 ayaa gaadha); dhexe-dhexdhexaad p99.98; declination p98.8 (dabada UCP); farqiga waxtarka +4.0% (p94.4, <em>u dhow laakiin ka hooseeya</em> xadka 95-aad centile ee horay loo diiwaan-geliyay); xad isku-jirka ah oo isku-xidhnaanta-xasil p&nbsp;≤&nbsp;2.8×10<sup>−6</sup> (≈ 1 ka mid ah 350,000)`,details2_summary:`Sababta Waddada 2 ay xambaaraysay dacwadda — faahfaahin farsamo`,details2_p:`Hubintu waxay horay u diiwaan-gelisay shan tijaabo oo aan-caadi-ahaan-qaab-dhismeed ah Abriil 24, 2026 ka hor inta aan natiijooyinka soo-jeedinta kama-dambaysta ah la isu keenin. Xajintu waa dhexdhexaad labada khariidadood; afarta tijaabo ee hadhay inta yar way ka gudubtaa mid kasta inta badanna midna ma gudbiso. Cabbirradaasi waa joomatari — kuma xidhna qaade tirakoob oo kasta ama u-qaybin cod oo kasta. <strong>Tani waa natiijada udub-dhexaadka ah.</strong> Waddada 1 (tirooyinka caddaaladda xisbiyeed) waxay xaqiijisaa Waddada 2 hoosta shaybaadhka rasmiga ah ee canonical-ka ah: inta yar waxay ku taal dabada guddiga 1,010,000-qorshe saddex ka mid ah afarta cabbir ee horay loo diiwaan-geliyay, farqiga waxtarka oo ku yaal p94.4 (<em>u dhow, laakiin ka hooseeya</em>, xadka 95-aad centile ee horay loo diiwaan-geliyay), hoosta xad sare wadareed oo isku-xidhnaanta-xasil oo p&nbsp;≤&nbsp;2.8×10<sup>−6</sup> (≈ 1 ka mid ah 350,000; wuxuu beddelaa tiro hore oo Fisher-isku-darsan oo kor u qaaday muhiimadda wadareed iyada oo u tixgelisay laba kanaal oo xog isku dhaftay inay madax-bannaan yihiin). Su'aasha ah in joomatariga aan caadiga ahayn ee Waddada 2 uu yahay <em>habka</em> gaarka ah ee ka dambeeya tirooyinka Waddada 1 waa la tijaabiyay jawaabtuna waa maya — eeg <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/findings/redist_python_comparison.md" rel="noopener">findings/redist_python_comparison.md</a>. Tijaabada U Qaybinta Aaga Kala-soocida waxa lagu socodsiiyay doorashooyinka xudduud ee la murmay; hoosta permutation caadi ah waxay soo celisay p=0.0024, laakiin hoosta block permutation (oo sax ka qabaysa autocorrelation aagga ee Aagagga Codbixinta isku xiga) waxay soo celisay p≈0.19 — ma muhiim aha. SZAT waxa loo hayaa macno sahmin ah oo keliya. Si gooni ah, su'aasha habka waa la tijaabiyay: in qaababka xudduudaha laftoodu — corridor-ka lasso-ga, balaadhinta beeyada — ay yihiin sababta tooska ah ee rogga kursiga; maaha. Saamaynta kursigu waxay ka timaadaa sida u-qoondaynta Aagga Codbixin ee dib loo sawiray ay waxtarka codka ugu wareejiso degmooyinka, ma aha qaababka laftooda. Labada waddooyinba waxay calaamadeeyaan khariidadda inta yar; waxay ku gaadhaan qalab madax-bannaan. Waddada 2 ayaa dacwadda xambaarsan. Waddada 1 way xaqiijisaa iyada oo aan xambaarin.`},impact:{heading:`5: Saamaynta Matalaadda`,lanes_label:`WADDADA 1 IYO WADDADA 2`,lanes_body:`<strong>Waddada 1 (tirooyinka)</strong> waxay isticmaashaa natiijooyinka doorashada si ay u tijaabiso in khariidaddu si caddaalad ah codadka ugu beddelayso kursiyo — waxay weydiisaa sida khariidaddu u shaqayso qaybinta codka oo kala duwan. <strong>Waddada 2 (qaab-dhismeedka)</strong> waxay eegtaa kaliya khadadka la sawiray — kala-qaybinta magaalooyinka, faafinta dadka, qaababka xudduudaha — iyada oo aan jirin xog doorasho oo kasta. Waddo kasta waa madax-bannaan: khariidad waxay ku dhici kartaa mid iyada oo ka gudbeysa kan kale. Soo jeedinta laga yar yahay way ku dhacaa labada; inta badan way ka gudubtaa labada.`,intro:`Waddada 1 waxay ku xidhantahay natiijooyinka doorashada ee aad khariidadda ku qiimayso. Waddada 2 ma aha. Caddaynta qaab-dhismeed waxay ku jirtaa khariidadaha laftooda — khadadka la sawiray, magaalooyinka la kala qaybiyay, halka xudduuduhu raacayaan ama aanay raacin khadadka maamul ee jira sababo kale awgood. Imtixaanadan, labada khariidadood lama dhowa.`,fig_alt:`Sawir baar-baar ah oo isbarbar dhigaya afar imtixaan oo caddaaladda qaab-dhismeed ah oo horay loo diiwaan-geliyay, iyo bogga dhibcaha guud. Baararka khariidadda inta badani waxay ku yaalliin eber ama si fiican gudaha kala-duwanaanta ammaanka ah. Saddex boggo oo shan ka mid ah waxay leeyihiin xariiq-guuldarro horay loo diiwaan-geliyay (qaalibka, guduudka ah): dheeraadka dadka ee woqooyi-bari/dhexe Calgary, xudduudaha uu calaamadeeyay guddoomiyuhu, iyo bogga guud. Saddexdaas, baarka khariidadda inta yar wuxuu ka gudbaa xariiqda, baarka khariidadda inta badanna wuxuu ku hadhaa gudaheeda. Bogagga faafinta dadka iyo Airdrie ma laha xariiq-guuldarro; bogga faafinta dadku wuxuu muujinayaa inta badan oo ah 3,180 iyo inta yar oo ah 4,707 qof oo ka fog cabbirka ugu habboon ee degmada. Imtixaanka shanaad ee horay loo diiwaan-geliyay, xajinta degmada, wuxuu ahaa mid dhexdhexaad ah labadaba khariidadood — labaduba waxay ku jiraan caadiga Kanada ee 70–85% — sidaas darteed lama muujin; bogga dhibcaha guud wuxuu siiyaa inta yar 4 dhibcood oo 5 ka mid ah, isaga oo xajinta u tirinaya mid dhexdhexaad ah.`,fig_caption:`Afarta imtixaan ee caddaaladda qaab-dhismeed ee horay loo diiwaan-geliyay, dhinac dhinac, iyo bogga dhibcaha guud. Baararka teal-ka ah waa khariidadda inta badan; baararka guduudka ah waa khariidadda inta yar. Khadka qaalibka ah wuxuu ka soo muuqdaa meesha imtixaanku uu leeyahay xad-guuldarro horay loo diiwaan-geliyay: dheeraadka dadka ee woqooyi-bari/dhexe Calgary, xudduudaha uu calaamadeeyay guddoomiyuhu, iyo bogga guud. Baarka inta yar wuxuu ka gudbaa khad kasta oo la muujiyay; baarka inta badan marnaba ma gudbo. Bogagga faafinta dadka iyo Airdrie ma laha xariiq-guuldarro — bogga faafinta dadku wuxuu muujinayaa inta badan oo ah 3,180 iyo inta yar oo ah 4,707 qof oo ka fog cabbirka ugu habboon ee degmada. Imtixaanka shanaad ee horay loo diiwaan-geliyay, xajinta degmada, wuxuu ahaa mid dhexdhexaad ah labadaba khariidadood — labaduba waxay ku jiraan caadiga Kanada ee 70–85% — sidaas darteed halkan lama muujin; bogga dhibcaha guud wuxuu siiyaa inta yar 4 dhibcood oo 5 ka mid ah, isaga oo xajinta u tirinaya mid dhexdhexaad ah.`,table_intro:`Isla shanta imtixaan qaab miis ah, oo xad imtixaan kasta lagu daray ag natiijada. Safka hoose waa <em>soo koobida</em> hubinta — tirada imtixaanada khariidad kastaa ku dhacday shanta laga bilaabay.`,table_col_test:`Imtixaan`,table_col_majority:`Khariidadda inta badan`,table_col_minority:`Khariidadda inta yar`,table_col_direction:`Jiho / Ka faa'iidayste`,table_r1_a:`Xuduudku wuxuu raacaa khadadka dawladda hoose ee jira (caadiga Kanada 70–85%)`,table_r1_b:`80% — gudaha caadi`,table_r1_c:`72% — gudaha caadi`,table_r1_d:`M/J — labada ku jira caadiga Kanada`,table_r2_a:`Faafinta dadka (sii dhow ayay sii fiicantahay)`,table_r2_b:`3,180`,table_r2_c:`4,707 — 48% ka ballaadhan`,table_r2_d:`Qaab-dhismeed (Wuxuu yareeyaa sinaanta codka)`,table_r3_a:`Dheeraadka dadka woqooyi-bari/dhexe Calgary ee ka sarreeya celceliska`,table_r3_b:`2.8%`,table_r3_c:`11.5%`,table_r3_d:`<strong>UCP</strong> (Wuxuu urursaa codadka NDP magaalada)`,table_r4_a:`Xudduudaha uu calaamadeeyay guddoomiyaha guddida`,table_r4_b:`0`,table_r4_c:`3`,table_r4_d:`M/J`,table_r5_a:`Kala-qaybinta Airdrie (xaddidaada ugu yar: 2)`,table_r5_b:`2 qaybood`,table_r5_c:`4 qaybood`,table_r5_d:`<strong>UCP</strong> (Wuxuu jeexaa awooda magaalada/xaafadaha)`,table_r6_a:`<strong>Soo koobid horay loo diiwaan-geliyay</strong> (&ge; 4 ka mid ah 5 = qiime aan caadi ahayn)`,table_r6_b:`<strong>0 ka mid ah 5 oo dhacay</strong>`,table_r6_c:`<strong>4 ka mid ah 5 oo dhacay</strong> (imtixaanka xajintu dhexdhexaad — labada khariidadood ku jira caadiga Kanada; 4-ta imtixaan ee hadhay way wada dhaceen)`,table_r6_d:`<strong>UCP</strong>`,rationales_p:`Natiijo gaar ah, oo kaliya lagu dabaqay inta yar: <strong>shan ka mid ah lixda sabab ee la-taliyayaasha laga yar yahay daabacaad ah ayaa ku dhacay marka si madax-bannaan loo hubiyo</strong>. Tijaabadu waxay socotaa kaliya inta yar maxaa yeelay inta badan ma aanay daabicin liis sababaha ee dib-u-sawirka la murmay — hubintu si simma uma dabaqi karto, halkanna waxa loogu sheegay calaamad keliya halkii ay ka noqon lahayd safafyo dheeraad ah oo tirinta aan caadiga ahayn ee qaab-dhismeed. (Toddobaad dib u sawir ah oo hubintu hore u liistay waxa ay noqotay inay ku xidhan tahay sheegasho xuduud federaal ah oo aan laga raadin karin warbixinta inta yar; waxa la saaray halkii laga tegi lahaa sheegasho daciif ah.)`,chair_appendix_p:`Hubinta sidoo kale waxay tijaabisay sheegashada guddoomiyaha ee gooniya iyo guud ahaan Lifaaqa C ee ah in toddobada qaab hybrid ah ee inta yar la murmay aanay lahayn <strong>taageero dadweyne oo kasta</strong> 1,140+ soo gudbinta dadweynaha. Raadinta keyword ah ee dhammaan kayd-soo gudbinta (94% mishiin u falanqeeyay, 6% sawir kaliya oo laga reebay; habraaca iyo caddaynta qaab-qaab ee <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/findings/submission_search_findings.md" rel="noopener">findings/submission_search_findings.md</a>) waxay soo celisay sawir ka muuqaalsan ka sheegashada guud ee guddoomiyaha ama diidmadiisa guud: guddoomiyuhu wuxuu ku saxay saddex ka mid ah toddoba (kala-qaybinta Airdrie ee afarta, hybrid-ka Calgary–Nolan-Hill–Cochrane, iyo beddelka inta yar ee St. Albert mid kastaa wuxuu ka maqan yahay taageero la diiwaan geliyey), wuxuu ku khaldamay saddex ka mid ah toddoba (Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park wuxuu helay soo jeedin cad oo faahfaahsan ugu yaraan hal soo gudbin oo aagga Clearwater ah iyo dhowr kale oo la jaan qaadaya; Olds–Three-Hills–Didsbury waxay qoraal ahaan u taageereen dadka degan Beiseker; Chestermere waxay helay soo gudbinno badan oo ka soo horjeeda ku-biiritaan Calgary oo si dhab ah ula jaan qaadeysa hadafka inta yar), oo wuxuu qayb ahaan ku khaldamay mid (hybrid-yada Red Deer waxay helay soo jeedin hybrid ah oo Red Deer dhinac ah oo ka timid xubin xil ka haya golaha magaalada Red Deer, oo leh jihada la jaan qaadid laakiin aan saxiis u qaab ahayn). Sahanka "taageero dadweyne oo aan jirin" ee Lifaaqa C ee guddoomiyuhu waa la muujiyay inuu aad u ballaadhan yahay — saddex ka mid ah toddoba ayaa muujiyay been — laakiin lama soo abuurin gabi ahaan, maxaa yeelay saddex ka mid ah toddobaba way taagan yihiin. <strong>Natiijadani waxay ka soo horjeeda guddoomiyaha, ma aha inta yar.</strong>`,summary_p:`<strong>Waddada 2, inta badan waxay ka gudubtaa eber xad qaab-dhismeed. Inta yar way ka gudubtaa mid kasta kala sooc weyn.</strong> Tirintu waa tiro toosan halkii ay ka noqon lahayd itimaal qoys leh oo la calibrate gareeyay — culayskeedu wuxuu ka yimaadaa midnimada jihada (imtixaan kasta oo dhacaya wuxuu tilmaamayaa isla jihada), ma aha xisaab qaybinta eber isugu jirta. Waddada tirakoobka (§3) waxay siisaa itimaalka isku jirka iyada oo loo marayo qalab kale.`},cpd:{heading:`4: Jeexitaan, Urursi, iyo Miirid`,vocab_label:`Saddex dhaqdhaqaaq, hal qorshe`,vocab_packing:`<strong>Urursi</strong> macnaheedu waa cufida codbixiyayaasha hal xisbi degmooyin uu xisbigu ku guulaysto si xad-dhaaf ah — kaadi kasta oo la urursaday wuxuu weli tirsanaa, laakiin wax kuma daro ka baxsan guul. Guulo waaweyn oo aan dheelitirnayn. Codad la khasaariyay.`,vocab_cracking:`<strong>Jeexitaan</strong> macnaheedu waa kala qaybinta bulsho degmooyin badan si aanay ugu guulaysan mid keliya gabi ahaanba. Magaalo xoog ku filan inay xambaarto laba kursi waxay u kala go'aysaa afar, mid kasta oo lagu xidhay aag miyi oo kala duwan. Codad la qaybiyay. Kursi qofnaba ma helo.`,vocab_draining:`<strong>Miirid</strong> waa saaxiibka aagga: degmooyinka la urursay iyo kuwa la jeexay waxa la dhigaa is dhinac si ay taageerayaasha aad ugu urursan yihiin dhinac ka mid ah "u miiraan" awoodda codka ee degmooyinka la murmay ee u dhow. Qaabka isku xigxig wuxuu sii hooseeyaa labada saamayn — urursiga iyo jeexitaanku waxay isku xoojiyaan khadadka degmooyinka.`,vocab_disclaimer:`Saddexdaba waxay dhici karaan iyada oo aan jirin niyad xisbiyeed oo cad. Waxa hubintu cabbirayso waa in qaabka — iyo cabbirkiisa tirakoob — uu la jaan qaadayo waxa habraac khariidad-sawiritaan dhexdhexaad ah uu soo saaro. <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/reports/academic/report_academic.md#5-results" rel="noopener">Habraaca buuxa §5 ee warbixinta farsamada.</a>`,fig_alt:`Khariidad muujineysa kala-qaybinta Airdrie afar degmooyin oo kala duwan oo hoos khariidadda laga yar yahay`,fig_caption:`Kala-qaybinta Airdrie afar degmooyin oo kala duwan hoos khariidadda laga yar yahay, iyada oo lagu dhuumaalaynayo awoodeeda codka magaalada.`,intro:`Shanta la-taliye waxay ka shaqeeyeen isla shuruucda sharciga, isla juquraafiga gobolka, isla kaydka 1,140 soo gudbin dadweyne, iyo isla xogta dimoograafiyada. Labada qabyo-qoraal ee tartanka ah waxay isku raacaan inta badan Alberta. Halka qabyo-qoraallada ay ku kala duwanaadaan, waxay ku kala duwanaadaan doorashooyin qof qolka ku jiraa ay sameyn lahaa. Saddex ka mid ah doorashooyinkaas ayaa qalmaayo in la arko sida doorasho, ma aha tirooyin.`,airdrie_p:`<strong>Waxay u kala qaybisaa Magaalada Airdrie afar qaybood.</strong> Sharciga ayaa qaybta doorashada kasta xadidaayo hal-iyo-rubuc jeer celceliska gobolka, sidaa darteed Airdrie waxay u baahantahay ugu yaraan laba qaybood. Khariidadda inta badan waxay siisaa laba. Inta yar waxay siisaa afar — woqooyi ilaa Olds-Three Hills-Didsbury, bari ilaa Airdrie East, galbeed ilaa Calgary-Foothills-Airdrie West, iyo bartamaha-koonfur ilaa Calgary-Airdrie — mid kastaa lagu xidhay degmo miyi ama Calgary-cidhif oo kala duwan. Deggane Airdrie ah oo leh su'aal ay MLA-deeda weydiineyso waa inay ogaato afar-meelood midkee magaalada ay ku noolaa ka hor inta ay aanay wici karin xafiiska saxda ah. Deriskeedu laba waddo dhinac waxay ku siin doonaan saddex jawaabood oo kala duwan. PTA-da iskuulka cunugeeda ma diri karto hal wafdi oo hal MLA su'aal maalgelin iskuul; waa inay isku duwaan afar wafdi oo afar xafiis, MLA kasta oo si gaar ah uu masuul uga yahay deegaan miyi ama xaafad oo kala duwan. Ururka hockey-ga yar, banki cuntada, Rugta Ganacsiga — urur kasta oo ka shaqaynayo magaalada ahaan ayaa hadda ka shaqeeya afar wax-riding ah oo gobol.`,airdrie_callout_label:`SABABTA AIRDRIE AY MUHIIM U TAHAY`,airdrie_callout_p1:`Airdrie waa magaalada ugu weyn ee Alberta oo aan lahayn MLA-keeda gaarka ah. 85,805 oo qof (tirakoob magaaleed 2024) waxay ka weyn tahay Red Deer; waxay leedahay hal gole, hal biil canshuur, hal qaybsi iskuul — nidaam kasta oo madani ah waxay u arkaan unug.`,airdrie_callout_p2:`Kala-qaybinteeda afar qaybood oo gobol — Calgary-Airdrie, Calgary-Foothills-Airdrie West, Olds-Three Hills-Didsbury, iyo Airdrie East — mid kasta oo si gaar ah loo aqoonsaday awood-siyaasadeed kale oo agagaarka ah, waxay ka saartaa Airdrie khariidadda siyaasadeed ee heerka dawladda ee sawirta. Magaaladu waxay leedahay 85,805 deggane iyo eber kursi oo golaha sharci dejinta oo aqlabiyadda codbixiyayaashu ay ku nool yihiin.`,airdrie_callout_p3:`Kala-qaybin afar-jiho ah waxay aan u muuqato tijaabo kasta oo caddaaladda xisbiyeed marka laga reebo tan weydiineysa: codbixiye ma heli karaa MLA-gooda?`,airdrie_callout_summary:`Labada khariidadoodba waa sharci. Kala-qaybinta afar-jiho ah waa doorasho.`,airdrie_btn:`Tus degmooyinka la calaamadeeyay khariidadda`,anchoring_p:`<strong>Halka ay ka leexato khadadka dawladda hoose, waxay ka leexataa meelo istiraatiiji ahaan muhiim ah.</strong> Marka khariidadaha doorashadu ay raacaan cidhifka magaalo ama tuulo, codbixiyayaashu waxay garan karaan halka qaybtoodu bilaabato oo dhammaato — xariiqda canshuurta hantida, xariiqda qaybinta iskuulka, xariiqda waad-ka ee doorashada hoose, iyo xariiqda doorashada gobolku waxay wada isku yimaadaan. Statistics Canada waxay daabacdaa xudduudahan bilaash. Shaybaadhka rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta, labada khariidadood waxay raacaan khadadka dawladda hoose heerar guud ahaan la mid ah: inta badan 80%, inta yar 72%, labadaba caadiga Kanada ee 70–85% (Quebec: 78%, Ontario: 82%, BC: 71%; guddiyada isbarbardhigga oo lagu xusay monograafkii). (Falanqayntii hore ee hubinta waxay muujisay xajinta laga yar yahay 15% kaliya; tiradu kuma badbaadin dib-u-xisaabin shaybaadhka rasmiga ah — eeg qoraalka saxitaanka hoose.) Indho-indhayntu cajiibka ah ma aha heerka guud laakiin halka leexitaanada laga yar yahay ay ku urursan yihiin: saddexda xuduud ee guddoomiyaha guddidu lafteedu calaamadeeyey inay yihiin kuwo aan caadi ahayn — balaadhinta Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park <button class="ed-trigger" data-ed-name="Rocky Mountain House-Banff Park">tus ↗</button> ee dhul beeyahaaneed oo aan la deganayn ee qaranka, corridor-ka lasso-ga Nolan Hill–Cochrane <button class="ed-trigger" data-ed-name="Calgary-Nolan Hill-Cochrane">tus ↗</button>, iyo balaadhinta Olds–North Airdrie <button class="ed-trigger" data-ed-name="Olds-Three Hills-Didsbury">tus ↗</button> — mid kastaa waa leexitaan ka muuqaal juquraafiga madaniga ah ee horey u jiray aagagga magaalo-cidhif ee saxda ah halka isku-darka codbixiyayaasha magaalada iyo miyiga ay si toos ah saamaynayaan xisbiga ku guulaysta kursiga.`,anchoring_followup:`La-taliyayaasha laga yar yahay waxay siiyeen sababo saddexda xuduud ee la calaamadeeyay mid kasta. Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park, waxay sheegeen cabbirka juquraafiga, corridor-ka Wadada 22, iyo dhowaanshaha kayd-tirooyinka Qabaa'ilka Hore ee Rocky Mountain House; guddoomiyaha guddidu wuxuu balaadhinta dhulka beeyahaaneed ee aan la deganayn ku qeexay "iskuday been ah" si loo buuxiyo cabbirka cabbirka, jumlada waxay ku jirtaa warbixintii rasmiga ah ee ugu dambeysay ee guddida. Nolan Hill–Cochrane, waxay sheegeen xidhiidho gaadiid iyo shaqaale oo la wadaago oo udhexeeya woqooyi-galbeed Calgary iyo Cochrane; xogta Statistics Canada ee safarka-shaqada waxay muujinayaa kaliya 35.8% shaqaalaha Cochrane ayaa Calgary tagaayey, inta badan oo Cochrane laftiisa ka shaqeeya. Balaadhinta Olds–North Airdrie, waxay sheegeen isku xidhnaanta corridor-ka Wadada 2; hubintu waxay heshay in balaadhinta gaarka ah ee Airdrie ay ku dhacday sababo dadnimo. Hubinta madax-bannaani waxay heshay shan ka mid ah lixda sabab-hoosaad ee inta yar daabacday inay dhaceen ama kaliya qaybahaan u taagnaadeen marka loo eego xogta aasaasiga ah.`,packing_p:`<strong>Aagga Calgary waxa loo gooyay si loogu urursho codbixiyayaasha NDP qaybo ka ballaadhan celceliska.</strong> Aragga woqooyi, bari, iyo dhexe ee Calgary <button class="ed-trigger" data-ed-name="Calgary-North West-Bearspaw">tus ↗</button>, qaybaha khariidadda laga yar yahay celcelis ahaan waxay leeyihiin 11.5% ka sarreeyaan dadka gobolka — marka loo eego 2.8% ee inta badan. Isla aagga juquraafi, oo ay sawirtay isla guddida hoos isla xaddidaadaha, waxay soo saartaa degmooyin qaarta ka ballaadhan hal khariidad halkii ay ka soo bixi lahayd kale. Tan waxay la jaan qaadeysaa farra-saxeexa qaab-dhismeed ee <em>urursiga</em>: ku urursashada codbixiyayaasha hal xisbi degmooyin yar laakiin ballaadhan si kaadi kastaa ay yar u culus tahay. Urursiga iyo <em>jeexitaanka</em> (u qaybinta codbixiyayaasha xisbi si khafiif ah degmooyin ay ku khasaaraan kala sooc yar) waa labada dhaqdhaqaaq oo qaybsiga siyaasadeed ee caanka ah; labada way yaraynayaan tirada kursiyada xisbi marka loo eego qaybtiisa codka.`,chair_p:`Guddoomiyaha guddida — oo lagu magacaabay isla Sharcigan, oo ka shaqaynaya isla soo gudbinnada — wuxuu calaamadeeyay saddex xuduud oo khariidadda laga yar yahay sida juquraafi ahaan aan caadi ahayn: balaadhinta Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park ee dhulka beeyahaaneed oo aan la deganayn ee qaranka; corridor-ka qaabka lasso-ga ee Calgary-Nolan Hill–Cochrane; balaadhinta Olds–Three Hills–Didsbury ee woqooyi Airdrie. Inta badan way heshay eber calaamado oo isla guddoomiye. (Naqdinta daabacaadda ee guddoomiyaha waxay daboolaa toddoba qaabab xudduudo oo wadar — afar calaamado joomatari ah warbixinta ugu weyn iyo saddex Lifaaqa C. Hubintani waxay si madax-bannaan u xaqiijisay joomatari aan caadi ahayn saddexda ka mid ah afarta calaamadood ee joomatari; afaraadka, Calgary-Foothills-Airdrie West <button class="ed-trigger" data-ed-name="Calgary-Foothills-Airdrie West">tus ↗</button>, ma gaadhin heerka xaqiijinta hubinta.) Ka sokow calaamadaha joomatari ee guddoomiyaha, tijaabada saxeexa-jeexitaanka ee hubinta lafteeda (acadeemig §5.3.2) waxay calaamadeysaa kala-qaybinta afarta-jaho ee Airdrie shuruud kasta — kala-qaybin bulsho oo dadka Airdrie ka dhigaysa tiro yar afarta riding oo dhan, halka kala-qaybinta laba-jaho ee inta badan aanay midna muujin; Cochrane iyo Chestermere waxay u soo baxaan kuwo jeexitaan u dhow. Qaar ka mid ah waxa xisaabta hubintu calaamadeyso, guddoomiyuhu ma uusan calaamadayn. Hubintu waxay cabbirtaa saamaynta qaab-dhismeed, ma aha niyada.`},litmus:{heading:`3: Imtixaanka Caddaynta ee 1,010,000-Khariidad`,fig_alt:`Histogram muujineysa qaybinta farqiyada waxtarka ee 1,010,000 khariidadood oo Alberta ah oo dhexdhexaad ah. Khariidadaha inta badan waxay ku urursan yihiin agagaarka eber. Khariidadda guddida inta yar (xariiqda guduudka) waxay ku taal 94-aad centile (+4.0%), dabada midig ee hadhka leh. Khariidadda inta badan (xariiqda teal-ka) waxay ku taal +0.1%, si fiican ugu jirta kala-duwanaanta caadiga ah.`,fig_caption:`Qaybinta <button class="vocab-term" data-def="cabbir ah sida codadku si aan dheelitirnayn loogu beddelo kursiyo — qiimaha togan wuxuu doorbidayaa UCP, qiimaha tabanu wuxuu doorbidayaa NDP" aria-expanded="false">farqiyada waxtarka</button> 1,010,000 khariidadood oo Alberta dhexdhexaad ah oo laga sawiray isla juquraafiga. Khariidadaha dhexdhexaadka ah ee badani waxay ku urursan yihiin agagaarka eber; dabada midig oo hadhku waxa ay calaamadeysaa 10% ugu sarreeya. +4.0% ee soo jeedinta laga yar yahay waxay ku taal 94-aad <button class="vocab-term" data-def="boqolleyga khariidado heleen heer ka hooseeya — p94 macnaheedu waa 94 oo 100 khariidad oo dhexdhexaad ah ayaa ka yaraa xisbiyeed kan" aria-expanded="false">centile</button> — gobol in ka yar 6 oo 100 khariidad oo dhexdhexaad ahaan gaaraan. +0.1% ee soo jeedinta inta badan lagama soocayo waxa habraac dhexdhexaad ah caadi ahaan u soo saaraa.`,table_intro:`Miiska wuxuu isbarbar dhigaa labada khariidadood. Shanta safka ah ee ugu horeeyaa ma isticmaalaan natiijooyin doorasho — waa sifooyin khadadka laftooda. Labada ugu dambeeya waxay ku xidhantahay sida codadka loogu xilsaaray degmo kasta.`,table_col_measured:`Waxa la cabbiray`,table_col_majority:`Khariidadda inta badan`,table_col_minority:`Khariidadda inta yar`,table_col_direction:`Jiho / Ka faa'iidayste`,table_r1_a:`Faafinta dadka degmooyinka (sii dhow sii fiican)`,table_r1_b:`3,180`,table_r1_c:`4,707 — 48% ka ballaadhan`,table_r1_d:`Qaab-dhismeed (Wuxuu yareeyaa sinaanta codka)`,table_r2_a:`Dheeraadka dadka woqooyi-bari/dhexe Calgary oo ka sarreeya celceliska`,table_r2_b:`2.8%`,table_r2_c:`11.5%`,table_r2_d:`<strong>UCP</strong> (Wuxuu urursaa codadka NDP magaalada)`,table_r3_a:`Kala-qaybinta Airdrie`,table_r3_b:`2 qaybood`,table_r3_c:`4 qaybood`,table_r3_d:`<strong>UCP</strong> (Wuxuu jeexaa awooda magaalada/xaafadaha)`,table_r4_a:`Xudduudaha raacaya khadadka dawladda hoose ee jira`,table_r4_b:`80% — gudaha caadi`,table_r4_c:`72% — gudaha caadi`,table_r4_d:`M/J — labada ku jira caadiga Kanada (70–85%)`,table_r5_a:`Xudduudaha uu calaamadeeyay guddoomiyaha guddida`,table_r5_b:`0`,table_r5_c:`3`,table_r5_d:`M/J`,table_r6_a:`Kursiyo codka 50/50 (centile soo-jeedinta 1,010,000-khariidad)`,table_r6_b:`46.1% — p78 (kala-duwanaanta caadi)`,table_r6_c:`51.7% — p99.99 (in ka yar 100 ka mid ah 1,010,000 ayaa gaadha)`,table_r6_d:`<strong>UCP</strong>`,table_r7_a:`Farqiga Waxtarka (centile soo-jeedinta 1,010,000-khariidad)`,table_r7_b:`+0.1% — p15.5 (kala-duwanaanta caadi)`,table_r7_c:`+4.0% — p94.4`,table_r7_d:`<strong>UCP</strong>`,table_r8_a:`Qaabka urursi-jeexitaan ee deriska`,table_r8_b:`2 calaamado silsilad isku xidhan`,table_r8_c:`1 (GUUL horay loo diiwaan-geliyay)`,table_r8_d:`Dhexdhexaad — inta yar waxay gaartaa saamayn xisbiyeed iyada oo loo marayo hybridization, ma aha miirid is-deris (§5.3.5)`,vocab_label:`EREYBIXIN`,vocab_eg:`<strong>Farqiga waxtarka.</strong> Tiro keliya oo cabbirta sida codad xisbi aan dheelitirnayn loogu tarjumo kursiyo. Tirooyinka togan waxay doorbidayaan UCP; kuwa tabanu waxay doorbidayaan NDP. Hubintu waxay isticmaashaa qiyaastii 4.1% xariiqda qiimaha aan caadi ahayn ee Alberta — qiimaha la xad-dhaafay kaliya 5% ee 1,010,000 soo-jeedin oo dhexdhexaad ah oo gaar u ah Alberta. Xadkani lagama ammaahan suugaanta Mareykanka ama guud; xad lagu calibrate gareeyay xukun kale wuxuu noqon lahaa khalad maxaa yeelay juquraafiga dabiiciga ah ee Alberta wuxuu soo saaraa kala-duwanaansha dhexdhexaad ah oo kala duwan.`,vocab_mm:`<strong>Farqiga dhexe-dhexdhexaadka.</strong> Farqiga u dhexeeya qaybta cod degmo ee dhexe ee xisbi iyo qaybta cod degmo ee celceliska. Marka xisbi ku guulaysto tartano badan oo dhow, dhexe wuxuu ku taal kor celceliska — codadkaas waxa la qaybiyay si waxtar leh. Marka xisbi ku guulaysto tartano badan kala-sooc weyn, celcelisku wuxuu ku taal kor dhexe — codad waa la khasaarinayaa. Farqi weyn dhexe-dhexdhexaad jiho ah wuxuu calaamadeeyaa karti-darro qaab-dhismeed sida codadka dhinac loo faafiyay degmooyinka.`,vocab_percentile:`<strong>Kala-soocida centile.</strong> Hubintan, "centile" waa darajo gudaha 1,010,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah oo la sawiray. "p94" macnaheedu waa 94% khariidadaha dhexdhexaadka ah ayaa ka hooseeya — khariidadda dhabta ahi waxay ka sii ka baxsan tahay 94% tirinta dhexdhexaadka ah. "p99.99" macnaheedu waa in ka yar 1 oo 10,000 khariidad oo dhexdhexaad ah ayaa gaara heerkan.`,vocab_anchoring:`<strong>Xajin.</strong> Qaybtaarka xuduud doorasho oo ku taal khad maamul oo horey u jiray — xadkii magaalada, xuduud qaybinta iskuulka, xariiqda tirakoob ee Statistics Canada.`,closing_p1:`Safafyada hoose waxay ku xidhantahay natiijooyinka doorashada. Tijaabada <em>seats@50/50</em> waxay hayaa codbixiyayaasha sinaan sax ah (UCP iyo NDP mid kastaa wuxuu ku guulaystaa siman ah kala badh codadka gobol ahaan) waxayna weydiisaa immisa kursi oo khariidaddu UCP siineyso. Khariidadda Alberta ee dhexdhexaadka ah waxay soo saartaa dhexe agagaarka 44.8% kursi UCP. Juquraafiga Alberta — codbixiyayaasha NDP ee ku urursan xudunta magaalada, codbixiyayaasha UCP ee ku faafsan riding-yada miyiga — wuxuu siiyaa NDP faa'iido yar oo waxtar dhexdhexaadnimo. Khariidadda inta badan ee 46.1% waxay ku taal 78-aad centile ee soo-jeedinta 1,010,000-khariidad, si fiican ugu jirta kala-duwanaanta caadiga ah. Khariidadda inta yar ee 51.7% waxay ku taal 99.99-aad centile: in ka yar 100 ka mid ah 1,010,000 tirinta dhexdhexaad ayaa gaara qiimahaas. Tirada <em>farqiga waxtarka</em> waxay cabbirtaa sida aan dheelitirnayn ee codadka xisbi kasta loogu tarjumo kursiyo. Shaybaadhka rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta farqiga waxtarka ee inta yar waa +4.0%, taas oo ku dhigaysa 94.4-aad centile — xoogaa ka hooseeya xariiqda qiimaha aan caadi ahayn ee hubinta ee 95-aad centile. Su'aalaha furitaanka ee bogga sare way furayaan natiijooyinkii.`,closing_p2:`Safka ugu dambeeya waa halka khariidadda inta yar ay leedahay calaamado silsilad isku xidhan oo ka yar inta badan tijaabada miirida deriska: 1 marka loo eego 2 ee inta badan (iyo 5 ee khariidadda la dejiyay ee 2019). Hubintu waxay horay u diiwaan-gelisay tijaabadan ka hor cabbirka, tiradi yar ee inta yari waa GUUL run ah oo horay loo diiwaan-geliyay — inta yar ma muujineyso qaabka caanka ah ee deriska urursi-miirid. Waa tijaabada keligeed halkaas oo inta yar ay tirakoob ahaan ka fiicantahay inta badan. §5.3.5 ee warbixinta akadeemiga waxay sharaxaysaa sababta: inta yar waxay gaartaa saamayntee xisbiyeed iyada oo loo marayo hybridization (kala-qaybinta magaalada oo gudaha keenta urursi iyo jeexitaan degmooyin shakhsiyaad ah), oo aan u muuqato tijaabada silsilad-deris oo cabbirta kaliya sida degmooyinka la urursay ay isugu yimaadaan agagaarka kuwa la jeexay.`},commission_split:{heading:`2: Sida Guddidu u Kala Qaybsantay`,intro:`Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada ee Alberta waxay shaqadeeda dhammaystirtay Maaris 23, 2026 oo ma ay heshiin karin. Saddex la-taliye ayaa soo saaray hal khariidadood; labada kale waxay soo saareen mid kale. Guddoomiyaha Guddida Mudane Garsoore Dallas K. Miller iyo laba la-taliye oo uu magacaabay mucaaridku ayaa qoray warbixintii inta badan; laba la-taliye oo uu dawladdu magacawday — Dr. Julian Martin iyo John D. Evans — ayaa qoray warbixinta laga yar yahay. Kala-qaybinta waxay diiradda saartay sida loo sawiri lahaa xudduudaha bulshooyinka cidhif-magaaleed ee si dhakhso ah u koraya. Inta badan waxay siiyeen Airdrie laba degmooyin; inta yar afar. Inta badan waxay sawireen qaybaha woqooyi, bari, iyo dhexe ee Calgary u dhow celceliska gobolka; inta yar waxay sawireen 11.5% ka sarreeya. Labada khariidadood waxay raacaan isla sharciga. Labadaba waa sharci hoos <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em>. Khilaafku wuxuu ku saabsanaa qaababka juquraafi gaarka ah ee si fiican u adeegay bulshooyinka la sawirayey. Xisbiga xukunka qabsada ee Alberta waa United Conservative Party (UCP); mucaaridkii ugu weyn waa New Democratic Party (NDP). Xisbiyada yar yar — Alberta Party, Liberal Party of Alberta, iyo kuwa kale — waxay sidoo kale ka tartamaan kursiyo, laakiin qaybta codka gobolka ee la isku daray waxay ku hoosaysa doorashooyinkii dhowaa oo aanay si dhab ah u saamaynayn xisaabaha caddaaladda xisbiyeed ee hubinta, oo ku saleysan kala-qaybinta 2023 ee UCP–NDP. Hubintani waxay cabbirtay labada khariidadood iyada oo isticmaaleysa isla habab, oo si isku mid ah loo dabaqay. Saddex natiijooyin ayaa muuqda.`,finding1:`<strong>Labada khariidadood waxay ku kala duwanaadaan lix wax oo aad cabbiri karto iyada oo aanad fiirinin natiijooyin doorasho:</strong> sida dadku si siman loogu faafiyay degmooyinka, in codbixiyayaashu ay urursan yihiin, sida magaalooyinka aad loogu kala gooyay, in xudduuduhu raacaan xudduudaha magaalada, qaabka degmooyinka, iyo immisa xuduud uu Guddoomiyaha Guddida Mudane Garsoore Miller lafteedu calaamadeeyay inay yihiin kuwo aan caadi ahayn (§5.8.2 warbixinta inta badan iyo Lifaaqa C). Khariidadda inta yari way ka duwantahay inta badan mid kasta oo kaas ka mid ah.`,finding2:`<strong>Farqi kasta oo la cabbiray wuxuu u dhaqaaqaa isla jiho.</strong> Meel kasta oo labada khariidadood ay ku kala duwanaadaan — woqooyi iyo bari Calgary, Airdrie, aagagga magaalada ee leh xudduudaha cad ee magaalada — khariidadda laga yar yahay waxay sawirtaa xudduudo si khafiif ah u faafiya codadka NDP oo u oggolaada codadka UCP inay si waxtar leh u tirsanaadaan. Bulshooyinka aad ugu beddesho khariidadda laga yar yahay waa isla bulshooyinka halka NDP ay ugu xoog badan tahay. Hubintu ma go'aamin karto niyad. Waxay cabbiri kartaa saamayn.`,finding3:`<strong>Habraaca hadda kor u qaadaya khariidadda laga yar yahay tusaale uma laha wareegyada dib-u-qaybinta Kanada ee la-baaray hubinta — qiimayn uu cilmiga siyaasadda Duane Bratt (Mount Royal University) qoraal ahaan la wadaagay qoraaga.</strong> Gobolada la baaray midkoodna uma oggolo golaha xukunku inuu dib-u-qaybinta u dhiibo guddi uu xisbigiisu xukumo wareeg dib-u-qaybin oo dhexe. Inta badan gobolada ayaa u baahan in golaha sharci dejintu marka hore ka dooddo khariidadda la-taliyayaasha, ama siiya khariidadda guddida saamayn iskeed ah marka aan la cusboonaysiin. Alberta midkoodna ma sameyso. Abriil 16, dawladdu waxay dib u dhigtay labada khariidadood ee guddida oo shaqada u dhiibtay guddi MLA ah oo aqlabiyadda xubnaheeda ay ka kala yimaadeen United Conservative Party (UCP) xukunka haya; isku-darka iyo xilka buuxa ee guddiga waxa la sharaxay §7. <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> ee Alberta wuxuu u baahan yahay golaha sharci dejintu inuu ansixiyo Electoral Districts Act oo gooni ah si uu warbixin guddi sharci u siiyo — warbixinta guddidu laftigeedu waxba ma beddesho. Inta badan gobolada kale waxay ka dhigaan warbixinta guddida mid sharci ahaan saameeya haddii aan golaha sharci dejintu si firfircoon u joojin; sida caadiga ah ee Alberta way rogtaa, taas oo macnaheedu yahay xisbiga xukunku wuxuu xukumaa in khariidad guddi ay weligood noqoto sharci. Sababta dawladdu sheegtay waxay ahayd hirgelinta Talooyinka 5 ee Guddoomiyaha Guddida Mudane Garsoore Miller. Laakiin Miller wuxuu qoray talooyinka si gaar ah si uu uga niyadjabiyo golaha sharci dejinta inuu aqbalo khariidadda laga yar yahay, asxaabtiisii inta badanna ma taageerin. Talooyinka 5 sidoo kale waa la go'doomiyay juquraafi ahaan: hal kursi miyi oo dheeraad ah oo koonfurta Edmonton, iyo mid Degmada Clearwater iyo galbeedka Degmada Mountain View — labadaba aad uga fog bulshooyinka cidhif-magaaleed ee si dhakhso ah u koraya ee Calgary iyo Edmonton oo guddidu dhab ahaan u kala qaybsantay. Lama ahayn cad ah in dib loo sawiro xudduudaha la murmay. Dawladdu waxay aqbashay tirada kursiyada iyada oo siineysa guddi ay xukunto awood saxda ah ee khadadka ay guddidu ku heshiin la'aatay.`,closing:`<strong>Habraacu waa natiijada laftiisa, oo ka gooni ah khariidadaha.</strong>`},november:{heading:`7: Guddiga Lunty`,context_label:`MACNAHA`,context_body:` — Qaybtan waxay sharaxaysaa habraaca beddelay guddida iyo qaab-dhismeedka sharciga ee ku dabaqma. Kuma jirto natiijooyinka tirakoobka. Natiijooyinku waxay ku jiraan §3–§6 kor.`,intro:`Midkoodna khariidadaha guddida ma aha sharci. Abriil 16, 2026 Golaha Sharci dejintu waxay ansixisay Mooshinka 19, oo labadaba dib u dhigay oo dib-u-qaybinta u gudbiyay Guddi Doorasho Gaar ah oo shanta MLA ah — saddex UCP, laba NDP — uu guddoominayo Brandon Lunty (UCP, Leduc-Beaumont). Guddiga laftiisu ma sawirsamo khariidadda. Wuxuu kormeerayaa Guddi Madax-bannaan oo Talo-bixin ah oo gooni ah, oo lagu aasaasay Mooshinka Dawladda 37 (la ansixiyay Abriil 21, 2026), oo loo xilsaaray inay soo saaraan soo jeedin xudduudo oo 91 kursi ah. Mooshinka 37 wuxuu ka fekershaa shan xubnood oo guddi — garsoore fadhiya ama hawl-gab oo noqonaya guddoomiye, laba xubnood oo uu magacaabay Ra'iisul Wasaaraha, iyo laba uu magacaabay Hogaamiyaha Mucaaridka — laakiin garsoore-xukunka ku xigeenka ee Alberta ayaa diiday inuu magacaabo garsoore guddoomiyaha, guddiguна hadda wuxuu ku shaqaynayaa afarta la magacaabay oo guddiga xaqiijiyay: Sharafta leh Monte Solberg iyo Darwin Durnie (magacaabayaasha Ra'iisul Wasaaraha) iyo Dr. Gerard Kennedy iyo Brent Robinson (magacaabayaasha Mucaaridka). Guddiga waa inuu warbixintiisa u gudbiyaa Golaha Sharci dejinta Noofembar 2, 2026 ka hor. Ka duwan guddidii asalka ahayd, midkoodna guddiga iyo guddigа kuma waajib soo qabasho dhageysiga dadweynaha; guddiga wuxuu ku tiirsan yahay soo gudbinnada asalka guddidii asalka ahayd soo ururiyay. Marka khariidadda guddiga la sii daayo, hubintani waxay ku dabaqi doontaa isla habraaca si ay u qiimayso.`,h_anomalous:`Sababta Guddiga Uu Yahay Midkaan Caadi Ahayn`,anomalous_p1:`Dhaqanka dib-u-qaybinta Kanada, tan iyo 1960-meeyadii, wuxuu dejiyay hal qaab: guddi madax-bannaan, oo ka xorriyay amar dawladeed, wuxuu soo saara talooyinka xudduudaha; golaha sharci dejintu waxay ka dooddi karaan laakiin si fudud u joojin kartaa iyada oo aanay awoodin iyaga oo aanay gelin cod sharci ah oo rasmi ah. Habraaca sharciga ee Alberta hoos <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> wuxuu raacaa qaabkan — laakiin leh hal farqi qaab-dhismeed oo ka duwan gobolada badan: warbixinta guddida Alberta ma lahan saamayn sharci ah oo iskeed ah. Hoos Sharciga, Electoral Districts Act oo gooni ah waa in golaha sharci dejintu ansixiyaa si khariidad guddi kasta ay u hesho xoog sharci. Tani macnaheedu waa dawladda maalinta waxay xukumaan ma aha oo kaliya in khariidadda guddida la dooddo, balse in ay weligood noqoto sharci. Xukuumadaha Kanada ee kale waxay qaataan sida caadiga ah: talooyinka guddida waxay shaqo galayaan haddii golaha sharci dejintu si firfircoon u codeynin si ay u joojiyaan.`,anomalous_p2:`Waxa dawladdu sameysay Abriil 2026 ma lahan tusaale la duwan oo dib-u-qaybinta ka dib-Confederaatiyon ah: waxay oggolaatay in habraac guddida oo dhammaystiran, daabacaadda — labadaba warbixinta inta badan iyo inta yar ee la gudbiyay — oo marka dambe u gudbisay shaqada dib-u-qaybinta guddi shan xubnood oo MLA ah oo aqlabiyadda (saddex ka mid ah shan) ay hayso xisbiga xukunka, iyada oo aan warbixin guddiba codayn. Guddiga Lunty ma aha guddi. Ma lahan madax-bannaanida sharciga ah ee amarkaha sharci dejinta ee dawladda. Aqlabiyadda saddex-xubnood ee UCP waxay tarjumaysaa xukumaadda dawladda ee golaha sharci dejinta. Gobol kale oo Kanada ah ma u wareejin awood dib-u-qaybinta, wareeg-dhexe, guddi sharci dejin oo xukumaadda xukunto kadib markii guddi madax-bannaan uu shaqadiisii dhammaystirtay.`,h_framework:`Qaab-dhismeedka Dastuuriga ah`,framework_p1:`Qaybta 3 ee <em>Axdiga Xuquuqaha iyo Xorriyadaha</em> — "Muwaadin kasta oo Kanada wuxuu leeyahay xaqa u codaynta doorashada xubnaha Golaha Guud ama golaha sharci dejinta" — Maxkamadda Sare ee Kanada waxay u tarjumeen ma aha oo kaliya ficilka samaynta cod balse <em>matalaad waxtar leh</em>. Xukun-hogaanka ugu muhiimsani waa <em>Tixraaca Xudduudaha Doorashada Gobolka (Saskatchewan)</em> [1991] 2 SCR 158, oo McLachlin J. (sida ay markaas ahayd) uu ugu qoray aqlabiyadda in ujeedada §3 "ma aha sinaanta awoodda codku nafteeda, balse xaqa matalaad waxtar leh." Sinnaanta dadka waa ujeedada ugu muhiimsanka ah; ka leexashada waa la oggolyahay marka uu ku salaysan yahay danta bulshada, juquraafiga, taariikhda, ama ujeedooyinka matalaadda dadka tirada yar.`,framework_p2:`Qaab-dhismeedka Saskatchewan ma mamnuucayso si buuxda tixgelidaha xisbiyeed ee dib-u-qaybinta. Waxa uu dejinayaa waa in khariidadaha xudduudaha ay, guud ahaan, bixiyaan matalaad waxtar leh codbixiyayaasha — iyo in xadgudubka nidaamsan ee awooda koox la aqoon karo inay doorato matalaad la xaddidan ay qaabka §3 ee xeerka dacwadaha beegsado. Natiijooyinka tirakoobka iyo qaab-dhismeedka hubinta — meelaynta khariidadda laga yar yahay ee 99.99-aad centile ee 1,010,000 sawir oo dhexdhexaad ah, gudbiddeeda afar ka mid ah shanta xadadka qaab-dhismeed (shanaadka, xajinta, waa dhexdhexaad labada khariidadood), bulshooyinka la aqoonsaday ee saameysay — waa diiwaanka caddaynta ee dacwad-gudbiye §3 ah uu u baahan lahaa in uu uruuriyo. Dhinaca danta bulshada ee diiwaankaas, go'aanka Maxkamadda Federaalka ee <em>Raîche v. Canada</em> (2004 FC 679) waa xukun-hogaanka Kanada ugu muhiimsan: maxkamaddu halkaas waxay ku qasbatay Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada ee Federaalka inay dib u eegto xudduudaha oo indha-tirtay danta bulshada Acadian ee New Brunswick. Cabbirrada xajinta maamulka ee hubinta iyo natiijooyinkeeda bulsho gaarka ah — Airdrie oo loo kala qaybiyay afar degmooyin, anomalies-ka cidhif-magaaleed ee woqooyi-galbeed Calgary ee guddoomiyaha calaamadeeyay — waa isla nooca caddaynta ay Maxkamadda Federaalku ku dhaqmatay si sharci ahaan la aqoonsan karo. In diiwaankaas uu gaaro xadka dastuuriga ah waa su'aal sharci ah oo hubintani go'aaminayso ma aha; hubintu waxay sheegtaa cabbirka.`,framework_p3:`Xeeriyaynta guddiga sida habraac waa su'aal gooni ah. <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> ee Alberta si cad uma mamnuucayn golaha sharci dejinta inuu dhiso hay'ad dib-u-qaybinta oo parallel ah, maxaa yeelay Sharciga wuxuu taaban yahay in golaha sharci dejintu dhaqan-galineyso xudduudaha ugu dambe ee sharci caadi ah iyada oo aan loo eegin. In habraaca guddiga, haddii uu soo saaro khariidad leh muuqaalka qaab-dhismeedka iyo tirakoobka ee soo jeedinta laga yar yahay, uu baadi goob ka badbaadi karo dacwad §3 ee Axdiga waxay ku xidhantahay in matalaad waxtar leh lagu gaadhi karo hoos xudduudaha soo baxay — isla tijaabada ku daban karto khariidad guddi kasta oo soo saartay.`,h_quebec:`Isbarbardhigga Quebec`,quebec_p1:`Quebec waxay bixisaa isbarbardhigga ugu khuseeya xaalada Alberta. Commission de la représentation électorale (CRE) ee Quebec waa hay'ad xudduudo doorasho oo joogto ah oo madax-bannaan, ma aha guddi ad hoc oo la aasaasay kii dib-u-qaybinta. CRE waxay si joogto ah u shaqeysaa mana la baabbi'in karto ama la ka gudbi karo amar golaha wasiirada. Hoos <em>Loi électorale</em> ee Quebec, CRE lafteeda ayaa dejisa khariidadda doorashada ee kama-dambaysta ah: Golaha Qaran wuxuu ka dooda warbixinta guddida wuxuuna dhegeystaa ra'yi-celin, laakiin uma codeeyo inuu ansixiyo ama ka noqdo — toban maalmood gudahood ee doodaas guddidu waxay dejisaa xudduudaha, kuwaas oo lagu daabaco Gazette officielle. Saamaynta waxtar leh waa in xisbi xukunka, isaga oo awood laftiisa ku shaqaynaya, aanu bedeli karin khariidadda uu dooray meesha khariidadda guddida; xadaynta lafteeda, hay'adda madax-bannaan ayaa leh erayga ugu dambeeya.`,quebec_p2:`Qaabka Quebec wuxuu ka soo baxay qaybtaan sababo la xiriira waxa dhaca marka dib-u-qaybintu aanay ka xorriyeysan xukumaadda xisbiyeed. Isbarbardhigga habraaca hadda ee Alberta — halka guddi xukumaaddu xukunto uu beddelay shaqada guddida ka hor intaanay golaha sharci dejintu u codeyn warbixin guddiba — wuxuu iftiimiyaa farqiga qaab-dhismeed ee u dhexeeya nidaamyada dib-u-qaybinta ee u maleynaya cadaadiska xisbiyeed oo ay ka dhegaystaan, marka loo eego nidaamyada halka cadaadiskaas uu haysto jid cad oo ku wajahan natiijada.`,closing:`Hubintu waxay ku dabaqi doontaa isla tijaabaha khariidadda guddiga Lunty marka la sii daayo. Indho-indhaynta dastuuriga ah iyo isbarbardhigga kor ku xusan waa macnaha; habraacba ma is-beddelo.`},references:{heading:`10: Tixraacyada iyo Habraaca`,heading_aria:`Xiriiriye tixraacyada`,intro:`Habraaca aasaasiga ah wuxuu ku tiirsan yahay cilmiga siyaasadda, tirakoobka, iyo suugaanta sharciga ee la aasaasay. Tixraacyada oo dhammaystiran waxay raacaan qaabka American Political Science Association (APSA); kiisaska maxkamadeed waxay raacaan caadada sharciga Kanada. Liiska tixraacyada oo dhammaystiran wuxuu ku jiraa <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/reports/academic/report_academic.md" rel="noopener">warbixinta farsamada</a>. Isha ugu muhiimsani waxay halkan ku xusantahay.`,h_academic:`Suugaanta akadeemiga`,h_cases:`Kiisaska maxkamadeed`,h_statutes:`Sharciyada`},resources:{heading:`11: Lifaaqa Farsamada`,heading_aria:`Xiriiriye farsamo`,tag_plain:`Luuqad Fudud`,plain_label:`Warbixinta dadweynaha oo buuxda`,plain_desc:`Dhaadheer, oo leh khariidado, loogu talagalay akhristayaasha guud`,tag_summary:`Soo koobid`,summary_label:`Soo koobida natiijooyinka`,summary_desc:`Guud ahaan luuqad fudud, waxay sharaxaysaa fikrad kasta oo bilowga laga bilaabo`,tag_academic:`Akadeemi`,academic_label:`Warbixinta farsamada`,academic_desc:`Habab buuxa iyo tixraacyo loogu talagalay cilmibaadhayaasha`,tag_notebook:`Buug-Xisaab`,notebook_label:`Buug-xisaab is-dhexgal ah`,notebook_desc:`Sawirada naftigaa ku orod browser-kaaga, ma baahna rakib`,tag_code:`Kood`},about_me:{heading:`Ku saabsan aniga`,p1:`Arday baad ahay Mount Royal University. Cilmibaadhistani waxaan u sameeyay nafteeyda — lama bixin sida hawl dugsi ah oo jaamacaddu sidoo kale uma abaalmarin. Aragtideyda waa kuweygii gaarka ah oo uma matalin jaamacadda. Ma lahan xiriir Elections Alberta, guddida, ama xisbi siyaasadeed oo kasta.`,p2:`Xisbiyado kala duwan ayaan ku coday doorashooyinkii kala duwan, xoogagga siyaasadeed oo dhan. Waxaan kuu sheegayaa maxaa yeelay taariikhdeyda siyaasadeed way saameyn kartaa sida aan uga arko arrintan. Difaaca ugu weyn waa habka: labada khariidadood waan ku tijaabiyay isla sida, waxaan qoray saadaalinteyda ka hor inta aanay natiijooyinka soo bixin, waxaan dhiga oo dhan khadka internetka si qof kasta uu u xaqiijin karo shaqoeyda. Waxaan bixiyay cilmibaadhistani nafteeyda. Haddaad wax khaldan oo aan samaystay hesho, runtii waan rabaa inaan garanno.`,p3:`Diiwaannada balanqaadka-abuurka iyo diiwaan-gelinta hore: <a href="https://osf.io/6pt83" rel="noopener">OSF:6pt83</a>, AsPredicted:#289,469, AsPredicted:#289,451 — abuurayaasha random-ka ah waxaa wakhti loogu dhejiyay beacon dadweyne ka hor inta aan la sii dayn shaybaadhada rasmiga ah; tijaabada miirida-deriska (#289,451) waxaa la diiwaan-geliyay ka hor cabbirka, kuwa kalena waxaa la xareeyay agagaarka falanqaynta sahminta ah.`,p4:`Su'aalo ama saxitaanno: `},translation_about:{heading:`Ku saabsan turjumaaddaan`,p1:`Waxaad akhrineysaa turjumaad AI ah, oo ay soo saartay qaabka Fable 5 ee Anthropic oo sugeysa dib-u-eegis qof af-hoosiisa ah. Nooca Ingiriisiga ah waa qoraalka awood-saarka leh: haddii wax ka mid ah turjumaaddaan aanay caddayn ama ay muuqato inay khaldan yihiin, asal-ka Ingiriisiga ah ayaa xukunka haysta.`,p2:`Tayada turjumaaddu halkan waxay muhiim u tahay si aanay ugu noqon bogagga kale — hubintani waxay samaynaysaa sheegashooyiin tirakoob oo ku saabsan caddaaladda doorashada, tirakoob khaldan ama jumle si khaldan loo xaddidiyay waxay ku khaldamaan siyaabo akhristahu aanuu si fudud u garanayn karin. Turjumaadda mishiinka ee qoraalka madani-tirakoobka ah waa mid aad u adag, khaladaadna waa la sugi karaa.`,p3:`Haddaad tahay af-hoosiis oo aad arkayn khalad — ama rabtid inaad si saxan u dib-u-eegto qaybta — fadlan %s. Cabbirka: qoraalka Ingiriisiga ah wuxuu socdaa qiyaastii {count} eray. Dhammaantiis ama qayb kaliya ayaad qaadi kartaa, inta badan shaqaduna waa saxitaanka khaladaad yaryar ee mashiinku sameeyay halkii turjumaad cusub oo bilowga laga bilaabayo — xitaa dib-u-eegis qaybta keliya ah ayaa caawiso.`,p3_link:`nala soo xidhiidh`},retractions:{heading:`9: Ka Noqoshooyinka iyo Saxitaannada`,heading_aria:`Xiriiriye ka-noqoshooyinka`,conditions_label:`SHURUUDAHA KA NOQOSHO`,conditions_intro:`Natiijo kasta waxaa horay loo go'aamiyay shuruud been-abuur ah oo gaar ah. Haddii shuruud kasta oo hoose soo baxdo, natiijada ay magacaabto waxaa si calan ah laga noqda 30 maalmood gudahoodba. Gunaanadka jiho-guud ee oo dhan — in khariidadda laga yar yahay ay ku taallo meel ka baxsan kala-duwanaanta dhexdhexaadka tijaabooyin badan oo madax-bannaan — waxaa laga noqda marka loo eego shuruudda iskudhafan ee hababka horay loo balanqaaday: ugu yaraan saddex ka mid ah lixda cabbir qaab-dhismeed oo madax-bannaan oo jihadooda rogaya.`,c1_title:`Shuruudda 1 — Khariidad ka-gaabis ah ayaa jirta`,c1_what:`<em>Waxa laga noqday:</em> Natiijada qaab-dhismeedka ah ee ah in kala-qaybinta afar-jiho ah ee Airdrie iyo saddexda xuduud ee guddoomiyaha calaamadeeyay aanay ku sharxi karin sababta danta bulshada ee inta yar u sheegtay.`,c1_cond:`Shuruudda: qof wuxuu soo saaraa khariidad sharci ah oo Alberta oo buuxineysa sababaha inta yar ay si gaar ah u sheegtay — Airdrie, Cochrane, Nolan Hill, Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park — oo ku xajinaaya khadadka maamulka heerarka la mid ah ee inta badan. Caqabadda furan ee <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/issues/14" rel="noopener">Arrimaha #14</a>.`,c2_title:`Shuruudda 2 — Dhaafista horay loo diiwaan-geliyay ee Neighbour-Drain waxaa lagu soo celiyay`,c2_what:`<em>Waxa laga noqday:</em> Gelitaanka Xaashida §3 oo diiwaangaliya khariidadda laga yar yahay sida DHAAFIS horay loo diiwaan-geliyay ee tijaabada deriska-miirid.`,c2_cond:`Shuruudda: qiimaha miiridda joogtada ah ee v2 wuxuu ku dhacaa dabada sare oo xooggani (p &lt; 0.05) ee bannaanka kala-duwanaansho ee tanaasulka graph-ka joogtada ah oo go'an, taas oo macnaheedu yahay in dhaafistuhu ahayd artefact cabbiris oo habka qiimeynta v1 binary ee dab ah halkii uu ka noqon lahaa natiijo mala-awaal dhab ah oo eber ah.`,c3_title:`Shuruudda 3 — Dukumeenti guddi oo ka hor 2026 ayaa muuqday`,c3_what:`<em>Waxa laga noqday:</em> Istidlaalkii ah in doorashooyinka xudduudaha inta yar ay ahaayeen go'aamada sawirka halkii ay ka noqon lahaayeen jawaabaha soo gudbinnada bulshada ee la diiwaangeliyay.`,c3_cond:`Shuruudda: dukumeenti guddi oo gudaha ah oo la taariikh-xidhay ka hor doorashooyinka xudduudaha ugu dambe ee inta yar waxay muujinaysaa in doorashooyinkaas si gaar ah ugu dhacay soo gudbinnada bulshada oo hubintu aanay arkin — ma aha lixda sabab-hoosaad oo daabacay ee hubintu tijaabisay.`,c4_title:`Shuruudda 4 — Natiijada doorashada 2027 waxay liddi u tahay soo-jeedinta`,c4_what:`<em>Waxa laga noqday:</em> Natiijada Waddada 1 — in boqolleyga kursiyada@50/50 ee khariidadda laga yar yahay uu ku taallo 99.99-aad centile ee 1,010,000 sawir oo dhexdhexaad ah.`,c4_cond:`Shuruudda: haddii doorashada gobolka 2027 ku dhacdo khariidad guddida midkood oo kala-qaybinta kursiga xisbiyeed ee dhabta ah uu u liddi yahay saadaalinta jiho-ahaan ee codadka 2023, natiijooyinka centile Waddada 1 waxaa dib loogu eegaa natiijooyin dhab ah.`,c5_title:`Shuruudda 5 — Maxkamad Alberta ah ayaa kala saareysa xukunta SCC ee Quebec`,c5_what:`<em>Waxa laga noqday:</em> Doodda habraaca §7 ee ah in Mooshinka Abriil 16 ee beddelaya guddida guddiga Lunty uu ku jiro isla fasalka dastuuriga ah ee barafaynta dib-u-qaybinta Quebec ee 2024.`,c5_cond:`Asalka: Abriil 22, 2026 — lix maalmood kadib Mooshinka Abriil 16 ee Alberta — Maxkamadda Sare ee Kanada waxay ansixisay, 7–2 iyo madaxa baniga, xukunta Maxkamadda Dib-u-eeegista ee Quebec in barafaynta sharci dejineed ee dawladda Legault ee guddida dib-u-qaybinta ay xadgudbtay dammaanada matalaadda dimuqraadiga ee §3 ee Axdiga. Shuruudda: maxkamad dib-u-eegeysa Mooshinka Alberta waxay ka helaysaa inuu si dastuuriyad kala duwan yahay — tusaale ahaan, maxaa yeelay u-wareejinta shaqada guddi MLA ah waxay si qaab-dhismeed ah uga duwan tahay barafaynta sharci dejineed, ama maxaa yeelay falanqaynta matalaadda waxtarka ee §3 ee Alberta waxay si kala duwan u soo baxaysaa marka loo eego Quebec.`,corr_label:`SAXITAANNADA LA DIIWAANGELIYAY (dib-u-xisaabinta canonical-ka, 2026-05-11)`,corr_intro:`Natiijadii hore ee soo socota ma badbaadin dib-u-falanqaynta marka loo eego shaybaadhka rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta (la helay 2026-05-06). Waxaa halkan lagu hayaa siyaasadda horay loo go'aamiyay ee hubinta ee ah in abid la tirtirsan natiijooyin guuldareystay.`,corr_municipal:`<strong>Xajinta maamulka (laga noqday).</strong> Falanqaynta hore iyada oo la isticmaalayay xudduudaha khariidadda ee ku meel-gaarka ah waxay muujisay khariidadda laga yar yahay waxay ku xajinaayeen khadadka maamulka oo keliya 15% wakhtiga — 4.9&times; hooseysa caadiga Kanada ee 70–85%. Tiradhani waxay ahayd artefact dib-u-dhismeedyada xudduudaha ku-meel-gaarka ah (DPG-da). Shaybaadhka rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta ee canonical-ka ah, labada khariidadood waxay ku xajinaayaan gudaha caadiga Kanada: inta badan 80%, inta yar 72%. <em>Kala-duwanaanshaha</em> xajinta maamulka ee u dhexeeya labada khariidadood ma aha calaamad badbaadisa dib-u-xisaabinta canonical-ka ah. Saddexda anomaly-xudduud ee guddoomiyaha guddidu lafteedu calaamadeeyay (Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park, Nolan Hill–Cochrane, Olds–North Airdrie) waxay sii jiraan mana saameeyaan saxitaankaan.`},suggestions:{heading:`8: Soo Jeedinno`,heading_aria:`Xiriiriye §8`,intro:`Hubintani waxay la kulmay laba dhibaato xog oo aan xiriir lahayn shaqada guddida iyo wax kasta oo la xidhiidha sida nidaamka doorashada ee Alberta loo naqshaday. Labadaba waa la saxsan karaa.`,advance_p1:`<strong>Qiyaastii badh dhammaan codadka Alberta hadda waxay yimaadaan ka hor maalinta doorashada</strong> — doosaska hore, doosaska guuraya, ballaamaadka gaarka ah. Elections Alberta waxay soo sheegtaa natiijadaas sida wadarta mid kasta oo qaybaha doorashada, ma aha Aaga Codbixin gaarka ah. Tani macnaheedu waa qiyaastii 395,000 codo NDP iyo UCP oo la ururiyay 2023 aanay awoodi karin in lagu dhejin gobol khariidadda. Waa la tirsadaa; ma la garan karo meesha. Codbixiye hore kasta waxaa lagu xaqiijiyaa list-ka codbixiyayaasha ka hor inta aanay helin ballaamaadkooda, list-kana wuxuu ku xidaa codbixiye kasta Aagga Codbixintiisa gaarka ah. Daabacaadda wadarta heerka VA ee codadka doosaska hore ma u baahna isbeddel habraac codbixin — oo keliya waxa EA soo sheegto.`,advance_p2:`Tani waxay saameynaysaa la-taliyayaasha sidoo kale, ma aha oo keliya falanqayaashan dibadda. Marka guddi go'aaminayso in la ilaaliso Airdrie oo dhammaystiran ama la kala goyo, in corridor oo u dhaxeeya laba bulsho uu macno sameeyo, in xudduud la soo jeediyay ay kala gooyso bulsho dabiici ah — kuwaas waa xukumooyin ku tiirsan garanshaha halka codbixiyayaashu joogaan. La-taliyayaashu waxay ku shaqeeyaan isla xogta daabacaadda sida qof kasta oo kale. Badh calaamadda juquraafiga ee ku saabsan bulshooyinka ay xudduudaha ku sawirayaan waxaa ka maqan iyaga sidoo kale.`,lesser_slave_p1:`Waxaa jira ugu yaraan hal bulsho oo waqooyiga Alberta ah oo xogtan ku jirta dhibaato buuxda. Qaybta waqooyiga ee qaybta Lesser Slave Lake <button class="ed-trigger" data-ed-name="Lesser Slave Lake">tus ↗</button>, waxaa jira Aag Codbixin oo daboola 4,832 km&#178; — ka weyn Jasiiradda Prince Edward — halka cod kasta oo 2023 lagu tuuray loo wareejiyay kooxda polling-ka guuraysa ee Elections Alberta. Doorashooyinka 844 degganeyaasha waa la tirsadaa wadarta qaybaha laakiin ma la dhejin karo goob khariidadda. Bulshadaadu si buuxda waxay u maqantahay natiijooyin doorashada daabacaadda.`,lesser_slave_p2:`Marka guddidu marka hore tixgalisay in la baabbi'iyo qaybta Lesser Slave Lake oo lala biiriyo riding-ka weyn, waxay ku shaqaynaysay iyada oo aan lahayn xog cod juquraafi ah bulshooyinkaasiyo. Guddidu ugu dambeyntii waxay ilaaliyay qaybta — kadib 80+ soo gudbin dadweyne, oo badan ka timid bulshooyinka Ahlulbaytiga ee qaybta waqooyiga ee riding-ka — iyaga oo ku tiirsanaaya sharciga gobolka oo u oggolaada riding-yada ay joogaan Beelaha Hore iyo degmooyinka M&#233;tis inay leeyihiin dadnimo ka yar celceliska gobolka. Waxay soo gaareen. Laakiin xogtay la shaqaynayeen ma aysan muujin cidda cod ku tuureysa bulshooyinka ay go'aansan karaan in la ilaaliyo.`,ebca_label:`QAYBTA 15(2) EBCA`,ebca_body:`Qaybta 15(2) ee <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> ee Alberta waa xukun ikhtiyaari ah oo u oggolaada guddiyada inay ilaaliyaan riding-yada yaryar — kuwa ka yar 25% hooseysa celceliska dadnimada gobolka — marka riding-ku buuxiyo ugu yaraan saddex ka mid ah shanta shuruudood ee gaar ah: (a) aag juquraafi oo ka badan 20,000 km², (b) masaafo ka badan 150 km Dhismaha Golaha Sharci dejinta ee wadada tooska ah ee ugu dhow, (c) manaaqiyad magaalo kasta oo ka badan 8,000 deggan, (d) joogitaanka kayd Hindiya ama dejin Métis, iyo (e) in riding-ku uu la guuriyo xuduud gobolka Alberta. Xukunku ma aha toos; guddidu waa in ay u xukumto in shuruudaha la buuxinayo. Lesser Slave Lake si madax-bannaan wuxuu buuxinayaa afarta ka mid ah shanta.`,rationale_p1:`Sababta ku meel-gaarka ah ee baabbi'inta riding-ka waxay ahayd dadnimada: qiyaastii 27,000 deggan, Lesser Slave Lake wuxuu ku taallaa qiyaastii 45% hooseysa celceliska gobolka, oo u dhowaaday dabaqada sharciga. Kani waxay u muuqataa codsi toos ah oo xeerarka. Ma aha. Sharciga Alberta wuxuu siiyaa guddiyada ikhtiyaar cad si ay u ilaaliyaan riding-yada yaryar marka ugu yaraan saddex ka mid ah shanta shuruudood ee gaar ah ay dabaqmaan, Lesser Slave Lake-na wuxuu buuxinayaa afar si madax-bannaan. Aaggiisa waa 69,566 km² (shuruudda a, xadka 20,000 km²). Xuduudiisa ugu dhow waa ka badan 150 km Golaha Sharci dejinta wadada toosan (shuruudda b). Magaalo riding-ka ku jirta ma lahan dadnimo ka badan 8,000 (shuruudda c). Riding-kuna wuxuu ku jiraa afar iyo toban kayd Hindiya iyo degmooyin M&#233;tis oo bulshooyinkoodu wadaagaan juquraafi waqooyiga ah oo caadi ah, ku tiirsanaanta polling-ka guuraysa si ay u codeyaan, iyo danaha wadajirka ah ee la leenahay wakiil si ugu horreyso waqooyiga Alberta (shuruudda d).`,rationale_p2:`Hoos wadaagista Mackenzie ee la soo jeediyay, codka wadajirku si joogto ah wuxuu ku nuugi lahaa riding ka halka xisbiga kale uu ku guulaysto in ka badan laba meel saddex ah, ma aha maxaa yeelay bulshooyinkaas wax beddeli jiray balse maxaa yeelay khadadka ku hareereysan wax beddeli jireen. Mid kasta oo afarta shuruudood kaas ka mid ah waa xaqiiq shay ah oo ku saabsan juquraafiga riding-ka, ma aha xukum ah. Wadajirku waxay sharaxayaan bulsho oo xukunkii looga qoray si loo ilaaliyo: fog, weyn, yar dadnimadeed, oo ku jira bulshooyinka danaha matalaadda aanay ku qoran karin tirooyinka dadnimada caadiiga ah. Waxaad u baahan tahay saddex si aad u qalmo; Lesser Slave Lake wuxuu leeyahay afar. Dhagaynta yaraanshaha dadnimada sidii ay ku qasbaysay baabbi'inta waxay khalad ku akhrin kartaa xeerka. Ka noqoshada guddidu waxay ahayd codsi saxda ah ee sharciga, ma aha midho siyaasadeed.`,banff_p:`Kani waa dhanka kale ee sheekooyinka: inta bulshooyinka Ahlulbaytiga ee Lesser Slave Lake ay u daganaayeen inay la jiraan, la-taliyayaasha ka soo horjeeda waxay soo jeediyeen ilaalinta riding kale iyaga oo sawiraya xudduudeeda dhexda Banff National Park, halkaas oo qof ku noolaan waayay. Guddoomiyaha guddidu lafteedu wuxuu ugu yeeray "iskuday been ah" si loo sheegto ilaalinta sharciga. Jumladu waxay ku jirtaa warbixinta rasmiga ah ee ugu dambeysay ee guddida. Ilaalinta loo naqshaday bulshooyinka fog oo leh dadnimo Ahlulbayti ah waxaa lagu adeegsaday, khariidadda inta yar, si loo difaaco xuduud dhex marta cidla beeyahaaneed. Bulshooyinka loogu naqshaday waxay u daganaayeen inay ku noolaan ladaa iyaga oo loo maraya soo gudbinnada dadweynaha. Guddiga Lunty wuxuu la kulmi doonaa isla go'aanka §&#x2009;15(2) Noofembar — iyada oo aanay jirin waajibaadka sharciga ah ee soo qabasho dhageysiga dadweynaha, iyo dammaanad la'aanta in 80 soo gudbin ee beddelay xaaladdii horeeysay ee guddida ay sidoo kale miisaan u yeellan doonaan mar labaad.`,census_p1:`<strong>Alberta waa inay sugaysaa tirakoobka 2026 ka hor inta aanay sawirin khariidadda soo socota.</strong> Kanada waxay tirisaa dadkeeda toban sano kasta. Tirisnaynta tirakoobka 2026 waxay dhacaysaa xagaaga 2026; Statistics Canada waxay sii daayaan xogta hoose-gobolka oo la isticmaali karo qiyaastii laba sano kadib, 2027 ama 2028. Guddidii sawirtay khariidadaha falanqayntan lagu baari jiray waxay isticmaashay tirakoobka 2021 — oo horay u ahaa afar sano jirku marka khariidadaha la sawiri jiray, oo suurtagal ah inay noqoto afar iyo toban sano jirku marka xudduudahaasiyo ka faa'iidaystaan. Magaalooyinka si dhakhso u koraya sida Airdrie iyo Chestermere waxay isbeddeli doonaan 40% ama ka badan xagaagaas. Bulshooyinka miyiga waxay yaraadaan. Khariidadda waxay khaldan doonaan maalinta la isticmaalo. Isbeddel toos ah oo ku jira <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> wuxuu u baahan lahaa in guddi kasta oo cusub la magacaabo oo keliya kadib markii Statistics Canada ay sii daayaan xogta ugu cusub ee aagagga faafinta ee tirakoobka hore. Natiijada: khariidado tarjumaaya halka Albertans dhab ahaan ku nool yihiin, ma aha halka ay ku noolaa toban sano ka hor.`,census_p2:`Guddiga Lunty wuxuu ku shaqaynayaa hoos xeerka jira, oo aan dejin waajibaad waktu-tirakoob, mana kici karin si iskeed ah waqtigii kama-dambaysta ah ee Noofembar 2026. Talo-socodkani wuxuu ku dabaqmaa wax-ka-beddelka mustaqbalka ee <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em>, ma aha habraaca hadda. Xidhaadhku waa mid dhab ah: guddi u baahan inuu soo saaro khariidad Noofembar ka hor wuxuu ku shaqaynayaa xog horay u ahayd shan sano jir markaas — u sheegidda xaddidka waa kaa anfacaya in la maleeyaan inaan jirin.`,closing:`Midkoodna kuwaas ma aha natiijada ku saabsan khariidadaha guddida hadda. Waa indho-indhaynno ku saabsan nidaam ka dhigaya falanqaynta doorashada ee saxda ah mid ka adag inta loo baahdo. Waxaa halkan lagu bixiyay sida talo-socodyo wax-ku-ool, ma aha gunaanadyo. Labadaba si run ah waa la saxsan karaa, saxtaadkooduna wuxuu ka dhigi doonaa guddi kasta oo mustaqbalka iyo hubinta kasta oo mustaqbalka mid ka shaqeysa saldhig ka fiican.`}},editorial_canada:{heading:`Macnaha: Kanada Way Kala Duwan Tahay — Iyo Isku Mid`,p1:`Kanada waxay u taagan tahay isla qoyska ah ee Mareykanka, Boqortooyada Midowday, iyo Australiya. Waxaan dooran karaa xubnaha hal-xubin ah oo ka timid degmooyin juquraafi ah hoos nidaamka kooxda ugu horreysa. Waxaan dib-u-sawinaa khadadka si joogto ah — federaalka kadib tirakoob kasta oo toban-sano ah, gobolyadana jadwalyo ku wareegsan. Waxaan ka dhaxalnay mishiinka aasaasiga ah ee isla xididdada Westminster. Halkan ma jiraan yaabab.`,p2:`Waxa Kanada ka gooniya waa tijaabada ay khadadku ka gudbi karaan.`,p3:`Sharciga dastuuriga ah ee Mareykanku, xeerka xidhan waa <em>qof mid, cod mid</em> — degmooyinku waa in ay leeyihiin dadnimo si saxna ugu siman sida macquulka ah, ka leexashada waaweyn oo xaddaadeysa xaddaad adag. Sharciga dastuuriga ah ee Kanada, xeerka xidhan waa mid ka duwan. Qaybta 3 ee <em>Axdiga Xuquuqaha iyo Xorriyadaha Kanada</em> waxay dammaanad qaaddaa muwaadin kasta xaqa codaynta. <em>Tixraaca Xudduudaha Doorashada Gobolka (Sask.)</em> — Tixraacii Saskatchewan 1991-kii, kiiskii hogaanka — Maxkamadda Sare ee Kanada waxay u tarjumeen xaqa sida xaq u helitaan <em>matalaad waxtar leh</em>, ma aha xaq u helitaan sinaanta tirakoobka ee dadnimada degmooyinka.`,p4:`Farqigaas wuxuu muhiim yahay. Matalaadda waxtarku waxay u oggolaataa dadnimada degmooyinka inay kala duwanaadaan, mararka qaarkoodna si weyn, marka ay jiraan sababood: juquraafi miyiga ah oo bal ah oo MLA kaligiis aanuu si macquul ah ugu adeegi karin heerka celceliska dadnimada, bulshooyinka danta iska leh ee la joojin lahaa, matalaadda dadka tirada yar ee sinaanta tirakoobka ay la tiriweysaa. Tixraacii Saskatchewan wuxuu ka dhigay sidaas ikhtiyaarka dastuuriga. Kala-duwanaanshaha dadnimada 25% ee EBCA — xeerka ilaaliya kursiyada miyiga ee Alberta — si toos ah ayuu uga soo baxay.`,p5:`Caqabadu waxay jirtaa in ikhtiyaarku labada dhinac ka gooyo. Haddii guddi si sax ah ka leexan karo sinaanta dadnimada sababood saxsan, sidoo kale wuxuu ka leexan karaa sinaanta dadnimada sababood khaldan. Sharciga Kanada ma lahan dabaqada tirakoobka ee Mareykanku ku fiirsado. Waxay leedahay tijaabada matalaadda waxtarka, oo ay kaga xukumaan garsoorayaasha, kadib xaqiiqda, dacwadaha. Inta badan maxkuumadaha waxay ka difaacan yihiin sababaha khaldan iyadoo leh ilaalinta qaab-dhismeed: heer federaal, guddiyada dib-u-qaybintu waxaa ka xorriyay xeerka, xudduudahooduna waxay dhaqan-galaan iyada oo loo marayo amar matalaad (representation order), iyada oo aan jirin cod baarlamaaneed oo lagu ansixiyo. Quebec ayaa ugu fog tagta — guddigeeda joogtada ah ee madax-bannaan ayaa lafteeda dejiya khariidadda kama-dambaysta ah, iyada oo aan jirin cod Golaha Qaran oo lagu ansixiyo ama lagaga noqdo. Xitaa British Columbia, oo Golaheeda Sharci dejintu uu u codeeyo ansixinta soo jeedinnada guddida oo uu sharci ku dejiyo, waxay u aragtaa ansixinta shaqada guddida madax-bannaan inay tahay caadada halkii ay ka beddeli lahayd khariidad u gaar ah.`,p6:`Alberta waa ka-goosatada. Hoos <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em>, warbixinta guddida waa talo kaliya — golaha sharci dejintu waa in uu u codinayaa si uu u ansixiyo. Ansixintu si caadi ahaan waxay noqotaa kaliya hababka. Wareegga 2026, guddidu waxay u kala qaybsantay 3–2 waxayna soo saartay laba soo jeedin oo tartanaysa; golaha sharci dejintu waxay abuurtay guddi MLA ah oo gooni ah, oo uu guddoominayo MLA UCP ah, si ay u doorato u dhexeeya. Wax ka mid ah sharciga dastuuriga Kanada ma uu baahan guddi inuu jiro. Wax ma ka baahan doorashadeeda inay raacdo habraaca guddida. Kani waa farqiga qaab-dhismeed ee hubintani baadhineyso.`,p7:`Sidaa darteed marka garsoorayaasha Kanada ay yiraahdaan "gerrymander" ma aha eraybixintooda sharciga, ma dhehayaan fikradda aasaasiga ah ee halkan ma dabaqan. Waxay dhehayaan tijaabadu way kala duwan tahay — matalaad waxtar leh, ma aha sinaanta tirakoobka. In soo jeedinta laga yar yahay ay buuxiso tijaabadaas waa saxda ah su'aasha hubintani ku cabbiray juquraafiga, iyo saxda ah su'aasha oo keliya garsoore si gunaanad ah uga jawaabi karo. Macnaha <em>Tixraacii Saskatchewan</em> oo dhammaystiran, isbarbardhigga gobolada kale, su'aasha xaqa wax dacwin kara, iyo jidadka isbeddel ee la heli karo waxaa lagu xusay <a href="#references">qaybta tixraacyada hoose</a>.`},chrome:{back_to_top:`Ku noqo sare`,license_title:`Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0`,license_alt:`CC BY-NC-SA 4.0`,license_aria:`Creative Commons BY-NC-SA 4.0`,back_to_stakes:`↑ Ku noqo Khataraha`,lightbox:{fig_aria:`Sawirka weynaaday oo la balaariyay`,fig_close_aria:`Xidh sawirka weynaaday (Esc)`,map_aria:`Daawade kharito-soo-dhoweyste`,map_close_aria:`Xidh daawadaha khariidadda`,close_title:`Xidh (Esc)`},participation:{heading:`Naga caawi in aan horumarinno MapExplorer`,body:`Inta aad baadhineyso, waxaan raadineynaa khariidadaha iyo degmooyinka aad booqato oo si joogto ah u dirno xogta saldhiggeenna cilmibaadha. Wadaagida muuqaal sidoo kale waxay keydinaysaa halka aad ku dhammaatay. Ujeedada: fahmida waxa waxtar u yahay oo aaladda ka wanaajinta.`,no_collect:`Marna ma ururino magacaaga, cinwaanka IP-gaaga, ama goobta saxda ah. Wax kasta waxaa lagu magacawalay browser-kaaga ka hor inta aanay tegi. Ma ku garan karno adiga xogta xitaa haddii la amro.`,dnt:`Browser-kaagu wuxuu hayaa Do Not Track la-aasaasayey. Maya waa horay loogu doortay adiga magacaaga. Weli waxaad dooran kartaa Haa.`,no_thanks:`Maya, mahadsanid`,yes_help:`Haa, waan caawin doonaa`,privacy_policy:`Siyaasadda garaadnimada`},share:{button:`Wadaag`,button_title:`Wadaag ama soo geli dejinta khariidadda`,dialog_aria:`Wadaag dejinta khariidadda`,close_aria:`Xidh baraha wadaagga`,share_label:`Wadaag dejintan`,share_hint:`Koodhkaan ku qor browser kasta oo socodsiinaya hubinta si aad u geliso dejintan. Koodhku marna laguma dhejin URL.`,load_label:`Geli dejin`,load_btn:`Geli`,load_placeholder:`alpine-eagle-banff`,copy:`Nuqul`,copied:`La nuqlay!`,copy_failed:`Guuldarro`,unrecognised:`Koodh aan la garanayn — hubso higaanka.`},map:{minority:`Inta yar`,majority:`Inta badan`,current:`Hadda`,wasted:`La khasaariyay`,wasted_title:`Tabarucida farqiga waxtarka ee degmo kasta`,partisan:`Xisbiyeed`,partisan_title:`Midab kasta oo degmo ah sida natiijada xisbiyeed (UCP buluug / NDP oranje)`,borders:`Xudduudaha`,flagged:`La calaamadeeyay`,flagged_title:`Dhammaan 7 dejimada ee uu calaamadeeyay guddoomiyaha guddida Garsoore Miller — si toos ah ugu wareegta khariidadda laga yar yahay`,help_aria:`Caawimada khariidadda`,help_title:`Sida loo isticmaalo khariidadda`,pin_aria:`Xidh Khariidadda`,pin_title:`Xidh Khariidadda — ka hortag auto-pan marka la gujin degmada`,search_aria:`Hel degmo doorasho`,search_placeholder:`Raadi degmo…`,zoom_aria:`Zooming khariidadda`,clear_aria:`Nadiifi xulashada degmada`,clear_title:`Nadiifi xulashada`,va_hint:`Guji gudaha degmadaan si aad u aragto natiijooyinka xarunta codbixinta`,va_close_aria:`Xidh faahfaahinta xarunta codbixinta`,va_close_title:`Xidh`,object_title:`Khariidadda degmada doorashada Alberta — qalabka ugu sarreeya`,ea_credit:`Xogta khariidadda:`,cc_title:`Waxa qoraalka ah: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0`,cc_alt:`Creative Commons BY-NC-SA 4.0`,votes_suffix:`codo`,total_votes_suffix:`wadarta codadka`,pop_prefix:`Dad.`,voting_areas_suffix:`aagagga codbixinta`,other_maps:`Khariidadaha kale`,unique_boundary:`Xuduud u gaar ah khariidaddaan`,in_person_votes:`codad shakhsi ahaan (baaqida Vote Anywhere kama jiraan)`,load_error_generic:`Ma soo geli karin khariidadda xudduudaha. Isku day in aad dib u soo rareyso bogga.`,load_error_map:`Ma soo geli karin khariidadda {key} — hubso xiriirkaaga.`,context_minority:`Soo jeedinta laga yar yahay 2026 · natiijooyinka doorashada 2023`,context_majority:`Soo jeedinta inta badan 2026 · natiijooyinka doorashada 2023`,context_2019:`Xudduudaha la dhaqan-geliyay 2019 · natiijooyinka doorashada 2023`,tag_min:`Yar`,tag_maj:`Badan`,tag_2019:`2019`,dev_notice:`Map Explorer wuxuu ku jiraa horumarinno tooska ah oo joogta ah oo mararka qaarkood jabi kara. Haddii wax khaldan muuqato, dhawr maalmood ka dib soo noqo — dhibaatooyinku sida caadiga ah waxay xalloobi doonaan. Soo jeedinnadu waa la soo dhawaynayaa: %s.`,dev_notice_email_label:`ii soo emayl`,dev_notice_dismiss:`Iska dhaaf ogeysiiska horumarinta`,skel_1:`Soo gelin Map Explorer…`,skel_2:`sawirida Alberta…`,skel_3:`xisaabaynta tirooyinka…`,skel_4:`tirinaynta codad kasta…`,skel_5:`sawirida xudduudaha…`,skel_6:`ku dhow dhammaadka…`},map_intro:{heading:`Sida loo isticmaalo khariidadda`,click_district:`Guji degmo kasta`,click_district_desc:`arag natiijooyinka doorashada 2023 oo uga bood`,click_within:`Guji gudaha degmada la doortay`,click_within_desc:`arag natiijooyinka xarunta codbixinta ee gaar ah (midab = kala-qaybinta codka)`,dblclick:`Laba jeer guji degmo`,dblclick_desc:`zoom si aad shaashadda u buuxiso; laba jeer guji meel banaan si aad dib u xoogtid`,layers_primary:`Inta yar / Inta badan / Hadda`,layers_primary_desc:`bedel khariidadda xudduudaha firfircoon`,layers_data:`Xisbiyeed / La khasaariyay / Xudduudaha`,layers_data_desc:`bedel lakabada xogta`,search:`Raadi degmo`,search_desc:`u bood magac; furaha fallaadha waxay saarayaan, + / − zoom`,escape:`Bax`,escape_desc:`xidh daawadahaan`,s4_tip:`§4, guji <em>Muuji degmooyinka la calaamadeeyay khariidadda</em> si aad u iftiimiso kala-qaybinta Airdrie iyo aagga woqooyi-bari/dhexe Calgary.`,got_it:`Si fiican ayaan u fahmay`},footer:{title:`Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta — May 2026`,copyright:`© Will Conner 2026 —`,text_label:`Qoraal:`,code_label:`Kood:`,translation_label:`Turjumaadaha:`,translation_credit:`Anthropic Fable 5 (AI) — sugeysa dib-u-eegis qof af-hoosiis ah`,data_credit:`Xogta khariidadda: waddooyinka labaad ee laga keenay National Road Network, © Statistics Canada (Open Government Licence – Canada); waddooyinka kale & biyaha © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL); xudduudaha & natiijooyinka © Elections Alberta.`}},explorer:{controls:{panel_title:`Xakamayaha khariidadda`,close_aria:`Xidh khariidadda`,map_version_hdr:`Nooca khariidadda`,map_version_hint:`· guji si aad u beddesho`,map_toggle_title:`Beddel khariidaddan dami/shidid`,map_minority:`Inta yar`,map_majority:`Inta badan`,map_2019:`Rasmi`,map_minority_short:`Yar`,map_majority_short:`Badan`,map_2019_short:`Rasmi`,search_placeholder:`Raadi degmo…`,search_aria:`Raadi degmooyinka`,search_clear_aria:`Nadiifi raadinta`,search_in:`gudaha {ed}`,zoom_aria:`Zooming`,res_prefix:`1 pixel ≈`,zoom_official:`(Rasmi)`,zoom_computed:`(La xisaabiyay)`,overlays_hdr:`Dul-saarrada Danta Bulshada`,layer_highways:`Waddooyinka waaweyn`,layer_water:`Webiyada & harooyinka`,layer_annotations:`EBC '26 Annotations`,mobile_map_version_aria:`Nooca khariidadda`,mobile_search_aria:`Raadi degmooyinka`,mobile_layers_aria:`Lakabyada khariidadda`,mobile_info_aria:`Ku saabsan khadadka xudduudaha`,mobile_share_aria:`La wadaag aragtidan`,mobile_close_aria:`Xidh khariidadda`,lang_aria:`Beddel luuqadda`,lang_hdr:`Luuqad`,lines_note_title:`Akhrinta khadadka`,lines_note_lead:`Qaab kasta oo cajiib ah ama khad kala-qaybin ah waa`,lines_note_emphasis:`doorasho ula kac ah oo guddidu`,lines_note_tail:`— ma aha khalad xog. Khadadku waxay raacaan cidhifyada aagagga codbixinta; halka laba khariidadood isku raacaan waxay ku saaran yihiin isla khadka, halka ay kala tagaanna soo jeedimuhu dhab ahaan way kala duwan yihiin.`},share:{button:`La wadaag aragtidan`,heading:`La wadaag aragtidan`,copy:`Koobi link-ga`,copied:`La koobiyay`,help:`Link-gani wuxuu qabsadaa khariidaddaada hadda, dul-saarrada, iyo aragtida.`,open_heading:`Fur link la wadaagay`,open_placeholder:`Ku dhaji link la wadaagay…`,open_btn:`Fur`,err_empty:`Ku dhaji link la wadaagay`,err_invalid:`Ma aha link la wadaagay oo sax ah`},tip:{total_votes:`wadarta codadka`,inperson_votes:`codad qof-ahaaneed`,ed_total:`Wadarta degmada: {n} codad`,ed_total_eday:`Wadarta degmada: {n} (maalinta doorashada)`,poll:`Goob #{id} · codad qof-ahaaneed`,ucp_pct:`UCP {u}%`,ndp_pct:`NDP {n}%`,unassigned:`(aan loo qoondayn)`,where_in:`gudaha {community}`,where_near:`agagaarka {community}`,note_sparse:`Aag dad yar ku nool — codad yar oo halkan laga dhiibtay awgood, midabku wuxuu u dhowaadaa saldhigga dhexdhexaadka ah ee khariidadda.`,note_no_votes:`Cod lama diiwaan-gelin halkan, sidaa darteed aaggani wuxuu muujiyaa midabka dhexdhexaadka ah ee khariidadda.`,no_one_title:`Halkan qofna kuma codeeyo`,no_one_body:`Qaybin codbixin ma daboosho meeshan — qofna lama diiwaan-gelin inuu halkan ku nool yahay ama ku codeeyo, sidaa darteed waxay sii ahaanaysaa midabka dhexdhexaadka ah ee khariidadda.`,flag_link:`Guji si aad u soo dhoweyso`},miller:{title:`Miller — kursi miyi oo dib loo soo celiyay`,body:`Aaggani wuxuu khariidadda ku jiraa Garsoore Dallas Miller awgiis, guddoomiyaha guddida. Lifaaq uu ku daray warbixinta kama-dambaysta ah, wuxuu qoray in haddii Golaha Sharci dejintu uusan aqbali doonin gooyitaanka laba riding oo miyi ah, ay tahay inuu beddel ku daro laba kursi — oo uu ka tago 89 ilaa 91 — oo dib u soo celiyo. Wuxuu tilmaamay meeshan, agagaarka degmooyinka Clearwater iyo galbeedka Mountain View ee galbeedka Red Deer, inay tahay halka mid ka mid ah kursiyadaas miyiga ah uu aadi lahaa. Waxa laga sawiray khadadka degmada sida meel-ku-meel ah, ma aha xuduud rasmi ah, ilaa guddida xigta ay dib u sawirto khariidadda.`},flags:{"banff-town":{title:`Banff — magaalada laga gooyay beeyada`,body:`Banff waxay ku taal beey qaran federaal ah, sida jasiirad magaalo yar. Inta yar waxay magaalada la kooxeysaa Canmore — magaalada xigta ee Bow Valley — ee "Canmore-Kananaskis," waxayna ka tagaa beeyada aan la deganayn sida riding-ka qaada magaca Banff. Xuduudku wuxuu duubaa magaalada maxaa yeelay waa meesha kaliya ee dad ku nool yihiin mayl badan. Waxay u eg tahay khalad, laakiin waxay raacdaa juquraafi dhab ah.`},"banff-park":{title:`Waqooyiga Banff — "Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park"`,body:`"Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park" waa mid ka mid ah riding-yada la soo jeediyay ee inta yar, oo inta badan ka kooban beey qaran oo aan la deganayn; magaalada Banff waxay ku taal riding deris ah oo koonfur ah. Inta yar waxay ku dabaqday xukunka dadnimo-yar ee Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada riding-kan — doorasho uu guddoomiyaha guddidu kaga hadlay warbixinta kama-dambaysta ah.`},"airdrie-split":{title:`Airdrie — afar jeexan`,body:`Korriinka Airdrie iyo safarkeeda Calgary (qiyaastii 76% ka mid ah kuwa dibadda u shaqeeya) waxay xidhi karaan hal kursi cusub oo Airdrie-agagaareed — nooca xogtu taageerto. Inta yar waxay taas beddelkeeda magaalada ku kala qaybisaa afar riding; xisaabta dadnimadu uma baahna, soo gudbinna ma soo jeedin. Tijaabada saxeexa-jeexitaanka ee hubinta kala-qaybintan afarta-jaho waxay buuxisaa shuruud kasta — dadka Airdrie waxay ku dhammaadaan tiro yar afarta riding oo dhan, oo aan jirin kursi ay magaaladu xakameyso — halka kala-qaybinta laba-jaho ee inta badan aanay midna muujin. Tani waa kala-qaybin bulsho, oo aan u muuqan tijaabooyinka caddaaladda xisbiyeed; hubintu waxay cabbirtaa saamaynta qaab-dhismeed, ma aha niyada. (Acadeemig §5.3.2.)`},"nolan-hill-cochrane":{title:`Calgary-Nolan Hill–Cochrane`,body:`Safarka Cochrane ee Calgary wuxuu xaqiijin karayey in lala xidho magaalada — laakiin xogta safar-shaqo ee 2021 waxay flow-kaas ku faafisaa magaalada oo dhan (qiyaastii saddex-meelood codbixiyayaasha; kalabar gudaha Cochrane ayaa shaqeeya) mana tilmaamayso Nolan Hill. Corridor-ka cidhiidhsan ee inta yar ee ku aada ward-ka Nolan Hill — qaabka uu guddoomiyuhu ugu yeedhay lasso — wuxuu gaadhaa ka fog xogta, soo gudbinna ma soo jeedin. Hubintu waxay tan u akhrida jeexitaan-u-dhow: waxay nuugtaa codka Cochrane, laakiin Cochrane (qiyaastii 34,000) aad bay u yar tahay kursi u gaar ah, sidaa darteed way ka joogsataa calaamad jeexitaan rasmi ah. (Acadeemig §5.3.2.)`},"olds-airdrie-reach":{title:`Olds–Three Hills–Didsbury — gaadhitaanka Airdrie`,body:`Riding miyi ah oo haya magaalooyinka Waddada 2 — Olds, Didsbury, Three Hills — wadajir si fiican ayaa loo taageeray; dadka Beiseker-agagaareed ayaa qoray taageero. Waxay ku sii jiri kartay bulshooyinkaas gudahooda. Nooca inta yar wuxuu taas beddelkeeda koonfur u gaadhaa cidhifka woqooyi ee Airdrie, balaadhin aan xisaabta dadnimadu u baahnayn. Gaadhitaanku waa qayb ka mid ah sida kala-qaybinta afarta-jaho ee Airdrie u shaqeyso — qayb kasta oo Airdrie ah oo lagu daro kursi miyi oo ka weyn — taas oo hubintu u akhrido qayb ka mid ah qaabka jeexitaanka. (Acadeemig §5.3.2.)`},chestermere:{title:`Chestermere — u kala qaybsan laba riding`,body:`Safarka culus ee Chestermere ee Calgary (86% ka mid ah kuwa dibadda u shaqeeya) wuxuu taageeri karayey in la sii hayo oo magaalada loo dhoweeyo — taas oo dadka ka soo horjeeday ku-biiritaanka Calgary ay sidoo kale rabeen. Inta yar waxay taas beddelkeeda qayb koonfureed ku jeexaysaa degmo Calgary gaar ah oo aanay wadaagin iskuul ama gaadiid, jeexitaankaasna wuxuu ku dhacaa tijaabada dadnimada. Hubintu waxay daadiska degmo Calgary u akhrida jeexitaan-u-dhow — kala-qaybin danta-bulsho oo nuugta codka Chestermere iyada oo aan gaadhin calaamad jeexitaan rasmi ah. (Acadeemig §5.3.2, §5.8.4.)`},"red-deer":{title:`Red Deer — riding-yada hybrid-ka ah`,body:`Xidhiidhka gobolka ee Red Deer ee Blackfalds, Sylvan Lake, Lacombe iyo Innisfail wuxuu kooxeyn karayey magaalooyinkaas wadajir — xubin golaha magaalada iyo deganeyaal ayaa soo jeediyay hybrid la mid ah. Nooca inta yar wuxuu taas beddelkeeda qaybo magaalada lafteeda ku laabaa riding-yo magaalo-yar ay hoggaaminayaan, oo nuugaya codka Red Deer magaaleed; sababtiisa "iskuulada la wadaago" sidoo kale ma taagna (qaybinta iskuul oo kala duwan). Laabista magaalo riding-yo magaalo-yar ay hoggaaminayaan waa qaabka hubintu u tilmaanto hybridization — oo la jaan-qaadaya jeexitaan, oo gaadha saamaynta xisbiyeed gudaha riding-yada hybrid-ka ah halkii ay ka dhex gaadhi lahayd. (Acadeemig §5.3.5.)`},"st-albert":{title:`St. Albert — qaabab iska tartamaya`,body:`Nooca khariidad kasta ee St. Albert wuxuu ku saleysnaan karaa aasaas macquul ah. Hubintu si fudud waxay heshay soo gudbin aan taageereyn beddelka gaarka ah ee inta yar — maadaama muwaadiniinta naadiroobto ay magacaabaan xudduudaha saxda ah ee guddida, waxay caddaynta halkan u akhrida mid khafiif ah, oo aan si cad u taageereyn ama ka soo horjeeneyn.`},"calgary-zone-a-packing":{title:`Waqooyi & bari Calgary — calaamad urursi`,body:`Guddoomiyaha guddidu midkan ma uusan calaamadayn — xisaabta hubinta lafteeda ayaa sameysa. Waqooyi iyo bari Calgary (hubinta "Zone A," waqooyi iyo bari Webiga Bow), degmooyinka khariidadda inta yar waxay ka weyn yihiin celceliska gobolka qiyaastii 11.5%, marka loo eego 2.8% khariidadda inta badan. Urursi macnaheedu waa ku urursida codbixiyayaasha hal dhinac degmooyin yar oo ka weyn, sidaa darteed kaadi kastoodu wax yar bay miisaamaan; Zone A waa NDP-tartan, 13 ka mid ah 17 degmo waxaa ku guulaystay NDP 2023. Hubintu waxay cabbirtaa saamaynta qaab-dhismeed, ma aha niyada. (Acadeemig §5.3.1.)`}},text:{page_title:`Nooca qoraal ah — khariidadda Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta`,intro:`Tani waa nooca qoraal ah ee khariidadda firfircoon ee hubinta. Waxay sidaa isla macluumaadka khariidadda muuqaalka ah, oo loo qoray si loogu akhriyo qalab akhris-shaashad. Waxay ku bilaabataa xudduudaha hubintu calaamadaysay, ka dibna waxay liis-gareynaysaa degmo kasta iyo midkee khariidadood oo saddexda ah ay ku jirto.`,link_map:`Fur khariidadda firfircoon`,link_report:`Akhri warbixinta oo dhan`,link_to_text:`Fur nooca qoraal ee la heli karo ee khariidaddan`,toc_heading:`Boggan`,toc_summary:`Soo-koobid gaaban`,toc_flagged:`Xudduudaha la calaamadeeyay`,toc_directory:`Tusaha degmooyinka`,summary_heading:`Soo-koobid gaaban`,summary_p1:`Hubintu waxay is barbar dhigtaa saddex khariidadood oo ah degmooyinka doorashada Alberta: soo jeedinta inta-yar ee guddida, soo jeedinta inta-badan, iyo khariidadda la dejiyay ee 2019 oo maanta shaqaynaysa.`,summary_p2:`Tijaabooyinka qaab-dhismeedka ee hubintu hore u diiwaan-gelisay, oo isticmaala juquraafi keliya, khariidadda inta-badan midna kama gudbiso shantii xad, khariidadda inta-yarna afar shan ka mid ah ayey ka gudubtaa. Natiijooyinka tirakoobka ee kala-duwan, oo midkasta khariidadood ku barbar dhiga koox weyn oo khariidado dhexdhexaad ah oo kombuyuutar ku sawiray, waa kuwo bilow ah oo sugaya dib-u-eegis madax-bannaan oo khabiir ah.`,summary_p3:`Qaybaha hoose waxay sharxayaan sagaal xudduud oo gaar ah oo hubintu calaamadaysay, ka dibna waxay liis-gareynayaan degmo kasta. Boggani wuxuu qeexayaa booska tirakoobka iyo qaab-dhismeedka keliya. Gabagabo sharci ah kama gaadho khariidad kasta.`,flagged_heading:`Xudduudaha la calaamadeeyay`,flagged_lead:`Hubintu waxay calaamadaysay sagaal xudduud. Qaar way u muuqdaan kuwo cajiib ah laakiin si daacad ah ayey u raacaan juquraafi dhab ah; qaar kalena waxay la mid yihiin qaab urursi ama jeexitaan oo ku jira cabbiraadaha hubinta lafteeda. Mid kasta hoose ayaa lagu sharxay, oo leh tixraac qayb oo loo gudbiyo warbixinta acadeemiga ah meesha ay khusayso.`,directory_heading:`Tusaha degmooyinka`,directory_lead:`Shaxdani waxay liis-gareynaysaa magac kasta oo degmo oo ka soo muuqda mid kasta oo saddexda khariidadood ah, oo ku kala horreeya alifbeeto. Magac kasta waxay muujinaysaa in magacaasi qayb ka yahay soo jeedinta inta-yar, soo jeedinta inta-badan, iyo khariidadda la dejiyay ee 2019. Magacyada degmooyinku way ku kala duwan yihiin khariidadaha, sidaa darteed saf qaar waxay ka soo muuqdaan hal ama laba oo kaliya. Shaxdu waxay haysataa magacyada iyo xubinnimada khariidadda keliya — wadarta codadka, tirooyinka dadnimada, iyo natiijooyinka tijaabada, fiiri warbixinta oo dhan.`,directory_totals_note:`Tiro kasta waa wadarta codadka qof-ahaaneed (maalinta doorashada) ee degmadu ku lahayd khariidaddaas — isugeynta goobaheeda codbixinta. Codadka hore iyo kuwa gaarka ah looma qoondeeyo aag codbixin kasta, sidaa darteed halkan kuma jiraan; natiijooyinka oo dhammeystiran eeg warbixinta. Jeexitaan (—) wuxuu ka dhigan yahay in magaca degmadu uusan ka soo muuqan khariidaddaas.`,col_district:`Degmo`,col_minority:`Soo jeedinta inta-yar`,col_majority:`Soo jeedinta inta-badan`,col_2019:`Khariidadda rasmiga ah`,present_yes:`Haa`,present_no:`Maya`,methodology_note:`Boggani waa u dhigma khariidadda firfircoon oo go’an oo qoraal-kaliya ah. Waxaa laga dhisay isla xogta degmooyinka iyo isla calaamadaynta xudduudaha. Natiijooyinka tirakoobka (ensemble-dhexdhexaad) ee halkan lagu tixraacay waa kuwo bilow ah oo sugaya dib-u-eegis madax-bannaan oo khabiir ah.`,skip_to_main:`U bood nuxurka ugu weyn`,back_to_map:`Ku noqo khariidadda firfircoon`}},feedback:{nav_link:`Dir jawaab-celin`,page_title:`Dir jawaab-celin`,meta_description:`La wadaag sax, su’aal, ama soo jeedin ku saabsan Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta.`,heading:`Dir jawaab-celin`,intro:`Ma aragtay khalad, su’aal ma qabtaa, ama ma rabtaa inaad soo jeediso hagaajin? Tani waxay si toos ah u gaadhaysaa qoraaga. Magaca iyo iimaylka waa ikhtiyaari — kaliya ka tag iimayl haddii aad jeclaan lahayd jawaab.`,name_label:`Magaca`,name_optional:`ikhtiyaari`,name_placeholder:`Magacaaga`,email_label:`Iimayl`,email_optional:`ikhtiyaari`,email_placeholder:`you@example.com`,email_hint:`Kaliya waxaa loo isticmaalaa in laguugu jawaabo. Marna lama wadaago, marnana lagama daro liis kasta.`,message_label:`Fariin`,message_required:`loo baahan yahay`,message_placeholder:`Maxaad noo sheegi lahayd?`,submit:`Dir jawaab-celin`,submitting:`Waa la dirayaa…`,success_title:`Mahadsanid`,success_body:`Jawaab-celintaada waa la helay. Haddii aad ka tagtay cinwaan iimayl ah oo fariintaaduna u baahan tahay jawaab, waad maqli doontaa.`,send_another:`Mid kale dir`,error_empty:`Fadlan geli fariin ka hor inta aanad dirin.`,error_rate:`Waxaad dhawaan dirtay fariimo dhowr ah. Fadlan isku day mar kale wax yar ka dib.`,error_generic:`Wax baa qaldamay markii la dirayay jawaab-celintaada. Fadlan isku day mar kale daqiiqad gudaheed.`,privacy_note:`Fariintaada si ammaan ah ayaa loogu kaydiyaa Canada waxaana loo isticmaalaa kaliya in lagu hagaajiyo hubintan. Eeg {privacy} faahfaahin.`,privacy_link_text:`siyaasadda asturnaanta`,back_to_report:`Ku noqo warbixinta`,back_to_map:`Ku noqo baadhaha khariidadda`}};export{e as default};